  56033: "Inkinnah keenik mataggiriqqa,yemeexeege uddur mali,faxe uddur tet faxeenik fanat gaca hoore mayan",
  56034: "Fayyaya Fidooday Gaqaadid amol obbimta elle tan ",
  56035: "Nanu galab akak xaggiime Cuuru aw Intiita qadooh akak naba Agbu  barritime weennal ginna",
