  56040: "Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay Mucammad Ummatak butta,is illacaboh Ummata",
  56041: "Guri marii-woo mari isinni Kitooba isinni Gurittek akah tamcawwe mara-ma xxo keenik gurraa kee mandabba umah ",
