  56051: "51-52Diggah tokkeek isin ugutma dirabbooseenitow,massaggitakmakkooweeni tow-Qhiyaamah Ayro Zaqhqhuum Caxah miru akmetton,toh umaaneh lafittaay gacca iyya Caxa mmiru",
  56052: "51-52Diggah tokkeek isin ugutma dirabbooseenitow,massaggitakmakkooweeni tow-Qhiyaamah Ayro Zaqhqhuum Caxah miru akmetton,toh umaaneh lafittaay gacca iyya Caxa mmiru",
  56053: "Sin Baagay foyyak tani,too qeero lecaxak kibetton  ",
  56054: "Teetik amol laqin Leey laqna akak gibda taaqabo kinniton",
  56055: "Leebbakar Lakimih Gaali maqab akah yaymaggennah,isin kay maqaba ayma ggetton ",
  56056: "Taa qeerole Maaqoo kee laqin Leek galab akak xaggiimem,ken qibnaytiinoy Qhiyaamah Ayro elle ken garaytimaana",
  56057: "Dirabbooseenitow-anewayak teneenik wadiril nanu sin ginne,sin rabakk wadi !?ril nanu sin ugusennom nummaasinnitoonuy",
  56058: "!?Sinaamey-Xiixoxxak Agbih Maganat gasiytanwak tubleenii",
  56059: "!?Too Xiixoxxi isin gintaanannaa,hinnammay kaa gintam nee",
  56060: "Nanu sin fanal raba mekelleh,siinik ummaanih tii udduruy,aakume sinnihh udurrute sinni le,nanu taffaro hinnino",
  56061: "Ginoo kee miicuk isin bagul akak taniinimiy,teexegeenik sin korisnaah,Ginoo kee miicuk isin aaxigewaytaanamah sin ginnam manaffara ",
  56062: "Qimbô Gino mannal ginnem diggah teexegeenih,qimbowwak sin ginam xiiqe Yalli,sin rabak wadiril sin ugusam xiqeleemil cubbi mageytaanaay mataaxi !?gaana",
  56063: "!?Dariyyuk Baaxot qiddaanam tubleeni",
  56064: "!?Woo dariyyu taysubukem siininnaa,kaa taysubukem nee",
  56065: "Alaysoo kee gufiyya maaddam xayyowtek wadiril,too-Buqre buruurukuussa ha ynam faxinnino,buruuruka kaa abak nen,tohuk wadiril kaa geyteemil cakkum sattaanam akkuk tenen",
  56066: "Nanu neceemik baxaysinnaamal digaalimnah intan",
  56067: "Inkinnah nanu Rizqhik baxaysiteeniti ",
  56068: "!?Bakaarittanwak akak taaquben Lee tubleenii",
  56069: "Qaraanal tan Qamburrek isin tet oobisseeninnaa,hinnammay nanu tet oobisne",
  56070: "Woo Lee gibdi Qasboleeh,maqabaa kee efeqyah edde xoqoysima waana tet abnam faxonninoo, gibdi Qasbo Lem tet abak nen,siinih racmatiyyah salfa luk  tet oobiseemil Yalla faatitinnitoonuy",
  56071: "!?Isinni xoqoysoh aw ttuxxiqih urussan Gira tubleenii",
  56072: "Gira akak ursunta Caxa gintem siininnaa,hinnammay siinih xammacoowiyyah !?nanu tet ginne",
  56073: "Nanu siinih ta Gira kassittoy Akheerâ Gira sin kassissa abne,siinik gaqaadiyyi marah xoqoyso tet abne",
  56074: "Farmoytaw-ku Rabbiy naba kaah ceelewayya haytaamak kaa saytunnos",
  56075: "Yalli Cutuukah aroocaa kee tet radimeenaanil xiibite",
  56076: "Diggah ta radimeenaanil xiibitiyyak-nabna aaxiginnitoonu nabah,who akah kinnim,Aayatittee kee cubbitteetay loowo sinni wohih addat taniimi",
  56077: "Sinaamey-diggah siinil kawsima Qhur-aan-meqe Qhur-aana,toh naba tuxxiqi ttey kaat tanik gexxaama ",
  56078: "Sinam Intiitak daccarsime Kitaabih addal yan,usuk daccarsime Luucu",
  56079: "Zambittee kee qaybittek saytunnowte Malaa-ikaak kalih mari kaa maxaga",
  56080: "Ginoonâ Rabbik Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay Mucammadal obbiime",
  56081: "!?Yallat tasgalloy-isin ta Yab dirabboseenitiiy manummaseenitii ",
  56082: "Niqmatak siinih yimmireemil Yallah abtan faatitiyya diggah isin dirabbossaa nam abtaanaa,Rob Cutukta fan qikissan,tonnah yan Cutuktaay tonnah yan Cutuk !?tah roobinne intan ",
  56083: "Ugutmammascassoosik baali galab xagga heewak,Raba isinnik hooraanamih effer loonumih mascassal,gacsiyyal le kayxiqtol garci kalam faxe,rabise manno ysam xiiqé <br/> Rooci Goroyra gufawakaa  ",
  56084: "Isin too uddur siinik foocal rabanum tableenih",
  56085: "Nanu ni ixxigay,ni xiqtoo kee ni Malaa-ikah,sin raboytat siinik xayinoh,takkay ikkah ta Malaa-ika isin matablan",
  56086: "Isinni taamal gallatimtaanaggidah,ugutewaamara-akah taxxaccen innah tekkee nik ",
  56087: "!?Isin Nummeynit tekkeenik ta roociy sin raboytak yawqe kaat gacisettoo nuu  woh maduddan",
  56088: "Raboyti Khayri fan taakamonnum yakkekaa tekkekii",
  56089: "Teetik adiriik taqabi akak anewaa rufto aw raacat le,meqe Rizqhii kee Racma ttale kay Nafsi faxxa hayta Niqmat elle geyta Jannatle  ",
  56090: "90-91Raboyti migdi marih num yekkekii,oson salaam kee amaan loonuk,ken caagidih magxitin",
  56091: "90-91Raboyti migdi marih num yekkekii,oson salaam kee amaan loonuk,ken caagidih magxitin",
  56092: "Raboyti Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay,Farmoyti baahem dirabbooseeni tiiy,massaggitak makkooweenit marih num yekkekii ",
  56093: "Kay Qibnaytiinoh elle kaa garayaanam,laqin Leey kaxxam laqna gibda",
  56094: "Jaciim diqsitta Giral cararow le",
  56095: "Farmoytaw-diggah tahay kol gabbaqnee-asmat le Ckkiy bohoy edde anewaa",
  56096: "Ku Rabbiy nabamigaq saytunnos,nakuusatittek kaa saytunnos",
  57000: "Suuratul Cadiid\nMadiinah imi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nNafsitte Iimaan keeYallih Gitah yaceenimil fayya haanama aw tet dalisaanam\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  57001: ",Yallaa,kay Ginok Qaranwaa kee Baaxol tanim kaa saytunnosseeh,tiysiriyeh  usuk maysoliy inkitti akak aysewaa,isi ginoo kee caggudusiyyal Naggara",
  57002: "Qaranwaa kee Baaxoh Abbootan dubuh usuk le,Faxe tiyay mannoosam faxe ma nnoosah,faxetiyay rabisam faxe rabisah,usuk ummaanimil xiqliiy,tu mayaffara",
  57003: ",Usuk Naharsittuuy kaak afat tu matan,usuk illacaboytay kaak wadirit tu ma tan usuk ifah yanooy aw daga raaqeey kaak daga tu matan,usuk qelliteey aw qellut tanim yaaxagiiy,kaak xaynah umam matan",
  57004: "Woo-usuk Lica Ayroy Acaadak qimbisseeh,jumqatti Ayrol gaba kalteh addat Qaranwaa kee Baaxo gine,usuk Intibbixiqqak daggowwa intah gidel tet ginam xiiqah,tokkeek kaay yisriye is ceela fayya axciyyah Qarshik amol,kaay yisriye daga gaceeh fayyaye,Roobuuy,Dariyyuuy,ken Nammayak kalah taniimik Qaraa nak obtam yaaxigeh,taabukeemiiy,Maqaadiniiy ken Nammayak kalah taniimik teetik tawqem yaaxigeh,Robkee Wacyiiy,ken Nammayak kalah taniimik Qaraa nak obtaa maay,Malaa-ikaay,Naqoo sattaamaa kee ken Roocittek kay addal  tawqem yaaxigeh,Sinaamey ixxigah usuk elle aninnaan ikkel sinlihyan,sin taa mak tu kaak maqellitta,teetil sin galatele",
  57005: "Qaranwaa kee Baaxoh Abbootan aw reeda dubuh usuk le,caagiida dubuh kaa fan taduure,Qhiyaamah Ayro Ginok cisab abele,ken taamal ken galatele",
  57006: "Bar Loqol culusaah Dite tamaate,Sinam xintah,Loqo Baral culusaah Ifi yamaa teeh Sinam isi taamah fan gexxa,usuk isiNaqoosah Alilwat tanim yaaxgi,ohuk   tu kaak maqellitta",
  57007: "Yallal eemena.kay Farmoytal eemena,Yalli ciggiileenit sin elle abe Maalak  ucuya,Yalli gita siinih elle abennal edde taamittaanama,siinik woomaray   ,Yallal yeemeneeh,isinni Maal Yallih Gitah yecee,kaygaril naba galato lon    woh Jannata",
  57008: "Yallal yaamineenimik sin hortam macaay?! Farmoyti sin Rabbiy yisriyel taami neenimih qaagoh Yallafan sin seeca,Moominiin tekeenik sin Abbobtih xiixoo xak sin yeyyeeqewak,kaal taaminoonah diggah Yalli Ateeban aw Xagana siinik beeh",
  57009: "Usuk Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay,isi Naqasi Mucammadal baxxaqqale Aayatitte oobisa,toh Koroosinnaa kee iggimâ Diteetak,Iimaan kee ixxigah Ifu ffan sin yayyaaqeggida,diggahYalli isi Nabiyyi tirra heey,aydukumuseh sin fan ruubewak,siinih xuwaaweey,siinih racmate",
  57010: "Yallih Gitah taceenimik sin waassam aw hortam macaay?! Qaranwaa kee Baa xonnara Yallile,Moominiiney-siinik Makki fakkiimaamak afal,isinni Maalu Yallih Gitah,kay kacanu edde faxak yeceeh,Islaaminnaccatoh Korosut Qeebi abee,faxe maray fakimik wadiril yeceeh,Korosut Qeebi abee,tittallih mama  ssoowan,too maray fakimik afal yeceeh,Yallih Gitah yingiicillee,kay fakimik wadiril isinni Maalu kay Gitah yeceeh,Korosut Qeebi abek aracah nabaah caddoh fayyaya,diggah Namma butta inkih Yalli Jannatah ken xagnise,Yalli   isin taamittaanam yaaxagi,sintaamak tu kaak maqellittaay,teetil sin galatele ",
  57011: "Isi Nafsiik ikcinna heeh,isi Maal Yallih foocah taaceem iyyaay?isi Maalak yeceem Yalli dubleh kaah yacuh,Qhiyaamah Ayro meqe galato le,woh Jannata",
  57012: "Lab Moominiin kee Say Moominiin ken ifu,ken Foocittee kee Migdittel keenik afat tabluwayta Ayro,woo Ayroh addat:alqo sin Aydukuma Jannatittey,tet Kal qatittee kee tet Cooxuk guba Illaltitte akak gexxaah,addal akak waaraana,too gala to naba galtoy,tet innah tan galato matana  ",
  57013: ",Yalli woo Ayrot Moominiin gurrat yaabewak,Munaafiqhiin gurrat yaabeeh :iyyeh <br/> Lab Munaafiqhiin kee Say Munaafiqhiin yeemene marak: Gital aw Siraatal   ,tabiyyah nee cattaamal sin Ifuk iffoysitnam qaagoh nee qambaala iyyan Ayro  Mu naafiqhiinik keenil anqasiyyah:edde iffoysittan Ifu wadirih uduuray gorrisa kee nik yaxcen,kenfanat Gaso tumuggure,too-Gaso afale,addak Moominiin le kati akak Racmatta,irok Munaafiqhiin lekabuk digaala",
  57014: "Munaafiqhiin Moominiinih:Islaaminnaa kee Taaqal sinlih mananninoo?! axcuk  deerisan,Moominiin:yeey, nelluk sugteenih keenik inte,takkay ikkah isinni Naf sitte Nifaaqhat fitna teetit abteeniih,tet bayisseenih,Koroosinna ifah taysixxigee niggidah, Moominiinih gacaanam qambalten,Moominiinih Yalli aba catooy, ra bak wadirih ugutmat bohoy inten,isin wohih bagul anuk Rabi siinil yaamaatem fan,dirab baakeritte sin duquurusseh,Yallal Sheetan sin duquuruseh ",
  57015: "Munaafiqhiiney-alqo Yallih digaalak nado siinik mabeyyimta,ifah Yallal ko  roosite marak nado mabeyyimta,sin kee Koros gaceena Gira,is siiniih taguude aw awlah siinih raqtaah,isin teetih awlah raqtan,maxxo uma gaceena",
  57016: "Woomaray,Yallal yeemeneeh,kay Farmoytal yeemenee,Qhur-aanak meqem xa ,gaganaa kee uman xaganak obteemil,ken Sorkocoxxaylo edde xammacowtaah Yallay yisriyeh galab xagol digga edde inta uddur makkinnaa,kafnah Yahuuduk Tawraat akah temcewweh marih inna edde akkewaanaah,Nasaarak Injiil akah ,temcewwe marih inna Sorkocoxxaylôkafnah edde akkewaan uddur makkinnaa woo mari kenkee ken Ambiyah fanal uddr keenil yexxeexeh,tohih sabbatah Sor kocoxxaylo keenik kafteh,keenik mango mari Yallih Taaqaak Yallih maq siyat !?fan yewqen toomarih inna edde akkewaan uddur makkinna ",
  57017: "Is kaftek wadiril tet aysubukiyyal,Yalli Baaxo yaynuwuyem ixiga,Sinaamey qakkalowtaanamih qaagoh,Yallih xiqtoo kee kay inkittiinol mascassoosii kee alhumitte diggah siinih baxxaqisneh,diggah woo rabtek wadiril Baaxo yuynu wwuye Yallii,sin rabak wadiril sin ugusam xiiqe,tet kafnak wadiril,sin Sorko coxxayloxxaylo xamcinim abam xiiqé",
  57018: "Diggah isinni Maalak baali sadagah yace Lab marii,isinni Maalak baali sada ,gah yacee Saymari,woomaray ken Nafsittet muquk,loowo aw abelliyo sinnim aza sinnim yacee,ken taamah gabaggacsi dubleh keenih gacaah:maqaane tet innah taniimik Tabanaay,Malcina boolih duble fan,mango dubleela fan keenih haan,tohulluk Yallih garil meqe galato loonuuh,toh Jannata",
  57019: "WoomarayYallal yeemeneh,ken fan baxisekkah kayFarmoytitil yeemenee,too marii oson nummeyniti,Yallih qangarah naddooweeniti,isinni Rabbih garil gul guluh keenih gacte isinni galtoy meqe lon,Qhiyaamah Ayro isinni Ifuy keenik Foocittey,migdittel keenik gexa lon,woo maray Yallal koroositeeh,kay Farmoy titil koroositeeh,ni Farmoytal obbimte ni Aayatitte dirabboosee,toomari Jaciim diqsitta Girah mara,tet addal elle waareenit tikka iyyaanah Qhiyaamah Ayro tet culan,teetik mayawqan",
  57020: "Addooniyâ mano digiriy Dagar elle digira,aylahuuy Sorkocoxxaylo elle aylahi tta,bilqay edde bilqittaana,tet addal Abbootan kee makmok maaqabok taniimil tittin fanal edde titirissan,Maali mangaa kee Xaylommangah fakaraksah akim ,akkewaytam ixiga,Roobuy kaat toobokem Buqre-aba akak tossokooteh bisi  tokkeek taa anxaxiniih,toobokeh mangom sugekkah kafta,Yablow-anxaxinaanak wadiril walqinih table,tokkeek Yalli bokokay yaddigigille tet aba,Koros kee Munaafiqhiinih Akheeral gibdi digaala tan,isi Naqoosay Moominiinih tanih  Zam bitteh,Yallakcabsotuuy kaak kacani yan,Addooniyâ mano katta makmok maa qaboy angar gar aalle sinnikkah akim hinna,faxe numuy tet makmok maa  qaboy katta Akheerâ Niqmatal yiysiisee,usuk baxysiteeh foyyaateh",
  57021: "Sinaamey-meqe taamoomiy sin Zambik Cabsot elle geytaanak,mandabbaay  wohuk kalahtan xayyoosaasi aw Yallafan xayyoossaamah fan omookoma  Jannatay bagbaggih Qaranwaa kee Baaxoggid yakke geytoonuh,tittak omoo  koma,ta Jannat Yalli kaal yeemeneeh,kay Farmoytiitl yeemene marah gulguluh tet hee,too galto Yallih muxxoy isi Naqoosak isih faxemarah yacee,Yallay yisriye isi Naqoosay Moominiinih tanil muxxoli",
  57022: "Qabaaraay,wohuk kalah taniimik Baaxol tikka inta faxe umaane matan,faxe umaaney ken Nafsittel ken geyta matan,toh kay Ginoyta ginnak dumal daccar sime Luucl tingirgireh akkewaytek,diggah toh Yallal xamcinih",
  57023: "Sinaamey-toh-siinik tuftuceemil rookite waytoona,Niqmatittek siinih yeceemih sababal nahadewaytoona aw dikkak tatura farcat abewaytoona,Yalli kaah yece emih sabbatah ummaan Sinaamal kaxxiteh,tirtirise diggah Yalli kaa makicna  ",
  57024: "Woo-maray yaceenim dirkih keenil tanil cillalloowaah,isinnik kalah yanmara cillaalel amrisa baxaysiteeniti,faxe numuy Yallih Taaqat darre cabe biyaakam ,isikkah Yallak mali,diggah Yalli Gaddaali,isi Naqoosah Taaqah magxita ummaanih gurral faylime",
  57025: "Baxxaqqale alhumittee kee ifale mascassoosil diggah ni Farmoytit rubneh,Ki tooba kenlih oobisne,Miidaan kenlih oobisne,toh Sinam Qadlil soltaggida,Bi riitay caylale biyak le oobisne,Silac kaak bicciima,gabannaggarinnih taamaa kee ken mihretih tuxxiq kaat yan,Yalli Naqoosah tambulluye ixxigah isi Naqoo sak qellut iyyi kaacatam yaaxigeggida,diggah Yallicaylaliiy, maysoli,tu kaak mataysa,tu mayaffara  ",
  57026: "Nagayna ken Nammayal tanay diggah Nuuc kee Ibraahiim rubneh,Ambiyinnet kee obbimte Kitooba,ken Nammayih samadit hayne,ken Nammayih samadik   koo bahsimeeh massggitafan tirrayé yan,keenik mango mari Yallih Taaqak tawqó",
  57027: "Tokkeek ni Farmoytit katasneh,kataatayah ken Ummatittefan ken rubne Qiisa Maryam Baxa keenil katasneeh,Injiil kaah necee,kaal yeemeneeh,kaa kataye marih Sorkocoxxaylot xuwaw kee Racmatta hayne,tittin fanal tittin kicanu lee laay,tittal racmatak yenen,isinni Diinit dikkak tatur bicisen,Rihim kee salfa ,leemik Yalli keenih xiqsiiseemik baali cabeenih,woh keenik messerinnino Diinit bicso bicisiyyah isinnih isinni Nafsi yixibixen,keenik esserrem akim hinnay Yallih kacanu katayaanama,edde yinxibbixeenimit isinnil heenit Cakki soltih masoolinnon,keenik woo maray yeemeneh,ken galato necee, keenik man go mari Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaaltanay kay Farmoyti Mucammad baahem dirabboosiyyal,Yallih taaqak yewqe mara yekken",
  57028: "Yallal yeemeneeh,keenih Diinil taamite maraw,kay amritte xakabaanam kee kaywaasoosak waaliyaanamal Yallak meysita,kayFarmoytal eemene,Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay Mucammadal abten aaminiyyaa kee tookome  Farmoytitil abten aamaniyyal,galtoo kee gabaggacsak Namma maglab siinih acee le,Addooniyâ manol tirra edde intaanaah,Akheeral Qhiyaamah Ayro Gital edde iffoysittan ifu siinih abele,Zambi siinih cabeleeh,tet siinih asturele,teetil sin ma yabbixa,Yallay yisriye isi Naqoosah cabeey,keenih racmate",
  57029: "Moominiiney-gulguluh siinih hayneemil ni muxxoy naba diggah siinih baxxaqi sneh,Yahuud kee Nasaarak Kitable maray yookome,Yallih muxxo isnnih faxen marah yacoonuuy,isinnih faxan maral kalitoonuh,diggah oson Yallih muxxok tu xiqewaanam aw tu gabat allewaanam yaaxigeeniggida,diggah muxxo Yallay yi sriyeh gabat taniih,isi Naqoosak isih faxe marah yacee,Yalli naba muxxoliiy,isi Naqoosak isih faxe mara elle dubboosa",
  58000: "Suuratul Mujaadala\nMadiinah imi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nKaa xaguraanamal aynabiyyaa kee kaa sadaanamak takkawsiyyah,Yallih ixxiga ummaanim addat tabbixeeh,duddale marot tabbixem ifah aybulluyiyyi elle yan \n•    Tafsiiri:",
  58001: "Farmoytaw-isi Baqlih caagidil Yiinah Xiixox yol takkay iyyewak (usuk Awsi Saamit Baxaay) koo gacaa cissa Brrah Yab( is Khawla Saqlab Baxaay)Diggah Yalli yoobbeh,tet Baqli teetik abaamak isi Rabbih fan weeqa haysitta,Yalli sin Nammay Yaabat tittal gacsawak yaaxigeh,tu kaak maqellitta,diggah Yalli isi Naqoosah Yab yaabbiiy,ken taama yaaxigi,teetik tu kaak maqellitta",
  58002: "Woo maray isinni Agabuk xiixoxoosee,wohiyyaanam keenik tiyak teeni isi Qasaalak atu yol yiinah Xiixoxih inna iyya,ta Yaabal oson dirab yeceen, ken  ,Qasaala ken Inonti hinna,ken Inonti woo ken xale Say marakkah akimara hinna diggah oson woh iyyanwak qax umaah,diraabah Yaabah yaaban,aw dirab ma xca iyyan,Zambik saytunnoysiyyah Luuqusá aw kaffaara keenih hee",
  58003: "Woo maray taa qax uma Yab yaabaa,tokkeek xiixooxisso akak aben Agabut angaaraw abam faxa,keenil fidoh orbaanamak afal Naqasu currusaanamal isi nnik luuqusaanam keenil tan,too galab akak xaggiime madqal akah ammirsim teenim Xiixooxissok xiixiyimtoonu aw xaggursumtoonu,Yalli isin abtaanam yaaxigi,sin taamak tu kaak maqellitta",
  58004: "Siinik faxe numuy Currusa Naqasu geewe, Xiixooxisso akak abe isi Qasaalal fidoh orbak afal,Namma Alsa kataatayah yasoomem kaal tan,faxe numuy nam  ,ma Alsa kataatayah yasoomem xiqewee,lactam tu dagoyta yaskamem kaal tan too madqooqiy madaqne Yalli amriseeh elle taaminoona madaqne,kay amri ,xakabtoonaay,kay Farmoyta kataytoona abne,too madqooqiy Diini siinih abne Yallih dikkookiy isi Naqoosah wadoyoyseey,teetik matatrina",
  58005: ",Dumih Ummatittey kay Naqboyta tekke akah tuqunxuyeeh addah akah gactenah Diggah woo maray Yallaa kee kay Farmoytak Naqboytit yakke  yuqunxuyee niih,gactin tinooteenih,diggah baxxaqqale Aaya titte oobisne,Yallaay,kay Far moytit kee Aayatittel koroosite mari tasqunxuye digaala lon",
  58006: "Yalli inkih ken ugusu waa Ayroo, inkittu keenik macaba,Yalli keenil loowe aw daagise uma taamak Addooniyal abba heenim keenih warisele,ken taamak tu  kee nik mataftuca,oson tet habbeeleeniih,qunxam cabekkah kaxxam cabekkah lowwa hayteh tibbixeh akkewaytek,cabtam  sinni ken Kitoobal unkuttubba teh geen,Yalli umma imil boositeey ken taamak tu kaak maqellitta",
  58007: "Farmoytaw-diggah Yalli Qaranwaa kee Baaxoh addal ennatam yaaxigem  matablaa,ken Nammayih addal taniimik tu kaak maqellitta,kaay yisriye ixxigal Ferey hayto keenik yekkeh akkewaytek,qellut Sidoc yaabay yakke mayan,kaay yisriye ixxigal Leceyye akak yekkeh akkewaytek Konooyuy qellut walala ma yan,ixxigah elle aninnaan ikkel kenlih yeneh akkewaytek,ixximah wohuk da  gom matan,wohuk mango mari mayan,ken Yaabak tu kaak maqellitta,tokkeek Qhiyaamah AyroYalli taamiteenim keenih warisele,diggah Yalli ummaanim yaaxigi,tu kaak maqellitta",
  58008: ",Farmoytaw-woo Yahuuduy Moomintu yablenwak garayak teneffan matabla ,Yalli garayik kenwaase,tokkeek oson Yalli ken akak waasemih fan yaduuren Moominiin camitiyyi innah taniimiy Zambi edde yanit tittin fanal garayan,kee  nil dikkak taturiyyi edde yaniimit garayan,Farmoyta yaqsiyeenim edde taniimit garayan,Farmoytaw-kol yameetenwak Yalli koh abewee salamta koh aban,is Raba edde acsubuk( Saam )kol yana inta ken maxca,Yallih Salat kee nagayna ,kaaltanay,Nabi dirabboosiyyah:innaamih sababah Yalli nee digaalelee? iyyan usuk yaxxaaceemil nummeyna akkinna nanu kaak innaamal Yalli nee digaalak yen!iyyan,iyyeenimil digaalah Jahannam ken duudah,tet laqnat ceyitaanah,ken mandabba maxxo uma mandabba",
  58009: "Woo Yallal yeemeneeh,usuk keenih hee Sharqil taamite maraw,Yahuud inna akkewaytaanaggidah,Zambiiy,aw dikkak taturuuy,aw Farmoyti maqsiyat edde yaniimil magarayina,YallihTtaaqa edde taniih,kay maqsiytak isinni edde yabbi xeenimit garaya,kay amritte xakabaanam kee kaywaasok waaliyaanamal Yallak meysita,cisab kee galatoh Qhiyaamah Ayro dubuh kaa fanah gaabowetton",
  58010: "Zambiiy,dikkak tatur kee Farmoyti maqsiyat addat tabbixeemil-garayaanamah  ,tu gactekm,isi loynitit Sheetan aba qax aymaaqiyyaa kee bohoytok tiyak teena akah abam oson keenil malisaanamih rooka Moominiinit culusaggida,Yallih fayxih tekkeh akkewaytek,Sheetan kee kay qax aymaaqiyyi Moominiinik tu kal tam hinna,Moomin inkih tan isinni caagidil Yallal qikitoonay",
  58011: "Yalli yabti addah adabat yabba iyyewak,daffeynaanih addal faxxiima adabat :yaabeeh,iyyeh <br/> Yallal yeemeneeh,usuk hee Diinil taamite maraw:daffeynaani faragga haa   siinik iyyeenik faragga tet haa,sin Addooniyaa kee Akheeral Yalli fargga siinil heele,sin daffeynaanik baalik muxxole mari elle daffeyaggidah fayyaxica siinik iyyeenik,teetik fayya inxeca,Yallay yisriye siinik yeemene maraa kee ixxiga akah temcewwe mara,naba caddoodal fayya haa,Yalli isin taamittaanam yaaxi geh,sin taamoomik tu kaak maqellittaay,teetil sin galatele",
  58012: " Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay,Nabiwwaday,Nabiggarayi yengenwak Yallii:yeemene maraw-Farmoytat tutucca intaanam faxxeenik,kallih tutuccah yabtaanamak afal Sadaga uysukuma,too Sadagah aysukumiyyi siinih Khayrii  kee saytunaaneh yayseh,akah taysem Yallih Taaqay Sorkocoxxaylo saytunno  ssa addat leemi,Sadagah taceenim wayteenik,tutucca kallih intaanamah zambi mali,diggah Yalli isi Naqoosah Zambi cabé,duudaanamaak kalih im keenil heewaawak,keenih racte iyye ",
  58013: "!?Farmoytallih garayteenik Sadaga tatrusaanamih sabbatah baacak meysitteen  teetik Yalli elle amrisem abewayteenik,tet cabtaanam siinih idnisewak,siinil  yendebbeh,Salat duddalennal baaha,isinni Maalih Zakaat ucuya,Yallaa kee kay Farmoyta eteeqa,Yalli isin taamittaanam yaaxigi,sintaamak tu kaak maqelli  ttaay teetil sin galatele",
  58014: "Farmoytaw-woo Munaafiqhiiniy,ken Koroosinnaa kee maqsiyatih sabbatah Yalli elle bakcarrite Yahuud loynit isik abte fan matablaa,ta Munaafiqhiin Moominiinik mayanin,Yahuuduk mayanin,inkinnah oson wonnak annakkah amarafan hinnon,woo marafan hinnon,diggah oson Muslimiin kinnoonuuh Yahuud fanah Muslimiin Xaagu beeweenimil xiibitaanah,oson isinni xiibat dirableela",
  58015: "Girak guba ullulluh ken culusawak,Yalli Akheeral gibda digaala gulguluh kee nih hee,diggah oson Addooniyal Koroosinni taamak amol akak sugeenim qax keenik toomeh",
  58016: "Koroosinni sabbatah qiddiime xaaxenwak,isinni Xiibay xiibitak yeneeni xag  ,roh haysiten,toh Islaaminna isinni Qabalitte edde xagroonu teetil ifa abenwaka Muslimiin boolaasiyyaa kee wadirih hayiyyak edde yeneenimik gexxaamah,Si nam Cakkik makeenih,tayqunxuye digaalay ken taquxuyeh addah ken hayta lon",
  58017: "Ken Maaluuy,ken Xayloo,Yallak tu keenih madudda,too mari Girammaraay,tet culaanaah tet addal inki waaraan, digaala keenik mataggiriqa ",
  58018: "Yalli inkih ken ugusuwaa Ayro,galtoh uguseh akkewaytek inkittu keenik maca ba,Koroosinnaa kee Nifaaqahl anewaak yeneeniih,Moominiiniy Yalli kicnaa mal taamitak yeneenikkah,akiimik abewaak yeneenimih Yallah xiibitan,Moomi niiney-Addooniyal siinih Muslimiin kinnoonumul akah xiibitak yenen innah Akheeral kaah xiibi telon,diggah osn ta Xiibay Yallal abaanal,tuy tuxxiq kee  nih bahtaah,aw umam keenik hortal yaniinim yakkalen,oobbooy,diggah oson num maak Addooniyal abak sugen isinni xiibaa kee Akheeral aban isinni Xii  bal dirableela",
  58019: "Sheetan xixxibaane li aw amol raaqe keenik yekkeeh,bohoy kenhayiyyat Yallih galab xago kenhawwenisiiseh,kaa taykeeceenemil mataamitinnon,taamiteenim ,kaa taykeece nem hinnay kaa tayneeqebeemi,toomaray tooweelol welloowee oson Ibliis Qandee kee kaa katayeeniti,oobbooy,diggah Ibliis Qandee kee kaa katayeenit, Addooniyaa kee Akheeral oson baxaysiteeniti,Tirto makotuy,Janna taay Girat kalen",
  58020: ",Diggah woomaray Yallak Naqboytit yakkeeh,kay Farmoytak Naqboyta yekkee Addooniyaa kee Akheeral Koros Ummatittey,Yalli yuqunxuyeeh,wacarriysi   met loowoh gacan   ",
  58021: "Yalli isi ixxigay tookomel,yoo kee yi Farmoytit,ni Naqboytitik alhum kee cay lah aysenno iyyaanam mekle,diggah Yalli isi Farmoytit catiyyal calali,mayso liiy,isi Naqboytitik cane gacisah ",
  58022: "Farmoytaw-Yallal yeemeneeh,Qhiyaamah Ayrol yeemene maray,Yallaa kee  kay Farmoytak naqboyta yekke mara kicna mageyta,taa Yallaa kee kay Farmoy ,tak Naqboyta yekkemari ken Abbobti yakkeenimih,aw ken Xaylo yakkeenimih aw kentooboko yakkeenimih,aw akah yaabuken Kedo lagoh edde qiktaana ya kkeemih,woh akah kinnim Iimaan Yallaa kee kayFarmoytih Naqboytit loynii  nuh haysitaanamak hoorah,Iimaan axaw aw titta liino inkih tan axawittek daga raaqtaah,tuk tittat bood uddur is taakume,too maray Yallaa kee kay Farmoytak Naqboytit yekke mara, xayi mara yakkeenimih Loyniinuh haysitewaa-oson  Yalli kenSorkocoxxaylol Iimaan akak yisgirgire maraay,mamilaagima,isik yan alhum kee Iful cayla ken bahsiise,Qhiyaamah Ayro tet kalqatittee kee Cooxuk guba,Illalti akak gexa daffeynâ Jannat kenculusele,tet addal inki elle yaadiyen, aw waraanah,tet Niqmat keenik mayaggiriqqaay,oson akak mayambaxan,inki nnah Yalli wadiriik ken akak anqibewaa kacanuh keenik yikcine,oson ambaxe sinni Niqmatak keenih yeceemil kaak yikcineenih,wohuk tiyak teena,kaay yis riye yableenimi,too galab akak xaggiimeemil welloysime marii,Yallih Qandey edde ken amrisem xakabtaah,akak waaseemik waasim ta,oobbooy,Addooniyaa kee Akheeral faxaanam geyaanaah,akak meysi taanamak yaftuceenimil diggah taturtem Yallih Qande",
  59000: "Suuratul Cashri\nMadiinah imi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nMoominiin titta geyik saduh,Yahuud kee Munaafiqhiin boolaasaamalYallih caylaa kee mayso ifah tumbulluyeeh,ken baxsi iffoowam elle tan \n•    Tafsiiri:",
  59001: "Ginok Qaranwah addal tanim kee Baaxol taniimik ummaanim,kaah ceelewayya haytaamak Yalla teynebeh,saytunnosseh,usuk maysoliy inkitti akak aysewaa,isi ginooy,isi Diinii kee isi caggudusiyyal Naggaara",
  59002: "Usuk woo Yallay,Nadhiirik rademaray Yallal Koroositeeh,Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaaltanay kayFar moyta dirabboosee,Madiinal ken Buxaaxik qimbo mmawqah,Madiinaak Shaamfan yeyyeeqe,oson Tawraat lemaray Yahuuduk ,yani,toh isinni xagana yiggileeniih,kaal Yallat tasgalloolih gaceenik wadiri ShaamBaaxofan ken yeyyeeqe,Moominiiney-oson nabnaa kee kalaluk leemik ,gexxaamah awqeloonum makkalinniton,oson diggah ken gasoosay xiseeni  Yallih umaanee kee digaalak ken hoorá yekkelen,isi Farmoyta Qeebi keenit abaanam kee ken yaysaarreeninimit amrisewak,Yallih umaane akak caggudu sewaan aw akak akkalewaan ikkeek keenil temeete,Yalli ken Sorkocoxxaylot gibda meysi culuse,isinni Buxaaxi Muslimiin edde xoqoysime waytaggidah addak yaggilen,Muslimiin irok tet taggile, Intiita le maraw aw Qaqhlile ma   raw ken Koroosinnih sabbatah keenil obteemil kas kassitto geya,ken galatoo  kee ken digaalay oson akah digaalimeeni geytaanak ken bisle mara makkina",
  59003: "Yalli ken Buxaaxik ken ayyaaqem keenil aktubewanna,Addooniyal qidim kee seewal ken digaalak yen,Akheeral Giraddigaalay inki addal akak waaraana   kenqam balta",
  59004: "Too keenit tekkem keenit akah tekkem isinni Koroosinnaa kee isinni xaganitte yaggileenimil,Yallak Naqboytit yekkeeniih kayFarmoytak Naqboy tit yakkee nimi,faxenumuy Yallak Naqboyta yakkeh,Yalli digaala gibdaah,kaydiga alay gibda kaa geele",
  59005: "Moominiin buttay-Nadhiirik rade marih gaadul Yallih Naqboytit edde taynee qeebbeeniggidah,Naklik tirgiqeenim aw edde xoqoysimtaanaggidah buxuuxal soolak cabteenim Yallih amri,oson akah yexxeccen innah Baaxol umaane abi ,yyak loowoh tanim hinna, Yahuuduk kay taaqak yewqeh xagana yiggile maray Xagna kibiyyi gital ganoggita doorite Yalli elle yayqunxuyeggida ",
  59006: "Woo Yalli Ndhiirik rade marih Maaluk isi Farmoytal gacisemiy,kay goranah Faarisik,Gaalak edde fertaanam elle maxoxbisinniton,aw maysissikinniton,gib daabini edde sin magenna,takkay ikkah Yalli isih faxe marih amol isi Farmoy  tit haa,diggah isi Farmoyta Ndhiirik rademarak amol heeh,ken Baaxo degef maleh aw Qeebi maleh fake,Yalli ummaanim xiqe,tu mayaffara",
  59007: "Gandoodimmarih Maalak Qeebi maleh Yalli isi Farmoytal hee Niqmat,Yallih imi,isih faxa marah haa,koboruh Farmoytiimi,kaah ramadle marak,Haashimik rade maraakee,Muttalibik rade marih imi,toh Sadagak hoorimeenimih aftok  lon,Qayxiixa afto edde leh,Baacoytit afto edd le,Godoboytay xagam akak tem bexe afto eddele,toh akah tekkem Maali koraakoriyyi aw tabaatabsi Baacoytit edde anekkah Gaddaloolaggabat aadiyewaaggida,Moominiiney-degef maleh Farmoyti gee Maalak siinih yeceem beya,akak sinwaaseemik waasima, kay am ritte xakabaanaah,kaywaasoosak waaliyaanamal Yallak meysita,diggah Yalli digaala gibdik kay digaalak takkawsima",
  59008: "Ta Maalak exxak teena Yallih Gitah Baaxok teerre Baacoytitiy,isinni Maaluu kee isinni Xaylo cabaanamal dirkimteh tamcawwe,Addooniyal Rizqhil Yalli  isi muxxo keenil haah,Akheeral isi kacanu keenil haam qagitan,Yallaa kee kay Farmoyta Yallih Gitah angiicilliyyal catan,toomaray too weelol welloowee,Ca kkiik Iimaanat yingirgire mara",
  59009: "Yalli guurommarat yabba iyyeh ken faylissa heewak,Cateenit aw Ansaarat :yaabeh,kenfayliseeh,kaay yisriye iyyeh <br/> ,Woo catoytitiy aw Ansaaray,guurommarak afal Madiinal obte aw orobtee Yallal yaamineeniih kay Farmoytal yaamineenim dooriten,Makkak guuroh ken fan yemeete mara kicnoonuh,degef maleh orbe boylak Yallih taagah yeerreh ma rah tu tamcawweh,keenih amcawwe waytaamah,isinni Aliilit naqabu mayaa ,llan,kuuxewaynan mayaallan,Baacaa kee agxel welloowe marak yenen way ,Addooniyah aftootil aw maglabittel isinni Nafsittek guurommara yaysu kumen faxe numuy kay Nafsi Maali baakeerik Yalli akah dacriseeh, Yallih Gitah ye cee,too mari qaagitaanam geyaanaah,akak meysitaanam yasillimeenimil mayso geemara",
  59010: "Woomaray tamarak wadiril yemeeteeh,Qhiyaamafan maqaanel ken katayee:ni Rabbow,neey,ni toobokoy Diinil Yallaa kee kayFarmoytal teemeneeh,nek too komeh cab,ni Sorkocoxxaylot Moominiinik tiyah, gibdi kuuxewaytiiy,kuuxe waytiiy mahan,diggah kuRabbi ku Naqoosah gelel liiy keenih racmate iyyan",
  59011: "Farmoytaw-Koroosinna qelliseeh,Iimaan yuybulluye mara fan matabla,Koroo  sinnal ken toobokoh tan,Yahuuduy maken Tawraat katayeenitih tanik:isinni Bu xaa xil elle idiya,sin manasquxuya,sin matabisna,Muslimiin teetik sin teyyee  qek isin geyteenim geyih sinluk awqenno,sinlih mawqak nee hoortam faxxaa mak inkittu manateeqa,Qeebi siinit abeenik keenil sin catenno,Yalli diggah Munaafiqhiin Yewqimeenik kenlih awqiyyaakee Qeebi keenit yekkek kenlih Qeebi abiyyak, yexxee ceenimil dirableela kinnoonumul sumaaqitah  ",
  59012: "MuslimiinYahuud teyyeeqek ken lih mayawqan,Qeebi keenit abeenik ken maca ,tan,ken maqokolan,ken cateenih,ken qokoleenik,kudmah keenik kudeloonuuh tohuuk wadiril,Munaafiqhiin mayso mageyan,inkinnahYalli ken ayaqunxuye  leeh ken wacarroysele",
  59013: "Moominiiney-isin Munaafiqhiin Sorkocoxxaylot,meysiisiyyah Yallak gibditoo nuh,too siinik lon meysih gibdaa kee Yallak ken meysih boolak galab akak xa ggiimem,diggah oson aaxigewaah,tut radewaamara kinnoonumih sabbata,tut rada mara kkinnoonu diggah akak meysitaanaah,akak giliicitaanam faxximtam Yalla kinnim aaxaguk yenen,ken amol usuk sin hee",
  59014: "Moominiiney-Gasot tan Gandoodih addat tekkeh akkewaytek,Yahuud gaabow wateh Qeebi siinit maaban,aw Daaratak darrek tekkeh akkewaytek,Gilicleela kinnoonumihsabbatah,foocah siinit garayaanam maxiqan,ken fanal kookaxawak taniimik gexxaamah,umaane ken fanal gibdah,atu oson diggah inki qangaral  yaniiniih,ken rorti inkittu takkale,abinah tanim,diggah ken Sorokocoxxylo bax sah taniih,tittawayle,too tittaway kee kookaxaw oson Qaqhli aallewaanamih sabbata,qakkaloowa mara aw Qaqhli lemara akkinnoonu Cakki aaxige xaaxee niih,kaa katayak yeneenikkah kaal tittawaak manannon",
  59015: " Koroosinnaa kee digaalak keenil obteemik ta-Yahuudih ceelalloo,xayi uddurih addat keenik afal Makki addal sugte Yallat tasgalloh bisi,isinni Koroosinnih ,illacaboh umaane tammooseenih,Badri Ayro keenik qiddimtem qiddimteeh tmuxxuyem tumuxxuyeh,Akheeral dananissa digaala lon  ",
  59016: "Munafiqhiinik woh yoobbenwak ken ceelalloo, Sheetan Koroositaamal Sah daytu amrisewakih bisi,usuk Koroosinna qax kaat yeymeeqeemih sabbatah koroositta iyyewak,atu koroosittewak anu kok bari ekke,anu Ginô Rabbik meysita kaak iyye",
  59017: "Sheetan kee faxe numuy kay amri yeteeqek,ken Nammayih illacabo (Sheetanay Taaqa akah tekkee kee Sehdaytuy Taaqa aba) Qhiyaamah Ayro Giral gacaa  naah,tet addal inki waaraanaah,too ken Nammay qambalta galato,Yallih dikkak taturiyyal,isinni Nafsi yuzlume marih galato",
  59018: "Yallal yeemeneeh,usuk keenih hee Diinil taamite maraw,kay amrittel xakabaa nam kee kaywaasook waaliyaanamal,Yallak meysita,Nafsi meqe taamak Qhi yaamah Ayroh tatrusuttem cubbussay,Yallak meysita,diggah Yalli isin abtaa nam yaaxagi,sin taamak tu kaak maqellittaay,elle sin galatele",
  59019: "Kay amri xakabaanam kee kaywaasok waaliyaanam cabiyyal Yalla hanneewe marih inna makkina,Yalli ken Nafsi ken hanneewiseh,Yallih bakcarraa kee di gaalaa ken cattam mataamitinnon,too maray Yalla hanneewee, kay amri maxa kabinnon,kay waasok maadiyinnon, oson Yallih taaqak yewqe mara",
  59020: "Girammaraa kee Jannatti mara mamassowta,inkinnah oso Addooniyal ken taama baxsa akah lennah,isinni galtol baxsimaanah,Jannatti mari faxaanam geyaanam kee akak meysitaanamak cattiimeenit yakkeenimil oson maysole aw taturle ",
  59021: "Farmoytaw- ta Qhur-aan Qalel oobisinnino-too Qale,legibdaliih Yallih meysik gexxaamah,uqunxuyya inteh,qanxixxeh tet able xaxxe,toh Qhur-aan addal tan xii xiyta kassittootaa kee,gibdi uman xaganak kay addat taniimik gexxaama,ta cee lallooli,Sinaamah akah naagurem isinni Qaqhlitte tamsiiseenih,kassittootii kee cubbussoosik kay Aaytitte addat tabbixeemil kassittoona",
  59022: " 22-23Usuk Yallay kaaksah cakkih yamqubbudi mayan,qellittatem kee garil tanim yaaxagi,tohuk tu kaak maqellitta,Addooniyaa kee Akheerah fidin racma ttaliiy,ken Nammayal gunerracmattali,kay racmatta Baadak faragga te,Abba ummaanih nakuusatak saffooweeh,saytu nnooweh,ummaan qaybik salaamah yano,isi Farmoytit cakkumuk tan Aayatittel nummayse,isi Naqoosah taama dacrise,maysoliy inkitti akak aysewaa,cayliino liy isi cayliinot ummaanimik yayse,kaxxitli,Xeetkee Cooxuuy wohuk kalah taniimik Yallat tasgallo kaat tasgalleemik Yalli saytunnooweh ",
  59023: " 22-23Usuk Yallay kaaksah cakkih yamqubbudi mayan,qellittatem kee garil tanim yaaxagi,tohuk tu kaak maqellitta,Addooniyaa kee Akheerah fidin racma ttaliiy,ken Nammayal gunerracmattali,kay racmatta Baadak faragga te,Abba ummaanih nakuusatak saffooweeh,saytu nnooweh,ummaan qaybik salaamah yano,isi Farmoytit cakkumuk tan Aayatittel nummayse,isi Naqoosah taama dacrise,maysoliy inkitti akak aysewaa,cayliino liy isi cayliinot ummaanimik yayse,kaxxitli,Xeetkee Cooxuuy wohuk kalah taniimik Yallat tasgallo kaat tasgalleemik Yalli saytunnooweh ",
  59024: "Usuk Yallay Gineey,ummaanim usuk gine,tu geysiise,isih elle faxannal isi Gino ,isih elle faxannal miicise,kaay yisriye meqe migooqay,kay fayyole weelooli addat tabbixe le,Qaranwal tanim kee Baaxol tanim,ummaanih nakusik kaa say tunnossa,maysoliiy inkitti akak aysewaa,isi ginooy,isi Sharqii kee cagudusi  yyal Naggaara",
  60000: "Suuratul-Mumtacina\nMadiinah imi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nMoominiin Koros awlaytiinoh aw Loyniinoh haanamak takkaawisiyyi edde yan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  60001: "Yallal yeemeneeh,usuk Diinil keenih heemil taamite maraw,yi Naqboytitiiy    sin Naqboytit awlaytiitiy awlaytiinoh haysittaanaah,takcineenih haysitewaytaa nama,Diinik sin Farmoytih Gabal temeeteemil diggah koroositeenih,Farmoyta kay Buxak yayyaaqen,sin tonnah Makkal sin Buxaaxik yayyaaqen,sin addal xay naa kee Ramad madacrisan,toh isinni Rabbil Yallah teemeneenimikkah,akiimik tu hinna,yi Gitah yangiicilleenimih taagah tewqeenih teneenih,yi kacanu geytoo na tewqeenih teneenik toh maabina,ken aykeeceniyyah Islam Xaagu qellut kee nih warissan,anu wohuk qellisseenam kee tuybulluyeenim aaxigeh,woh kee   wohuk kalah taniimik tu yok maqellitta,faxe numuy too awlaytiinoo kee kacnoy titih Koros haysitam abe,diggah Gitak gudek makiteh,Cakkik makkooweh,tay seemik xaxxab gace   ",
  60002: "Siinik yeyseenik,kookaxawak aw naqabuk isinni Sorkocoxxayloh addat qelli saanam ifah aybulluyelon,isinni Gabooba azaa kee ugrah sin fan ruubelon,isi  nni Arraaba Qaytoo kee xaaful cabba heelon,ken bis taallee niggidah Yallaa  kee kay Farmoytal Koroosittaanamal,wohloowiten ",
  60003: "Ken taagah Koros loynit isinnik abteenik,sin xayi Ramad siinih xiqam mali,sin Xaylo siinih xiqtam mali,Qhiyaamah Ayro Yalli sin fan baxisele,Jannatti mari jannat culele,Girammari Gira culele,baali baalih siinik xiqam mali,Yalli isin taamittaanam yabli,kaay yisriyek sin taamak tu maqellitta,teetil sin galatele",
  60004: ",Moominiiney-nagayna kaal tanay Ibraahim kee Moominiinik kallihyen maral diggah meqe katayyo siinih tekke,toh isinni maray Korosuh yanik:nanu sin kee  Xeet kee Cooxuk isin taqbudeenimik bari,Diinik isin elle taniinimil Ko roosi nneh, dubuh Yallal eemennaay, inkittu kaat asgallewayya haytaanam fan,nee   kee sin fanal kookaxaw kee koonaqabu ifa tekke iyyenwaka,sin marak too ken innah tan Korosuk bari keenik siinik faxxiimak sugte,nagayna kaal tanay Ibraa hiim isi Abbak:Yallak cabsot koh esseyyo iyyem akak raqqa intawaka,tohul   kaa makatayina,woh akah kinnim tah Ibraahiim isi Abbak qaago yargiqeemik afak ten,Moominti Yallat agleyta haanumuh cabsot gorrisam mali,Yallih digaa lak tu kok hoore hinniyo,ni Rabbow inkih tan ni caagiidal kol qikinne,andabbuk kol nuduure,a,Qhiyaamah Ayro mandabba koofana",
  60005: "Ni Rabbow,Cakkil aninnoonuy amol keenik gace maxanxe iyyaanamak,ken  ,amol nek hayiyyal Koros aqakkaane nee maabin,ni Rabbow ni Zambi neh cab diggah atu maysoliy gace sinni,ku Ginooy ku Diinii kee ku caggudusiyyal atu Naggaara",
  60006: "Taa meqe firqawal aw katayyol katayyo haysittam,faxe numuy Addooniyaa kee ,Akheeral Yallak Khayri qaagita,faxe numuy taa meqe katayyot darre cabak diggah Yalli isi Naqoosak gaddaali,kenTaaqak magxita,usuk ummaan gurral faylali",
  60007: "Moominiiney-Islaaminnal tirra ken haak,Yalli sin fan kee koo kaxaw fanat akak yan Korosih fanat kacanu haah,Diinil tooboko siinik yakkeenim takkeh,Yalli xi qliiy ken Sorkocoxxaylo Iimanah fan korisam xiqah,Yalli isi Naqoosak faxe numuy kaa fan yedebbeh cabsotliiy,keeniih racmate ",
  60008: "Woomaray sin Islaaminnâ sabbatah degef siinit abeweeh,sin Buxaaxik sin  ayyaa qeweeh,keenih tamqeeniih,Cakkik siinil loonum taceenimil ken fanal Qadli abtaanamak Yalli sinmawaasinna,diggah Yalli woomaray isi Nafsittel Qadli abaah,isi Buxah maral qadli abaah,loyniino akak aallinnaanimil qadli  aba  kicnah",
  60009: "Yalli sin akak waasam sin Imaanih sabbatah degef siinit abeeh,sin Buxaaxik   sin yeyyeqeeh,sin yayyaqeenimil cato abee,ken Loynit isinnik abtaanamak sin waasah,faxemaray siinik ken Loynitih aw awlaytiitih haysitee,Yallih amri sa deenimih sabbatah,baatih arkeenit arkisiyyal isinni Nafsitte yuzlume mara ",
  60010: "Yallal yeemeneeh,usuk hee Diinil taamite maraw,Koros Baaxook Islam Baaxo fan,Baaxo cabte SayMoomuniin guuroh siinil yemeeteenik,ken Iimaanih num  mal ken gibbata,ken Iimanih ixxigat Yalli waakita,ken Sorkocoxxayloh addat tabbi xem kaak maqellitta,gabbatu keenit abteenik wadiril ken nummak siinih tambu lluyeemil,Moominiin kinnoonum keenik teexegeenik,ken Baaqiliy Koro suh tani fan ken magacisina,Say Moominiinih Korosuh rihimaanam keenih maxi qta,Korosuh Say Moominiinil rihimaanama maxiqta,ken Agbuh Mahrik yecee nim ken Baaqilih ucuya,Moominiiney-Qiddat oson sugan uddur gaba kaleksah ,ken Yaras aw Mahri keenih teceenik keenil digibtaanamah Zambi siinil mali faxe numuy Barra Korosta akak tekke,aw Ilaaminnak akak korte tet koroosinnal ken Nammayih ginnaaqo tiggiriqqeemik gexxaamah tet abbixewaay,siinik kore Agbul Mahrik teceenim Koros essera,oson isinni Agabuy islaamitel yeceenim Yarasak esseroonoy,too sinle kabuu kee kenle kabuk Yaras aw Mahri gacsi ,yyak galab akak xaggiimem-Yallih madqa,kaay yisriye sinfan faxeemil madqa Yalli isi Naqoosah gurraa kee ken taama yaaxagi,teetik tu kaak maqelltta,isi Naqoosah haa Diinil Naggaara  ",
  60011: "Sin Agabuk baali Diinik korak Korosuh fan yawqen kaa tekkeeh,Korosuk ken Mahri faxxeeniih tet siinih ceeweenik,Koroosuk Boyla geyteenik,siinik Agabi Diinik akak koreh,akak yewqe marah Mahrik yeceenimih innah tanim ucuya,kay amri xakabaanam kee kay waasok waaliyaanamal elle taaminen Yallak meysita",
  60012: "Nabiyow-Moominiinih yan Agabi,xagana koh culoonu kolyemeeteenik,Makki fakimil akah tekkennah-Yallat tu agle heewoona,inkinnah dubuh kaa yaqbu doo na,garaqewoona,Dalwa abewoona,iggima lemarih qaadah lakat gexak isinni Xaylo qidewoona,Dalwah baahen Xaylo isinni Baaqil ayxee ,bexewoona,boo geey,moolookee Sara gambik qanxisaanamih innah taniimil maaqaanel koo aqsiyewoona ken xagnis,xagana koh culeenik wadiril ken Zambittek,Yallak cabsot keenih esser,diggah Yalli isi Naqoosak faxe maray kaal yuduureh ca beey,keenih racmate",
  60013: "Suurat Yallih Naqboytiitik awlaytiitiy ken kicna yakkeenimik takkaawisaamak ,qimbissewak,taturteemih diggoosiyyah teetik takkaawissaamal gaba kalteeh :Yallay fayyaye iyyeh <br/> Yallal yeemeneeh,usuk hee Diinil taamite maraw,Yalli elle bakcarrite maray Akheeral asmat aalle sinni,awlaytitih mahaysitina,inkinnah oson ugutmal ko roositeenimih sabbatah,ken raboytit ken fanah taduureemik qaago akah keenik yirgiqen innah,teetik qaago yirgiqeenih",
  61000: "Suuratu-Assaffi\nMadiinah imi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nMoominiin Diini cataanamal lallabaanama\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  61001: "Qaranwaa kee Baaxol tanim Yallay yisriyeeh fayyaye,ummaanimiy kaah ceele wayya haytak saytunnosseeh,tiysiriyeh,usk maysoliiy inkitti kaak mayaysa,isi ginooy,caggudusiyyal aw  meklaa kee Diini hayiyyal Naggaara ",
  61002: "Yallal yeemene maraw-abinal abewayteenim abneh macah intan?!siinik tiyak teeni:yi seefit degef abeeh,kaat ootoke iyya,usuk isi Seefit degef maabinna   edde maatukinna",
  61003: ",Too tenneeqebbeemi Yallih garil tenebbeh,woh abewaytaanam intaanama Moominti Yallallih nummeyna yakkeemik kalih im kaa macelta,kay taama kay maxca nummassaama",
  61004: "Moominiiniy kay kacanih goranah,rortah baali baalik gambit,baali baalit xaka buh akakyan xisneh innah gacca in the,kay Gitah degef abta diggah Yalli kicna",
  61005: "Yalli degef aw Qeebit yabba iyyewak,Moominiiniy degefih kay Gital massow te faylissa heeh,Moominiin isinni Nabiyyi sadaanamak takkaawisiyya,Muusaa kee Qiisah mara isinni Namma Farmoyta sadiyyak amol akak yeneenimit yaa :beeh iyyeh <br/> Farmoytaw-Muusa isi marak:maraw,anu sin fan Yallih Farmoyta kinniyom taa xigenwak,yi amri sadaanamal aza macah yoh takken?! iyyewak kassit,Cakkik usuk keenil baaheemik qeegeeniih,makkoowenwak,Yalli Cakkii kee massak  ken Sorkocoxxaylo qeegiseh,Yalli kay Taaqak yewqe mara Cakkit makoo baahisa",
  61006: "Farmoytaw-nagayna kaal tanay Qiisa Maryam Baxi:Israa-iilik rade maraw-anu Yallih Far moytaay,Tawraatak yok afal obtem nummaaseh,sin fan yoo ruube Farmoytiitik qusba num hinniyo,yok wadiril yamaatuwaa Acmad migaqle Far moytal ayduku muse kinniyo iyyewak kassit,Qiisa kay nummal tascasse alhumi tte keenil baahewak:tah baxxaqqale Baabaay makatayna iyyen",
  61007: "Islaaminnal Yallah inkittoysiyya caggaloysiyyi Diinil,usuk seecimaah,kaak ka lah yaqbude agleytitih ken kaat heewak,Yallal dirab hadle numuk Zulmih inkitti malafita,Yalli Yallat asgalliyyaa kee maqsiyatal,isiNafsitte yuzlume mara ma ssaa kee gitah tanim edde taniimih fan ken makoobahisa",
  61008: "Ta dirabbooseenitih yan mari,Yallih Ifu uma yaabak keenik geytimtam kee ,Cakki maynaqeenih,badisaanam faxan,Yalli oson faxewaah gidda qasbih Baaxok Ayrommawqooqii kee tet culmaamil,isi Diini ifa abaah,isi qangara fayya haanamal,isi ifu duudusele",
  61009: "Yallii,Tirtoo kee Khayril ascassiyyi Diiniiy,tuxxiqle ixxigaa kee meqe taamah Diiniiy,Yallat agleyta haamari Baaxol bica aw angar gar lem kaak niqbah anih oson faxewaah,giddaqasbih inkih tan Diinittek daga kaa abuu,Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay Mucammad Islaaminnâ Diinil usuk ruube ",
  61010: "Yallal yeemeneeh,usuk keenih heeDinil taamite maraw,biyakta digaalak sin ?catta,xalule Kabxal aw tellemmol sin escesseh,tirra sin hayoo ",
  61011: "Taa xalule tellemmoo,is Yallal taamineeniih,kay Farmoytal taamineenimi,kaay yisriyê Gitah isinni Maaluuy, isinni Nafsitteey, kay kacanih fayxih acayuk angii cilleenimi,too galab akak xaggiimem taama,yaaxige mara tekkeenikm Khayrih siinih raaqak tet fan isissika",
  61012: "Ta tellemmoh xalii,Yalli sin Zambi siinih cabele,tet Kalqatittee kee tet Cooxih rigid Illaltitte akak gexxa Jannatitte si nculusele,daffeynâ Jannatitteh addal   ,meqe guubway akak katewaana sinculusele,too galab akak xaggiime galato  naba may soy faxe mayso tet ceele akak sinni",
  61013: "Ta tellommoh xaluk gersitiyaa, isin tet kicintoonuh,is Addooniyal elle sissik tiyaay,Yalli sin Naqboytal sin cataama,xayi fakimih siinil fakeleeh,toh Makkaa kee teetik kalahtaniimiy siinil fakuwaa,Farmoytaw-Addooniyal maysoo kee Akheeral Jannatti taturuh ken ruffa haytaamah Moominiin aydukumus",
  61014: "Yallal yeemeneeh,usuk keenih hee Diinil taamite maraw,Cawaariyyiin catoh innale catoh sin Farmoyti baahe Diini cataanamal Yallih Cateenit aw Catoytit tika,toh naga yna kaal tanay Qiisaa:Yallafan iyyi yoo cata?keenik iyyewak:na  nu Yallih catoytiti,axcuk amookomuk kaal gacisen,Israa-iilak rade marak exxak teena,nagayna kaaltanay Qiisal yeemeneenih,gersi exxa kaal koroositteh,Qiisal yeemene mara, kaal koroosite maral qokolleeh, ken amol keenik yayse marah maacisen  ",
  62000: "Suuratul Jumuqa\nMadiinah imi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nTa-Ummattal Niqmat heeh,tet Farmoytal muxxo tet bahsiise,Jumqatti Ayroh muxxoh addaffakni elle yan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  62001: ",Ginoonak Qaranwal ennatam inkih,Baaxol ennatam inkih,nakuusat weeloolak   ummaanimiy kaah ceelewayya haytak,Yalla saffossaah,saytunnossah,usuk Abba ay Abbootanal dubuh dubbooweh,ummaanih nakusik saytunnooweh,maysoliy in kitti kaak mayaysa,isi ginooy,Diini hayiyyaa kee mekliyyal aw caggudusiyyal Naggaara",
  62002: "Usuk Yallay,woo Qarabay kawse sinniih,aktube sinnih addal,ken qaynatak yan Farmoyta ruube,kayAayatittey usuk kaal oobise keenil kawisa,Koroosinnaa kee ,uma umam kabanittek ken saytunnoosa,Qhur-aan ken barisa,Sunna ken barisa diggah oson ken fan kay rubbuusumiyyak afal,Cakkik baxxaqqale makoh addat yenen,woh Xeet kee Coox aqbuduk yenen,Qabala caxak yeneeniih,ramad arga quk yenen",
  62003: "Ta Farmoyta Qarabak hirriigamaraay,keenik kalah yan maray amaatekkah yanil ruube,amaatelon,usuk maysoliiy inkitti kaak mayaysa,isi ginooy,Diini hayiyyaa kee isi caguudusiyyal Naggaara",
  62004: "Too Qarab kee wohuk kalah yan marafan,Farmoyti rubbuusumiyyak galab akak xaggiimem,Yallih muxxoy isih faxe marah yacee,Yalli naba maqaane li,kay naba maqaanek tiyak teena,ta-Ummatih Farmoyta Sinaamah fan inkih ruube",
  62005: "Yalli Farmoyti ruubiyyaa kee Qhur-aan oobisiyyak Niqmatak heemit yabba  iyye wak,ta Ummat ken katayaanamak takkaawisiyyah,nagayna kaal Muusâka teyeenitik baali,Tawraat addal taniimil taamitaanamak darre edde cabeenimit :yaabeeh iyyeh  <br/> Woo Yahuuduy Tawraat addal taniimil soolaanamal dirkisimteeh,elle dirkisim teemil soltam cabteh ceelalloo,Dananay kaxxa Kitooba yakkuqeh bisi,maca yu kkuqsumem mayaaxiga:Kitoobannaa, teetik kalah taniimi innaa? Yallih Aayati tte dirabboose marih ceelallo toomeh,Yalli Zulmeynit Cakki geyaanamal tirra mahaa",
  62006: "Farmoytaw-: kaa makeenik wadiril Yahuud Diinil yeedeye maraw,isin Sinaa mak aki mari edde anekkah,Yallak awlaytiitiy aw kacnoytitiy,Sinaamak sin du bboysiteh texxeeceeniih,raba loowita,isin elle taxxaccen innal Sinaamak,konna bnak sin elle dubbaasem,siinih yaysissikuh,toh gersi mari edde anekkah awlay tiinol Yalli sin dubbaase taxxaccenimil nummynit tekkeeniki ",
  62007: "Raba inkinnah maloowitan,inkinnah Koroosinnaay,maqsiyataay,Zulmiiy,Taw ,raat makiyaa kee milaaguk abeenimik gexxaamah,Addooniyal waar loowitan Yalli Zulmeynit yaaxigi,ken taamak tu kaak maqellittaay,teetil ken galatele",
  62008: "Farmoytaw-ta Yahuuduk:diggah isin akak kuddan Rabi,sissikuk takku,sarra  takku siinit angoorowelem raq mali,tokkeek Qhiyaamah Ayro qellttam kee ga  ril tanim yaaxagih yan Yallafa andabbimetton,ken Nammayak tu kaak maqelli  tta,Addooniyal taamitak sugteenim siinih wariseleeh,elle sin galatele",
  62009: "Yallal yeemeneeh,usuk keenih Diinil taamite maraw,Jumqatti Ayro Khutba abe wanbaral yewqek wadiril,Adan abe kaayek,Khutbaa kee Salaatah tamaatoonuh Masaagid fan gexa,Taaqak sin agxissak limo caba,Moominiiney-Jumqattah Aza anak wadiril,gexoo kee Limo cabaanamak edde ammirsimteenim yaaxige mara teekkeenik Khayrih siinih raqta,Yalli edde sin amrisem xakaba",
  62010: "Jumqattâ Salaatak gaba kal tanwa Calaali taamah goran kee isinni agxeexa tag ,duboonu fixixa,Yallih muxxo Calaali taamaa kee Calaali xalih gitaak gorrisa Rizqhi goranih addat anih mango galab xagoh Yallih galab xaga,kicintoonumul mayso geytaanaah,akak meysittaanamak cattimtaanamih qaagoh,Rizqhi goran Yallih galab xago sin habbeelisewaay",
  62011: ",Muslimiinik baali tellemmo aw digir yublenwak tet fanah awquk baxsimeenih Farmoytaw koo-Wanbaral soolak caben,Farmoytaw-meqe taamal Yallih garil ,galatok tanim,tellemmoo kee digiriy isin fanah akak tewqeenik Khayrih raqta Rizqhi tacok Yalli Khayrih raaqa yarzuqhi inxec",
  63000: "Suuratul Munaafiqhuun\nMadiinah imi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nMunaafiqhiin hununnaaneh baxxaqisiyyaa kee keenik takkaawisaanam elle tan \n•    Tafsiiri:",
  63001: "Farmoytaw-ku daffeynal Munaafiqhiiniy Islaaminna taybulluyeeh,Koroosinna qellissa temeetek,diggah atu Cakkiik Farmoyta kinnitoomul nangireh iyyan,di ggah atu Cakkiik Farmoyta kinnitom Yalli yaaxigeh,diggah osn isinni Sorkoco xxaylol irgiqqa heenih,diggah atu Farmoyta kinnitoomul sumaaqinnah yaxxa cceenimil,diggah Munaafiqhiin dirableela kinniimil Yalli sumaaqitah",
  63002: "Iimaan lino yaxxacceenimil aban isinni Xiiba qidim kee seewak edde yansuttu reeniih,xaggursumaanama aben,bohoy hayiyyaa kee ligligok fixixisaanamat Si nam Iimaanak makeenih,Nifaaqh kee dirab Xiibak abak yeneenim diggah kee  nik toomeh",
  63003: "Tohuk sabab oson akah yeemeneenimNifaaqh kinniimi,Iimaan ken Sor koco xxaylo magufinna,tokkeek qellut Yallal koroositeenih,ken Koroosinnih sabba tah ken Sorkocoxxaylot sabba heeh,alifeeh Iimaan tet macula,osontoo alifih sabbatah ken tummiqit kee massa edde tanim  macedan",
  63004: "Yablow-ken tublek,ken weeloo kee solsol tassokooteh,woh akah kinnim qax maqaanee kee Niqmatak edde yaniinimik gexxaama,yaabeenik afloolinnak aw Yaabal lon duddak gexxaamah ken yab taabbeh,Farmoytaw-ku daffeynal Coo xuy qiksimeh innah gacan,tut maradan maraaqisan, Conxok edde yaniinimik gexxaamah,ummaanih xongolo hadafah kenleeh,ken xagelem yakkalen,Cakkiik ,oson Naqboytiti,Farmoytaw-Yallih Abaaro keenil tanuk ku cuumi fixixisiiy Date koh malisi yakkeenimik keenik takkawsim,mascassoosi kee alhumitte baxxaqqa le anih Iimaanak anninnal makkiiman",
  63005: "Ta Munaafiqhhiinik:siinik geytimteemik quzri haysitak Farmoytafan amaay,sin Zambittek Yallal cabsot siinih gorrisele keenik tenxeccimewak,anqass kee boo ,laysiyyah isinni Amooma maken,edde ammirsimeenimit darre cabah ken tuble oson Cakki oggolaanaah,kaah addah gacaanamal kaxxamaritaanah",
  63006: "Farmoytaw-ken Zambih cabsot gorrissam kee cabsot gorrisewaytam massow tah,ken Zambitte Yalli macaba,diggah Yalli isi Taaqak yewqe maray,kaymaq siyatal elle yeedeye makooba hisa",
  63007: "Oson woomaray:Farmoyti garil yan marak,Baacoytit kee Dacarsittommaray Madiinah arul yani,baxbaxsimma iyyaanam fan isinni Maalu keenil maacina iyyan,Qranwabbuuloo kee Baaxooxabbuulo dubuh Yallih imi,isi Naqoosak   isih faxe marah tet yarzuqhe aw yammire,takkay ikkah Munaafiqhiin Rizqhi buulo kaay yisriyeggbat tanim mayaaxigan",
  63008: "Keenik Cangal xalah yan Qabdullaah Ubeyyi Baxi:Madiina nuduurek,mayso leela-oson yoo kee yimaraay-teetik qunxiina leela,oson Muca mmad kee kay wadaayaay ayyaaqele iyya,mayso dubuk lem Yallaay,kay Farmoytaa kee Moo miniini,Qabdillah Ubeyyi Baxaa kee kaywadayih im hinna,takkay ikkah Munaa fiqhiin mayso Yalli leeh,kay Farmoyti leeh,Moominiin lem mayaaxigan",
  63009: "Yalli Munnafiqhiin Yallih Gitak hortaggidah,yaceenimik Cillaalel baakeerih  lon inna baxxaqissa heewak,Moominiin wohuk takkaawiseh,kay Gitah yaceeni :mil ken amriseeh,iyyeh <br/> Yallal yeemeneeh,usuk keenih hee Diinil taamitemaraw,sin Maaluuy,sin Xaylo ,Salaatak aw teetik kalah taniimik Islaaminnal raqsinniimik sin aylahisewaytay, faxe numuy kay Maaluuy,kayXaylo Salat kee wohuk kalah ta niimiy,Yalli dirki kaal abek kaa aylahissek,too mari Cakkiik baxaysite maray isinni Nafsittey,isi nni ahlik Qhiyaamah Ayro baxaysiteenih",
  63010: "   Yi Rabboow dagoo uddur yoo udurrusinnitoy,yi Maalak Yallih Gitah Sadaga acayuuy,Yallih meqe Naqoosay taama akak temqeh num akku isi Rabbik iyyaa mak,Siinik tiyak teenal Rabi yamaateemik afal,Yalli siinih yimmire Maalak ucuya ",
  63011: ",Yallay yisriye tet uddur yemeeteeh,tet Karma gaba kaltek,Nafsi mudurroosa Yalli isin taamittaanam yaaxagi,sin taamak tu kaak maqellittaay,teetil singala tele,Khayri tekkek Khayriiy,umaane tekkek umaane",
  64000: "Suuratu-Attaqhaabun \nMadiinah imi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nQhiyaamah Ayro Darraqaa kee baxaysu edde geytimtuwaytaanak takkawsimaa nama\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  64001: "Ginok Qranwal tanim kee Baaxol tanim inkih nakuusat weeloolay kaah ceele wayya haytak Yalla saytunnossaah,taysiriyeh,Abbootan dubuh le,kaaksah Abba mayan,meqe Faylale,usuk ummaanim xiiqeey,tu mayaffara",
  64002: "Sinaamey-usuk sin gineeh-siinik Korosti yaniih kay gaceena Gira,siinik Moomi nti yaniih,kay gaceena Jannata,Yalli isin abtaanam yabliiy,sin taamak tu kaak maqellitta,teetil sin galatele",
  64003: "Cakkil Qaranwa gineeh,Baaxo gine,digirih ken Nammay magininna,Sinaamey isi maqaanee kee isi muxxoh sin miiciseeh,miicu siinik yeymeeqeh,faxinnay qax umam tet abak yen,Qhiyaamah Ayro madaara dubuh kaa fana,sin taamal singa latele,Khayri tekkek Khayriiy,umaane tekkek umaane",
  64004: "Qaranwah addal tanim yaaxigeh,Baaxoh addal tanim yaaxigeh,taamak qellissaa nama yaaxigeh,taybulluyeenim yaaxigeh,Khayrik aw umaanek Yalli Aliwah addat tanim yaaxigeh,wohuk tu kaak maqellitta",
  64005: ",Yallat tasgalloy-siinik afal dirabbosse Ummatitteh Xaagi siinil mamattinnaa ceelalloh,Nuucuuy,Qaadaay,Samuud kee wohuk kalah yan mara,Addooniyal  Koroosinnak bagul akak yeneenimih digaala tammooseenih,Akheeral danani  ssa hayta digaala lon?!yeey,diggah woh siinil yemeeteh,ken caagid akah yuduu reemil cubbi geya,keenil obtem siinil obtaamak afal Yalla fan endebba",
  64006: "Too ken geyte digaala ken akah geytem,ken Farmoytit Yallih gariik ifale alhu mittee kee baxxaqqale mascassoosi bahte keenil amaatuk tewak,Farmoytit Sah daqqaynatak tanim assacakkuk:Cakkifan nee tascassem Sahdaa?!iyyeenimih sa ,bbata,koroositeeniih keenil yaamineenimit darre caben,Yallak tu makalinnon ken Iimaan kee ken taaqak Yalli gaddidooweh,woh akah kinnim ken Taaqa tu keenih moosissa,Yalli gaddaaliy isi Naqoosah fan magxita,isi maxcoocaa kee isi taamal faylali",
  64007: ",Yallal koroosite mari,Yalli ken Rabak wadiril manol ken muugusa yexxeccen Farmoytaw-ta ugutma tangaddok:yeey yiRabbi yok takkay aw yi Rabbil xiibita Qhiyaamah Ayro ugutetton,tokkeek Addooniyal taamitteenim siinih warrisime  le,too ugutma Yallal xamcinih,diggah qimboh adda singineh,usuk sin rabak wa diril,manol tano tikkateenih cisab kee galtoh sin ugusam xiiqé ",
  64008: "Sinaamey-Yallal eemenaay-kay Farmoytal eemena,ni Farmoytal oobisne Qhur aanal eemena,Yalli isin abtaanam yaaxagi,sin taamak tu kaak maqellittaay,tee  til singalatele",
  64009: "Farmoytaw-Qhiyaamah Ayro sin taamal sin galata ggidah Yalli sin gaaboosu waa Ayro kassit,too-Ayro Koros baxaysuu kee ken nakuusat edde tamballayu ,wayta Ayro,toh Moominiin Jannatal Girammarih arooca nagaroonawaan waka Giram mari Giral Jannatti marih arooca nagaranwaka,faxenumuy Yallal yeeme neeh,meqe taama taamite,Yalli kay umaane kaak luuqusah,inki elle waarak tet Kalqatittee kee Cooxuk guba Illaltitte akak gexxa Jannatitte kaaculusa,teetik in kinnah mayawqan,tet Niqmat keenik mayggiriqqa,tohuy geeni naba taturuy tet bisle tatur akak anewaa",
  64010: ",Woomaray Yallal koroositee,ni Farmoytal oobisne ni Aayatitte dirabboosee too mari Girammaraay tet addal inki elle yaadiyen aw maran,ken gaceeni  yoome gaceena",
  64011: "Yallih meklaa kee caggudusiyyah tekkeh akkewaytek,inkittu kay Nafsil,aw kay Maalul,aw kay Baxal kaa geyta faxe umaane matan,faxenumuyYallaay, kaymek laa kee kay caggudusiyyal yeemene,Yalli kay Sorkocobbaxa,kay amrih gaba ya ceeniih,kay mekla yakcineenimit koobaahisa,Yalli ummaanim yaaxagi,tu kaak maqellitta",
  64012: "Yalla eteeqaay,kay Farmoyta eteeqa,kay Farmoyti siinil baaheemit darre cab teenik,too darre cabiyyih Zambi sin amol yan,ni Farmoytal gufus inneh elle kaa amrisnem gufusaamaksah kaal tanim mali,gufusuh elle ammirsimem diggah sin gufuseh",
  64013: "Yalli dubuh Cakkih yamqubbudi,kaaksah Cakkih yamqubbudi mayan,Moomi niin inkih tan isi caagidah dubuh Yallal qikittay",
  64014: "Yallal yeemeneeh,usuk keenih hee Diinil taamite maraw,diggah sin Agbuu kee sin Xaylok sin Naqboytit tan,toh akah kinnim Yallih galab xagoo kee kay Gitah yangiicilleenimik aylahissaah,sin wadirih raaqissam yakkeenimi,raat siinil ca baanak keenik takkawsima,ken fatucel tatturteeniih,darre edde cabteeniih,tet ,keenik tustureenik,diggah Yalli sin Zambitte siinih cabeleeh,siinih racmatele galto aben taamah qaynatak geyan",
  64015: "Sin Maal kee sin Xaylo gabbatuu kee aqakkaanekkah akim hinna,Caraamu taa mittaanaah,Yallih Taaqa cabtaanam sin absiisaanam takkeh,Faxenumuy Xaylo ttaaqaa kee Maalat agxitaanamal,kay Taaqa yiysiiseh Yalli isi Garil naba gala tole,ta naba galato is Jannata",
  64016: "Kay Taaqah fan Gita geytaanam dudda haytaanamal,kay amri xakabaanam kee kaywaasok waaliyaanamal Yallak meysita,oobba,Yallaa kee kay Farmoyta eteeqa,Yalli siinih yimmire sin Maalu Khayri foocittel aw gitittel ucuya,faxe ,maray Yalli isi Nafsih baakeerik dacrisee,too mari faxaanamal mayso geeh  akak meysitaa mak cattiime mara",
  64017: "Isinni Maaluk kayGitah taceenimil,Yalla meqe Likaacih likacsitteenik,maqaane Tabna maqaaney tetbisleey,Malcina boolih dubleey,mango duble fan siinih abi yyal galto dubleh siinih heele,sinZambittek siinih taturele,Yalli faatiteey dagoo taamal mango galto yacee,xiqliiy digaalal mayasissika",
  64018: "Yallay yisriye qellittem yaaxagiiy,garil tanim yaaxagi,wohuk tu kaak maqelli tta,maysoliiy inkitti akak mayaysa,isi ginol,isi Diini hayiyyaa kee caggudusi yyal Nag gaara",
  65000: "Suuratu-Attalaaqh\nMadiinah imi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nCabtimmadqooqih addaffakoot kee kaywaadoodi yaynabeenimiiy,Yallak mey  sile mexexu\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  65001: "Nabiyow,atu faxxek,aw ku Ummatak numuk teeni isi Qasaala cabam faxek,qim ,bôqiddal tet cabay,toh cabti fidoh teetil orbekkah saytunaanet is anuk takkeemi keenil taduureenim faxxeenik,isinni Qasaalal taduureenimih bica geytaanaggi dah,Qidda dacrisa,kay amritte xakabaanam kee kaywaasok waaliyaanamal sin Rabbi Yallak meysita,sin cabentit guubuh addat akak sugen Buxaaxik mayyaa qina,ken Qidda gaba kaltam fan oson isinnih awqe woonay,ifah tan Dalwah innah taniimit yemeeteenih aw aseenih tekkeh akkewaytek,too madqooqi Yallih waadoodiy,isi Naqoosah waadoyse,faxe numuy Yallih dikkookik tature isi Ra bbi yaqsiyeemil baatih arkeenit tet arkisewak,diggah isi Nafsi yuzlumeh,cabee naw-aw Barra cabe numow,woo cabtik wadiril atu qambaalewaytam Yalli abeh,tet gacissam takkeh",
  65002: "Qidda gabakkaltih xayyowtawak,fayxii kee quktommaqaanel ken gacisa,aw ken ,qidda gaba kaltamfan Cakkik loonum keenih taceenilluk kengacisaanam caba  isinni Nafsitteh caagid isinnih kobrelon,ken gacissaanam faxxeenik,aw keenik baxsimtaanam faxxeenik,kookaxaw girquh siinik Namma numuy Qadlile sumaa qisa,Sumaaqiteenitow-sumaq Yallih fooca edde faxak baaha aw aba,too mad qooqik galab akak xaggiimem,faxenumuy Yallal yaamineeh,Qhiyaamah Ayrol yaamine edde kassiisima,woh akah kinnim kassis kee kassittot xoqoysimtam woomara,faxe numuy kay amritte xakabam kee kaywaasok waaliyaanamal Yallak meysite,ceenaa kee ceyak,ummaanimiy edde radinnaanik,Yalli mawqa kaah aba",
  65003: "Kay Sorkocobbaxal akak amaatewayteeh,kay cisaabat akak sugewaytekkeek  kaa yarzqhe,faxenumuy isi caagiidah Yallal qikite usuk kaa duudah,diggahYalli isi caagid yagdubiiy tu mayaffara,tu kaak mataftuca,diggah Yalli ummaanimih cagguduy aw waadoy edde taadiye abe,gibdaabini caggudleeh,assamaq caggu dle,ken Nammayak Sahdaytul tii mamara",
  65004: ",Isinni Karmah nabanak gexxaamah miyangali Qabalak qaago tirgiqe cabentit   ken Qidda elle tan innat bohoy inteenik,Qidda keenik Sidooca Alsa,Karmâ qun xaanek gexxaamah miyangali Qabala gufewee saymari,ken Qidda tonnah Sidoo ca Alsa,cabtih takku aw rabah takku Baaqil akak baxsime Soolimihyan Aaga  bih qiddah illacaboo:Xalay oobisanwaka, faxe numuy kay amritte xakabaanam kee kaywaasok waaliyaanamal Yallak meysitee,kay caagid Yalli kaah xamma coosaah,ummaanih gibda kaal sahhiloosah",
  65005: ",Moominiiney-too cabtiiy,madaaraa kee Qiddammadqak galab akak xaggiimem Yallih madqay elle taamittoona siinil oobise,faxe numuy kay amritte xakabaa ,nam kee kaywaasok waaliyaamal Yallak meysite,abe umaane kaak duukah Akheeral naba galato kaah yace,woh Jannatti culma, ambaxe sinni Niqmat geyaanama ",
  65006: "Yalli cabtii kee madaarammadqa baxxaqissa heewaak,mattacoo kee guub :madqa baxxaqiseeh,iyyeh <br/> Baaqilow-isinnih duddaanamal,isinnih guubuh elle gacinnaan ikkel ken haa,ka ,lah taniimil Yalli sin madirkisinna,keenil ceenossaanamih qaagoh mattacooy guub kee ken Nammayak kalah taniimil biyak keenil maculisina,cabentit Soo  lim yekkeenik,Soolimih elle yanin Xaylo oobissa haanam fan keenil ucuya aw qukto keenih aba,sin Xaylo siinih yeyseexxeenik aysaaxxiyyi Qasbi aw galto keenih ucuya,Qasbi caagdil meqe gital aw Sinam garil elle tamixxigennal tittal gacaagacisa,Baqli Qasbik Barra faxxaamal cillallooweeh,is baakersimteh isih faxxaamaksah tanim oggole waytek,Abba gersi taysaaxxiy Baxa kaah taysaaxxe Qasbih yaxxaabaxay",
  65007: "Faxe numuy Maalak faraggale,isi cabentoo kee isi Baxal isih lefaraggah gidel ,keenil yacaay,faxe numuy Rizqhi elle ceenoote Yalli kaal yeceemik yacaay ,Yalli Nafsi teetih yeceemik kalih imil madirkisa,wohuk dagal kaa madirkisa xiqtaamak amo kaal teetil mahaa,kay gurri ceenaa kee tet gibdak wadiril,Yalli faragga kee Gaddaliino kaah abele",
  65008: "Yalli amrittek tu takkeemit yabba iyyewak,too amrittet darre cabaanamak  :takkaawiseh,tohuk illacabo umam baxxaqiseeh,iyyeh <br/> ,Tet Rabbiy yisriyee kee nagayna keenil tanay kay Farmoytitih amri tiqsiyewak tet uma taamal gibda cisaabah cisab teetik abne,Addooniyaa kee Akheeral qax uma aw gibda digaalah digaalle Gandoodi maxxo mango",
  65009: "Isi uma taamah digaala tammosseh,tet illacabo Addooniyal baxaysuuy,Akhee  ral baxaysu tekke",
  65010: ",Yalli caylale digaala gulguluh keenih hee,keenil obtem siinil oobewaytuh  Qaqhli leeh,Yallal yeemeneeh,kay Farmoytal yeemene maraw-kay amritte xakabaa nam kee kay waasoosak waaliyaanamal Yallak meysita,diggah Yalli kassittoy kay maqsiyatih illacaboh umaanee kee kay Taaqah illacaboh ma  qaane sin edde kassiisa Yalli sin fan oobiseh",
  65011: "Ta Kassittoo,usuk kaak yan Farmoytay Yallih Aayatittey agle-agle edde ane si nniy,baxxaqisiyyale siinil kawisa,toh Yallal yeemeneeh,kay Farmoyta nummaa seeh,meqe taama taamite mari,Diteetâ makook Tirtoh Ifu fan yawqeenimih qaa go,faxenu muyYallal yaamineeh,meqe taama taamitaa,Yalli Jannatittey tet Kal ,qatittee kee Cooxuk guba Illaltitte kaka gexxay inki elle waaraana kenculusele tet Niqmat akak aggiriqqewaa Jannat kaa culusewak diggah Yalli Rizqhi kaak yeymee qeh",
  65012: "Yalli Malcina Qaranwa usuk gine,Malcina Qaranwa akah ginennah Malcina Baaxooxa gine,Yallak ginoh caagid kee Diini caagid ken fanal ooba,toh Yalli ummaanim xiqaah, tu mayaffaram taaxigeeniggida,qaagiyyah,diggah kaay yisri ye ummaanimit ixxigah maro hee,Qaranwah addal Baaxol tu kaak ma qellittam taaxagoonu ",
  66000: "Suuratu-Attacriim\nMadiinah imi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nBuxaaxi Yallih dikkaaki yaynabeenimil soolisaanaah,kay kacan dubuh yaysukumeenimih fan seecaanama\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  66001: "Farmoytaw,ku Naqaso Maariyat xoqoysimiyyal,Yalli koh xiqsiisem macah   ,cara mmossa?! wohut teetih aysunenwak,ku Agbu taykeecenem edde faxxa  Yalli koh cabeey,koh racmate",
  66002: "Teetik Khyrih taysem geyteenik aw teetil Zambitteenik,sin Xiiba elle faktan luu quseena aw kaffaara diggah Yalli gita siinih abe,Yalli sin cate,usuk singuraa kee sin tummiqit edde yanim yaaxigi,isi Diinii kee caggudusiyyal Naggaara",
  66003: ",Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay Nabi Xaagut Cafsa caggaloosewak kassit  woo Xaaguk tuk teena,Maariyal anxawwe waamak ten,Cafsa Xaagu Qaa-ishah warisseeh,Yalli kay cuumi aw sirri fixixem kaa yiysixxigewak,Cafsa saliteeh edde yabteemik baalit teetih yaabeeh,baalik tibba iyye,kaa esserteh:tah iyyi   koh warise?inte,ummaanim yaaxagiiy,ummaanimiy qellut tani yaaxagi yoh wari se iyye ",
  66004: "Sin Nammayal tandabbeenim Cakkik tan,woh akah kinnim sin Nammayih Sor  kocoxxaylo,Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay Yallih Farmoyti isi Naqsok ,waasi mam kee tet isi Nafsil carammoosaamay,usuk yinqibeh kacanu fan qegte kaal titta lallabtaanamal yaduureenimil sin Nammayak elle teedeyee nik,diggah Yalli kay awlaytuuy kaa caté,tonnah Jibriiliiy,Moominiinik doore lemara,kay awlaytitiiy kay catoytiti.Yallih catok wadiril Malaa-ika aza kaah takkol,kay catoytiitiiy kaa qokola",
  66005: "Kay Nabiyyi sin cabek,kay Rabbiy yisriye siinik Khayrih yayse Agbu kaa kori sam bictah,kay amrit santiitimta aw massowaah,kaal yaamineeh,kay Farmoytal yaamine Yalla tateeqeeh,isinni Zambik tandabbo,isinni Rabi taqbudo,Soomee ,niti,Wasifwa,Baxuuwuy kaak kalih mari elle culewee,kaah korisam bictah takkay ikkah ken macabinna",
  66006: "Yallal yeemeneeh,usuk hee Diinil yeemene maraw,isinni Nafsittee kee isinni ahlih,naba Giray Sinam kee Xeetil urtak dacayri haysita,ta Girah amol kafin Malaa-ikay tet culamaral gibda tan,ken amrisek Yallih amri mayaqsiyan,edde ken amrisam udurroowekkah,aqilsiyakkah aban",
  66007: "Qhiyaamah AyroKorosuk:Yallal koroosite maraw,Koroosinnaakee maqsiyatak bagul akak teneenimih quzri alqo mahaysitina,sin quzritte moggolimta,alqo elle gallatimtoona waytaanam,Yallal koroositaanam kee kayFarmoytit dirabboosaa namak,Addooniyal taamitak sugteenimi keenik tanxaccime",
  66008: "Yallal yeemeneeh,usuk keenih hee Diinil taamitemaraw,sin Zambittek Yalla   fan nummâ mandabbah endebba,sin Rabbi sin umaane siinik duukaah,Qhiyaa mah Ayro tet Kalqatittek guba Illaltitte akak gexxa Jannatitte sin culusam tak keh,Yalli Nabi asqunxuyewaah,woo kalluk yeemene mara Gira culusiyyal edde asqunxuyewaa Ayro,Gital aw Siraatal Ifi Foocat keenik gexaah,Migdittel kee nik gexa,ni Rabbow,Munaafiqhiiniy Ifi Gital aw Siraatal akak bayah inna akke waynu ifu neh duudus Jannat culla innam fan,ni Zambitte neh cab,diggah atu ummaanimil xiqli,niifu duudussaah,ni Zambik taturtam mataffara iyyan",
  66009: "Farmoytaw- Korosul Seefih ingiicil,Munaafiqhiinil Arrabaa kee abeenimih   ,digaala keenil soolisaanamal ingiicil,kok meysitta iyyaanamfan keenil igibdiy Qhiyaamah Ayro fanah akak yandabbimoonawaan mandabbimeena Jahanna ma,oson fanah akak gacan gacimeena maxxo uma gacimeena",
  66010: ",Yallii,Yallal koroositeeh,kay Farmoytitil koroosite maral ceelallo yoogoreeh diggah Moominiinit lon qalli-Yallih Ambiyak Namma Nabih Namma Barrah  gurrah xiqam mali:ken Nammayal nagay tanay woh Nuuc kee Luutu,diggah  meqe Namma Naqasih,Namma Qassaalak ten,isinni Namma Baqla ken Na mmay ganeh,toh Yallih Gitak hooraanam kee isinni Nammayih marak Koros cataanamay bagul akak yeneeni,ta meqe Namma Naqasih Namma Qasaala ye kkeenim ken Nammayah xiqtem mali,ken Nammayak Koros kee Yallih Taaqak yewqe marak,Gira cultaamih addat Gira cula tanxaccime",
  66011: ",Yallii,Yallal yeemeneeh,kay Farmoytitil yeemene maral ceelallo yoogoreeh diggah Korosut lon ken fantaaxaw keenik kalam mali,Cakkil massooweenit yekkeeniiksah keenil cabta raat mali-Firqawni Barrah gurrah:yi Rabbow kuga ril Jannatal Buxa yoh xis,Firqawni kaxxamariinooy,kay Reedaak kee kay uma taamak yoo iysillim,kay dikkak tatur kee kay Zulmil kaa katayaanaml isinni Nafsitte yuzlume marak yoo iysillim intewak",
  66012: "Yallii, Yallal yeemeneeh,kay Farmoytitil yeemene maral ceelallo yoogore,Mar yam Qimraan Baxay isi Sambo Dalwak dacrisseh gurra,Yalli Jibriil fuffa edde iyyam amrise,Yallih xiqtoh Qiisa maryam Baxal Abba maleh soolimitte,Yallih Sharaa-iq aw Diinitteey,kay Kitoobaay,kayFarmoytitil obbimte nummasseh,kay amritte xakabaanam kee kaywaasoosik yaadiyeenimil,Taaqa abeenitik tiyak tee nak ten",
  67000: "Suuratul Mulki\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nYallih Abbootanih duddaa kee kay xiqtoh aybulluyiyyaay,kay meysil uguu gusiyyaa kee kay digaalak takkaawisiyyi elle yan \n•    Tafsiiri:",
  67001: "Yallay Abbootan dubuh isi gabatleh Khayri yenebbeeh,yembeggeh,usuk ummaa nim xiiqeey,tu mayaffara",
  67002: ",Sinaamey-woo Yalli siinik taama miyyi meqem gibbataggidah,Raba gineeh mano gine,usuk maysoliiy inkitti kaak mayaysa,isi Naqoosak faxenumuy yende bbeh Zambi cabé ",
  67003: "Woo Yalli Malcina Qaranwa gine,Qaran kee Qaraanih faanat titta xagiyyi anekkah,ummaan Qaran teetik amol yan Qaraanak daga yan.yablow-Yalli ,gineeemih fanat faxe tittak tatur aw tittat biceway matabla.Mabla gacisey qanxixuh aw fellaaqah tablem maaylito?! woh matabla,tablem akim hinnay naggaarimteh temqe Gino",
  67004: "Tokkeek Inti wakaak wakak lakal qagitay gacis,ku mabla qaybi aw cooca  Qaran Ginot ablekkah is ecella,wagittok iggiriqqa,uqunxuyyateh kol aduurele",
  67005: "Baaxo fan xayuk raaqa Qaran ifta Cutuukat diggah qax neymeeqe,too Cutuuka ,Dabiititiy maabba garaqta Shayaatin edde garriyimta abneeh,ken cararissah Akheeral urta Gira gulguluh keenih hayne",
  67006: "Qhiyaamah Ayro isi Rabbil koroositemari,urta Girah digaala lon,maxxo uma mandabbaay,fanah akak yandabbeenim ",
  67007: "Girat assiyimawak,kaxxam gibdiih,qax uma xongolo teetik yaabben,is Buuti akah yafuurennah tafuureh",
  67008: "Tet addal cula maral le naqabih gibdak  gexxaamah,baali baalik teetik kurruu mah,baxsimam xayyoowa,Korosmarak butta tet addat elle qambinnaanimil tee til awlaytiinoh tan Malaa-ika,assacokki esseroh ken essertah:Addooniyal  !?Yallih digaalaksin meysiisa Farmoyti siinil mamattoo",
  67009: ",Korosuu:yeey,diggah Farmoytay Yallih digaalak nee meysiisa nel myemeeteeh dirabbosneh inte,YalliWacyik oobisem mali,Farmoytiitow-Cakkik naba makoh addat teneenih akkewaytek isin akim hinniton kaak inne",
  67010: "Korosuu:xoqoysole maabbah noobbem akkinnay,aw Cakki Baatilik edde bax san qakkaloowiyyah qakkalowneh nenem akkinna,Giramarih addat gacak manannino,inkinnah Farmoytiitil neemeneh,oson baaheenim nummasneh aninniino Jannatti mara akkuk nen ",
  67011: ",Isinni Nafsittel Koroosinnaa kee dirabboysiyya yekeeleeniih,Gira cakkisiten Girammarih xexxaanow",
  67012: "Yalli Koros marih weeloolaa kee ken galatot yabba iyyewak,Iimaan marih :weeloo kee ken galtoh galab xago ciggiiliseeh,iyyeh <br/> Diggah woomaray dubut Yallak meysitaa,isinni Zambittek cabsot lon,naba galato loonuuh,woh Jannata",
  67013: "Sinaamey-isinni Yab qellisa aw ifa aba,Yalli kaa yaaxigeh,diggah kaay yisriye isi Naqoosah Sorkocoxxayloh addat tanim yaaxigi,wohuk tu kaak maqellitta",
  67014: "Ginoona inkih Giné qellittam kee qelluh lafitta intam yaaxgem hinna?!usuk isi Naqoosah xuwaaweey,ken caagid yaaxagi,teetik tu kaak maqellitta",
  67015: "Woo-usuk Baaxo guubuh amol akak gactoonu saliniih,xamcinim siinih abe,tet ,gambittee kee exxaaxil gexa,kay Rizqhiy tet addal siinih gulgulsume ukuma cisab kee galatoh,sin mandabba dubuh kaa fana",
  67016: "Guubuh sahliniih,xamcinim tekkeh tenek wadiril,Qhaaruunuk rigidik tet akah qanxisnennah,Yallay Qaraanal yani Baaxo rigidik siinil qanxiseh,tugxuxek wa !?diril,taa-is liggiy intaamak isinni taamineenii",
  67017: " Luut maral Qaraanak akah ruubennah,Qaraanak Xeet siinil ruubaamak Yallay ,Qaraanal yanik isinni taamineenih inna?!yi digaala intih tabloonawaytanwak  yimeysisso aaxgetton,takkay ikkah digaala tubleenik wadiril edde maxoqoy simtan",
  67018: "Diggah ta Yallat tasgallok tookome Ummatitte dirabbosseh,isinni koroosinnaa kee dirabboosiyyal elle yeedeyenwak,Yallih digaala keenil obte,yi faxe way nan aw assacokka keenil anninnak ten?!diggah gibdi assacokka aw faxewaynak ten",
  67019: "Ta dirabbooseenit keenil amol Kimbir haaddawak,wakak teena isi Galwa Ha wal aw Qaran kee Baaxok fana fakka haytaah,gersi adda isiffan xambaqtam ma yablaana,Baaxol radaanamak Yallaksa ken tabbixem matan,usuk ummaanim yabli,tu kaak maqellitta",
  67020: "Korosey-sin digaalam faxek,Yallih digaala siinik horta Qande manton,Koros duquurumeenitikkah akim hinnon,Sheetan ken duquuruseeh kaal duquurumen",
  67021: "Sin fan maadaamak Yalli isi Rizqhi siinki hoorek,inkitti sin mayarzuqha,inki nnah tekkemii,diggah Koros aaxgih ciniyyaay,kaxxamariinoo kee Cakkik hoori maanamat bisoh iyyen",
  67022: "Faxe numuy Foocah raddayeh,kaal afgamuumuh gacca iyyeh gexannaa-usuk Yallat yasgalliiy-tirtoh taysem,hinnammay Moomintuy massale gital masso  !?wwa iyyeh gexa yayse ",
  67023: "Farmoytaw-ta Yallat tasgalloh dirabbooseenitik:woo singintem Yalla,Maaboo biy edde taabbeeni siinih hee,Mablay edde tableeni siinih hee,Sorkocoxxayloy edde taaxigeeni aw edde qakkalowtaana siinih hee,kay Niqmatittey sin amol heel kaa mafatittaana dagoh inxec",
  67024: "Farmoyatw-ta Yallat tasgalloh dirabbooseenitik:woo Baaxol sin fixixisseh cayxuh sin haytem Yalla,sin Xeet kee Cooxuy tu gine sinni hinna,cisab kee galatoh Qhiyaamah Ayro dubuh kaa fan gaaboowetton,sin Xeet kee Coox fan hinna,kaak meysi taay,dubuh kaa uqbuda inxec ",
  67025: "Ugutma dirabbooseenit,ugutmah ayxeexiyyah:Mucammadow-ta xaganay koo  kee kuwaday akah nee xagnisaanaa,amaatele taxxaaceenimil nummeynit tekkee nik mal qooy?!iyyan",
  67026: "Farmoytaw-:Saaqat aw Qhiyaamah ixxigah tu gactek,Yallih garil tan, malqo takkem kaaksah taaxigem matan,yoh tu gactekiiy,anu meysiisey,yi meysissot  baxxaqqa siinihle kinniyo",
  67027: "Xagani keenil oobeeh,digaala keenit xayim yublenwak,woh Qhiyaamah Ay  rooy,Yallal koroosite marih Foocitte milaagimteeh,dattowwate,keenik:tah Addooniyal gorrisak teneenimiy,assexeexuk teneeni tanxaccime",
  67028: " Farmoytaw-ta-Yallat tasgalloh dirabbooseenitik,keenik assacakkuk:Yalli yoo ,beek,Moominiinik yollih yanmara beek,aw neh racmateeh,ni uddur udurroosek Koros dananissa digaalak iyyi catele?!yoh warisay,inkitti ken akak macata inxic ",
  67029: "Farmoytaw-ta Yallat tasgallok:usuk fidin racmattaliy,dubuh isi Qibaadafan sin seeca,kaal neemeneh,ni caagiidal dubuh kaal qikinna,massaggital yanmarak ba xxaqqale mkol yan mari iyya kinnim tittak aaxigettoonum raqmali nxec ",
  67030: "Farmoytaw-ta Yallat tasgallok:sin Leey akak taquubeeni,Baaxot fuuqunteh maacisseeh,tet fan guftaanam xiqewayteenik,mango Leey gexxa iyyi siinih baa hele?!yoh warisay,Yallaaksah inkitti mabaaha",
  68000: "Suuratul Qhalam\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nYallay yisriyeeh fayyaye,isi Nabiyyih caalat maqaaneh sumaaqiteeh,kaak kalkaa leeh,kaa yisgir gireh  \n•    Tafsiiri:",
  68001: "Nuun,tet bisleemil Baqharâ Suuratak qimbol Yab tatureh.Yalli Bedeenal aw Kalamal xiibite,Sinam fiirissaamal aw taktubeemil xiibite",
  68002: "Farmoytaw-Ambiyinnetik Yalli kol hee Niqmatal,atu Cabuli hinnito,inkinnah Yallat tasgallo kol hayte cabuk,inkinnah atu nagay tan",
  68003: "Diggah atu Sinam fan Farmo yakkuqeenimik,edde calwayittaamal,aggiriqqe sinni galato lito,wohul inkitti kol loowa maqaaneh kol lem mali",
  68004: "Diggah atu naba caalatay,Qhur-aan baaheh amol tan,atu kay addal taniimil duddaluk calloote numu",
  68005: "Atu abletto,ta dirabbooseenit ablelon",
  68006: "!?Cakki waqinal gacuwaawak,siinik cabulem iyya kinnim baxxaqitele ",
  68007: "Farmoytaw-diggah ku Rabbi kay Gitak iyyi makitem yaaxigeh,teetih fan tirra iyye marat ixxigah waakitah,diggah teetik makkottem ken kinniih,diggah teetih fan tirratem koo kinnim yaaxigeh",
  68008: "Farmoyataw-atu bahtem dirabbooseenit maateeqin",
  68009: "Koh xammacooweenih koh geleloonah,Diini ruubul aw Diini biyaktaamal keenih xammacowtah geleltam loowitaanah ",
  68010: "Ummaan Baatilih Xiiba mangoy,burrutume maateeqin",
  68011: "Ken fan baxisaggidah,Sinaamat cami mangooy,ken fanat yabti beytol gexo mango",
  68012: " Khayri kalitto Mango,Sinaamak ken Maaluuy,ken konnabnaa kee ken Nafsittel dikkak taturé,Zanbii kee maqsiyat mangó ",
  68013: "Gibidiiy kafnoyta,akkewaamarih num kinniyoh yaxxacciy,keenit xakbime aw Ilmoyta",
  68014: "Maal kee Xaylo luk yeneemih taagah,Yallaa kee kay Farmoytal yaamineenimil kaxxiteh",
  68015: "Ni Aayatitte kaal kawsimtawak:dumimmarih akkaloylittek yuktubeenimi iyye",
  68016: "Kaysanal qax kaa taysaammeeh,kaak baxsime sinni asta kaak heenno",
  68017: "Bustaan mari tu dagoytit teetik xagewaytaggidah,maaca sissikuk Caxammiru yargiqoona xiibitenwak,akah gabbatnennah,Nanu taYallat tasgallo Qabar kee Qululul gabbatneh",
  68018: "isinni Xiibal (Yalli faxek )inta isinni maxcal mayyaaqinnon  ",
  68019: "Yalli Gira tet fanah ruube,tet mari xiinit yaniih,Gira teetik hooraanam maxi qaanaay tet tokmeh",
  68020: "Ditele Barih innah datuk maacisse",
  68021: "Maaci uddur baali baalih deeriseh",
  68022: "Axcuk:Caxammiru akak yargiqe mara tekkeenik,Baacoytit sin Buqre tamaatee mik afal,udduurut hinnammay waqlat uguta ",
  68023: "Baali baalillih xongolo addah hayya heeh walalak sissikuk,isinni Buqre fan gexen",
  68024: "Baali baalik:alqo inki tu dagoyti siinil culewaay iyya",
  68025: "Oson elle yaxxaccen innal xiiqeenit tikka iyyeenih,Maacak qimbot Caxammiru kalitaanamal irgiqqa heenih gexen",
  68026: "Cararteh taniih tet yublenwak,Baali baalik:diggah tet Gitak makot genxeh nan iyye ",
  68027: "Inkinnah nanu tu dagoytit teetik hooraamal nirgiqeemih sabbatah,tet Caxammiru nafiileemik hoorimneh nanih nan",
  68028: "Keenik yayseh yan num:teetik Baaccoytit baxaasaanamal tirgiqenwak:Yalla tiysi riyeenih kaafan andabbinnitoonuy?! siinik maxacciyo keenik iyye",
  68029: "Ni Rabbi yisriyeh ,ni Bustaanih Caxammiruk Baacoytiitil kalinnaamal nirgi qewak,ninni Nafsitte Yuzlume mara nekke iyyen  ",
  68030: "Saliggital isinni Yaabat yaduureenimit yufkunen",
  68031: "Darraqak gexxaamah:ni baxaysow,Baacoytit ken Cakkik horrewak,dikkak  tature mara nekke iyyen",
  68032: "Bustaanak Khayrih tanim Yalli neh milaagam takkeh,nanu fayxi dubuh Yalla fan lino,qafuuka kaak qagna,Khayri kaak esserra",
  68033: "Tannale digaalah,nee yiqsiye mara Rizqhik baxaasaanamal digaallah,gibdaa  kee raagiyya kaak yaaxigeenim akkinna,Akheeraddigaala wohuk nabah",
  68034: ",Kay amritte xakabaanam kee kay waasok waaliyaanamal Yallak meysita mari isinni Rabbih garil,diggah Niqmat addal akak geyan Jannatitte le,ken Niqmat mayaggiriqqa",
  68035: "Makki marak Yallat tasgallo akah taxxaccennah,galtol Muslimiin Koros inna !?abennoo",
  68036: "!?Yallat tasgalloy-macaay litoonum-taa Zulmik tan makole madqa mannal abtan",
  68037: "Hinnammay Kitaabay Taaqa abee kee maqsiyatli massow addal akak kawi !?ssaana maay liton",
  68038: "Diggah isin woo Kitaabih addal Akheeral doorittaanam litoonumih idni litoonuu,bleey caagid wonna hinna",
  68039: "Hinnamamy Xiibal diggowte Ateebanittey,isin sinni Nafsitteh madqittaanam !?litoonum taysibixe aw faxsissa nel maay liton ",
  68040: "Farmoytaw-tamaxco yaxxacce marak:Caabih iyya loonuh?! ken esserey",
  68041: "Hinnammay Yallat agleytiitiy ,allak kalah galatoh Moominiinit ken massossa maay lon?!tamari galtol Moominiinilih ken massooseloonu yaxxacceenimil nummeynit yekkeenik,isinni agleytit bahitoonay",
  68042: "Qhiyaamah Ayro hagga tambulluyeleeh,ni Rabbi isi Sarba yaybulluyeh,Sinam kummutuh fan seecimta,Moominiin kummuttah,Koros kee Munaafiqhiin kummu taanam maqanaanaay raaqaanah",
  68043: ",Mabla aw Intiita keenik tuqunxuyem tikkateh,qunxiinaa kee darraqa ken bulta alqo edde yaniinimik qafuh anih,diggah Addooniyal kummutaanam keenik esse rak yenen",
  68044: "Farmoytaw-faxemaray ta Qhur-aanay kol obbiime dirabboosel yoo cab,woh Datee kee tu tuh elle ken abbixiyya kinnim akak aaxigewaan ikkeek digaala fan caddo caddoh ken wakayenno",
  68045: "Isinni Zambit bisoh gexaanaggidah,uddur yanoonay ken axce,yi Date Koroosi nnaa kee dirabboosiyyi marah caylale,yok mayaftucan,yi digaalak mayasilliman",
  68046: "Farmoytaw-fanah ken akaksectaamal galto keenik maay faxxa,oson tohih sabba tah naba caagid yakkuqeenii,tah kendarre cabiyyak sababannaa?!abinah tanim tohuk saduh taniimi,atu Qasbi aw galato keenik messerta,koo katayaanamak ken !?hortam macaay",
  68047: "Hinnammay oson qellut taniimih ixxiga loonuh,alhumittey teetil koo edde giddi !?yaanay,keeenit meqem akak yaktubeeni maay lon ",
  68048: "Farmoytaw-lagsiyyat aw edde ken yabbaxuwaamat yanoonay ken iyyaamal,ku Rabbih madqewak isbir,kay marah abe ceeril Kullimti wadayti nagayna kaal tanay,Yuunus inna makkin,usuk Baddi ditee kee Kullumti diteh addat gibdaa binat yaniih isi Rabbih deerise",
  68049: "Yallih racmatta kaa aleelewannaa,ilaq lenum aw dareemime num tikka iyyeh Kullumti foyyak tan Baaxol kaa gasiyak yen",
  68050: "Kay rabbi kaa dooreh kay,isi Naqoosah tiyak teena kaa abe",
  68051: "Yallal koroositeeh,kay Farmoyta dirabboose mari,koofan aban ilaalah gibdak gexxaamah,isinni Intiitat koo yankiseenim xayyoowan way,taa kol oobbiime Qhur-aan yoobbenwak,isinni nabsi fayxi katayakaay,Cakkit darre cabak:-di ggah kaa baahe Farmoyti Cabuli iyyan",
  68052: "Kol obbiime Qhur-aan,Sinam kee Ginnih kassittoo kee kassiisikkah akim hinna",
  69000: "Suuratul Caaqhqha\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nQhiyaama takkeeh tet addat galto tanim,Cakkiy bohoy sinni kinniimih diggoosiyyi elle yan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  69001: "Yalli inkih taniimil nummawta ugutmassaaqatat yaaba",
  69002: " ?Tokkeek tet caagid ta esserol yaynabeh:Caaqhqha aw nummaawa macaay",
  69003: "?Ta Caaqhqha aw nummaawa maca kinnim maca koo tiysixxige",
  69004: "Qhiyaamâ haggah gibday Sinam koociyta aw taatuke,Samuud Saalic maraa kee ,Qaad Huud mari dirabbosseh",
  69005: "Samuuduh tu gactek,xongoloy gibdaa kee haggat illacabo guftet,diggah Yalli  ken bayise",
  69006: "Qaadah tu gactek, gibda Caacaytay xamciniih,oskoyyobo le xongolo ley,kafi niih,kafnat illacabo guftet diggah Yalli ken bayiseh",
  69007: "Yalli Malcina Ayroo kee Bacra-Bar yakke uddur,saabo maleh carrokka ken   haa keenil ruube,mara isinni Buxaaxih addal bayeenih,Baaxol yinnikiseenih qangalaalah ken table,ken baytik wadiril Nakliddaaboobiy,Baaxol raddeh tembexeh innah gacan",
  69008: "!?Digaala ken geytek wadiril,keenik raqte Nafsih tablem litoo",
  69009: " Firqawnaay,Ummatittek kaak afammaraay,daga guba akak korisak digaalimte Gadaay,oson Luut maray,Yallat asgalliyyaa kee maqsiyatak,hoxi taamat yee meeten aw aben ",
  69010: ",Keenik ummaanih mari,keenih fan rubbuusume Farmoyta yiqsiyeeh,dirabboseh ken baati elle duddaamak ossitinâ mabbuuxuh Yalliken yibbixeh",
  69011: "Nanu Lee fayyol dikkak taturtewak,ni amrih nagayna kaal tanay Nuuc abe Doo nikiy gexxat,isin Xiixooxat akak sugten mara nukkuqeh,too ken quuki sin quuka yekke  ",
  69012: "Doonik keetet gabbaqtu Koros bayisiyyaa kee Iimaan le mara catiyyal elle  yassa cassen kassitto abnuuy,taabbem raaqissa Ayti kaadu tet raaqissu abne ",
  69013: "Fooximal awlaytiino le Malaa-ikayti,Fooximat fooxisawak,is Nammay haytô  Fooximaay ",
  69014: "Baaxoo kee Qalelwa fayyate,ken Nammay inki adda gibdi utkah imuttukka  iyyeh,Baaxok exxaaxii kee tet Qalelwah exxaaxih kurte",
  69015: "Toh inkih takkuwayta Ayro Qhiyaama takkeh",
  69016: "Woo Ayro Malaa-ika kaak obtaggidah Qaran bakaqah,titta tabbixe gibdaamak yenek wadiril,usuk woo Ayro boolale",
  69017: "Malaa-ika kay exxaaxii kee kay arwal tan,too nabah Ayro ku Rabbih Qarshi Yallat xayi Malaa-ikak Bacaar yakkuqe",
  69018: "Sinaamey-too Ayro Yallal xayyoowetton, faxem takkeemih sin caagidik qelli ttam maqellitta Yallak,inkinnah Yalli tet yaaxigeeh,teetil boositah",
  69019: "Faxenumuy Kay taamah Kitab migdak akah temcewweh tu gactak,ruftoo kee qafadak gexxaamah:ibbixay, yi taamah Kitab kawisa iyya",
  69020: "Anu Addooniyal uguteyyom eexegeeh,yigaltot garayeyyom digga hee",
  69021: "Inki waarah Niqmatak yableenimik gexxaamah,usuk tenkeecene manoh addat yan ",
  69022: "Fayyole arac kee caddole Jannatih addal yan ",
  69023: "Tet Caxammiri faxe numuy tet aleelah xayih",
  69024: "Massakaxxah:Addooniyal taturte Ayroorah addat tatrussen meqe taamah sabba tah,aza edde ane sinni makmok maaqaboh,ukumaay uquba keenik yaxcen ",
  69025: "Faxe numuy kay taamah Kitab guurak akah yemcewweh tu gactek,darraqaggi bdak gexxaamah:yidi gaala dirki abta uma taamay kaal tanik gexxaamah,woyyo yi taamah Kitab yoh amcawwe wanna iyya",
  69026: " Woyyo yi cisab maca yakkem aaxigewanniyoy ",
  69027: " Woyyo qimbô Rabay akah rabe,inkinnah wadiriik akak ugutewaa raba akkinna",
  69028: "Yi Maali,Yallih digaalak tu yok mahoorinna ",
  69029: "Yi alhumuy, caylaa kee migaaqak aw Reedak elle qikitak enem yok qellitteh",
  69030: "Malaa-ikay-Kaa-ibbixaay,Gab Fillat kaak gaabossa haa,tanxaccime ",
  69031: "Tokkeek tet laqnat ceyitaggidah,Gira kaa culus",
  69032: "Tokkeek tet xexxan Malcina tabanih cusul akak yakke Katiinat kaa culusa",
  69033: "Diggah usuk Yallay nabal aamanuk mana",
  69034: "Tu dagoytit maskamol isik kalah yan mara malallaba",
  69035: "Qhiyaam Ayro elle xayiy digaala kaak hoora mali",
  69036: "Girâmarih Dagaarak tunxumuumeemiksah,Maaqoy yakme mali",
  69037: "Zambittee kee maqsiyatleelakkalih mari,too maaqo mayakma",
  69038: "Yalli tableenimil xiibite",
  69039: "Ablewaytaanamal xiibite",
  69040: "Diggah Qhur-aan Yallih Yaaba,kay Farmoytay meqe Sinaamal kawisa",
  69041: "Qadaarê Yab hinna,woh akah kinnim Qadar xisnel mayan,dagoom mataaminan",
  69042: "Ginnil Yab hinna,Ginnileelâ Yab ta Qhur-aanak baxsale caagidi,dagoom makassittan",
  69043: "Takkay ikkah inkih tan Ginô Rabbik obbiime",
  69044: "Mucammad axcewayne Yaabak baali nel axaccoy aw hannaa",
  69045: "Cane kaak gacisak neneeh,nek caylaa kee xiqtot kaa abbaxuk nen",
  69046: "Tokkeek Sorkocobbaxat xakbima Ramad kaak argaquk nen",
  69047: "Siinit kaak nee hortam matan,sin taagah axcewaynem nel haam xeexih",
  69048: "Diggah Qhur-aan kay amritte xakabaanam kee kaywaasok waalimaanamal isi nni Rabbik meysita marah kassitto",
  69049: "Nanu sin fanat ta Qhur-aan dirabboosa mari yanim naaxigeh ",
  69050: "Diggah Qhur-aan dirabboosaanam Qhiyaamah Ayro naba darraqale ",
  69051: "Qhur-aan asmatle Cakkiy,Yallih gariik yani kinnim geyyawayya mali,bohoy mali",
  69052: "Farmoytaw-ku Rabbi kaah ceele sinniimik saytunnos,ku Rabbiy nabammigaa  qat yab",
  70000: "Suuratul Maqaarij\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nQhiyaamah Ayro Ginô gurraa kee ken galtoh baxxaqsi elle yan  \n•    Tafsiiri:",
  70001: "Ta digaala tan digaala tekkek iyyeh,Yallat tasgallok kallace isi Nafsii kee isi maral kallaceh aw Abaaro abe,woh kaak anqasa,woo digaala Qhiyaamah Ayro radelem raq mali",
  70002: "Yallal koroosite marih le,faxe tiyay ta digaala hoora mayan",
  70003: "Yallay fayyooy,Magaarwaay aw mawqooqiiiy,muxxoo kee Niqmatitte lek yan",
  70004: "Too Magaarwat Qhiyaamah Ayro Malaa-ikaa kee Jibriil kaafan tawqe,woh   xex Ayroy caggud akak Kontom alfih liggida yakke",
  70005: "Farmoytaw-wiriggaa kee weeqa edde anewayta sabrih isbir",
  70006: "Diggah osota digaala xeex imiy,akkiyya akak akkewaynuh yanik yablen",
  70007: "Nanu raq sinniimiy xayuk takkeh nable",
  70008: "Qaran Nucaasaay,qasa Lakqoo kee ken Nammayak kalah,ken Nammayih innah  diyaytaamih inna takkuwayta Ayro",
  70009: "Qalelwa sissaakeh Qutbinna takke ",
  70010: "Xayi num xayi numih gurra messera,woh akah kinnim ummaan num isit agxita ",
  70011: "Ummaanih num isi elle xayi yableeh,kaak maqellita,tohulluk arac haggak ge xxaamah,tii tiya messera,faxe numuy Gira cakkisitee,isi aftok Xaylo tatrusam yakcine",
  70012: "Isi Qasaalaa kee toobokoyta naddoysitam faxa  ",
  70013: "Woo maray gibdaabinal kallih soola,kay Kedok kaak elle xayih yani naddoy sitam faxa",
  70014: "Sinaamaay,Ginnii kee ken Nammayak kalah Baaxol ennatam inkih naddoysi ttaay,tokkeek too naddoysitiyyi kaa iysillimmaheeh,Giraddigaalak kaa catam faxa  ",
  70015: "Caagid ta-umeeni akah loowitenna aw faxenna hinna,diggah is Akheerâ Giray urtaah tankakamme",
  70016: "Tet laqnaa kee urimih gibdak gexxaamah,Moyyah Arab gibdi baxsah baxissa",
  70017: " Faxe numuy Cakkit darre cabeeh,kaak yexxeeximeeh,kaal aamineweeh,kaal taamite weeh kaaytah ",
  70018: "Maal gaabooseh,Yallih Gitah kaak yaceemik cillallooweh",
  70019: "Diggah Sahdayti gibdi baaker leeh ginniime",
  70020: "Lakimak,aw Baacak umam kaa geytek,Sabri dago yekke",
  70021: "Assamaaqaay,gaddaliinok ruffa kaa haytam geek,Yallih Gitah yaceemil hooro mango yekke",
  70022: "Salaatá aw Salat aba mari akak raqqa iyyawaka,oson too uma weeloolik yisillime mara",
  70023: "Woomarii, isinni Salaatal xuguugula mara,teetik agxet maraaqan,teetih dikkay sime uddurul tet aban",
  70024: "Woomari isinni Maalul,dikkaysime aw waadoysime maglabay dirki abeeni lon",
  70025: " Woo numuy faxe sababah takku Rizqhik baxaysitee,ken esseru ken esserewayu kaah yaceenih",
  70026: "Woomarii, Qhiyaamah Ayro nummaasah,Yalli ummaanih mara cakkisitaana  mah galatuwaa Ayro",
  70027: "Woomarii, meqe taamak tatruseenim loonuh anuk,isinni Rabbih digaalak meysitaanah",
  70028: "Diggah ken Rabbih digaala meysi leemiy,Qaqhli le num is akak aaminewaa",
  70029: "Woomarii,tet yastureenim kee uma taamak yayxeexeenimil,isinni Sambooba dacrisa mara",
  70030: "Ken Qasaaloolii kee Naqoosak Koboreenim akak raqqa intawaka,fidoh angaa raw kee wohuk addah taniimih keenit xoqoysimaanamah,diggah oson elle mada reemiman aw assacokka elle malon",
  70031: "Faxe numuy Qasaaloolii kee Naqoosak taa galab akak xaggiimeemikkalih imit xoqoysimiyya gorrisee,too mari Yallih dikkak tature mara",
  70032: "Woomarii,oson Maalaay,qellut taniimiiy,wohuk kalah taniimik elle yemeeme nimeenimiiy,isinni xaganittey Sinaamah culeeni dacrisaanah,ken amaana ma ganan,ken xagana mayaggilan",
  70033: "Woomarii,oson isinni mingiril elle faxxiimannal soolan,elle xayii kee kooka xaw raat aw diihay keenil macabta",
  70034: "Woomarii,oson isinni Salat dacrisan,tet uddurul tet abaanamaay,saytunaanee kee tassal abaanamal,agxise teetik ken akak magxisa",
  70035: "Toomaray too weeloolal welloowe,daffeynah elle waaran Niqmat kee Yallay meqê Fooci wagittok edde garayaanamak gexxaamah, konnabna leela tikka iyyaanah Jannatitteh addal gacan",
  70036: "Farmoytaw-kumarak ta Yallat tasgalloy ku-arul tani,koo dirabboosaanamat !?yasissikeenim fan ken giitem macaay",
  70037: "Butta buttah, Migdaa kee Gurat maro kok hee mara tikka iyyeenih ",
  70038: "Keenik ummaanih tii,usuk isi Koroosinnal elle anuk,Yallii Niqmatak yan Janna !?tay,tet addal taniimit elle waara Niqmat akak geya,kaa culusam qaagitaa",
  70039: "Caagid oson isinni moyyal akah miicisen inna hinna,nanu yaaxigeenimik ken ginne,diggah burale Leek ken ginne,oson boola leelá,isinni Nafsitteh tuxxiq !?makobran tukkalot makobran,mannal kaxxitaanaah",
  70040: "Yallay fayyaye isi Nafsil xiibiteh,usuk Ayrooy,Alsaa kee kalah tan cutuukah mawqooqii kee culmaamih Rabbi,nanu xiiqeeniti",
  70041: "Keenik kalah Yalla yateeqe mara keenit korisaanaah,ken bayisnam,woh mana ,ffara,ken bayisiyyaa kee keenik kalah yan marat ken milagnam faxinnaanihwak woh abennokkah gaceenit hinnino",
  70042: ",Farmoytaw-Baatil kee makok edde yanniinimit giirisoonay inxecay ken cab ,Qhur-aanal akah xaggansimen Qhiyaamah Ayrot ongoorowwa iyyaanam fan isinni Addooniyah manol digiroonay",
  70043: "Maysaguqwak isinni Simbilih fan yamookome marih innah,sissikuk yawqoona waan Ayro",
  70044: "Ken mabla aw Intiita taqunxuyeh,qunxiina tet buulta,toh Addooniyal akah xaggansimak yenen Ayroy,caagid edde aallewaak yeneeni",
  71000: "Suuratu Nuuc\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nNuuc gabbaqtuk,seeco abah sectô tadaddeera aw wale innih baxxaqsi elle yan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  71001: "Yallat agleyta haanamay bagul akak yeniinih sabbatah,dananissa digaala keenil tamaateemik afal,isi mara meysiisaggidah nanu Nuuc kaymara fan seecuh rubne",
  71002: "Nuuc isi marak:Maraw,Yallafan andabbewayya hayteenik,anu Yallih digaalay sin qambaltak baxxaqqale meysissoh sin meysiise kinniyo iyye ",
  71003: "Yi meysisso aw anu siinit aba meysisso taysibixem:dubuh Yalla uqbuda,tu kaat masgallina,kay amritte xakabaanam kee kay waasoosak waaliyaanamal kaak meysita,sin edde amrisaamal yoo eteeqa siinik axceemi",
  71004: "Diggah isin toh abteenik,Naqoosah Cakkittet axawah anewaytam,sin Zambittek Yalli siinih cabele,Yallih ixxigal waadoysime uddur fan,sin Ummatak manol uddur siinih ayxeexele,tohul massowtaanamfan Baaxol mannoowetton aw aqee shetton,diggah Rabi yemeetek muudurroota,taaxigeenim akkoy Yallat tasgallee nim kee makok amol akak taniinimik,tandabbeenim kee Yallal yaamineenimfan asissikuk tenen",
  71005: "Nuuc:yi Rabbow, anu Bar kee Loqo xuguuguluh ku Qibaadaa kee ku inki ttoysiyya fan  yimara seeceh",
  71006: "Yi secto ken elle seecaamak,gilaa kee kudmaksah keenih ossem mali",
  71007: "Anu dubuk ku Qibaada abaadaay,ku Taaqaa kee ku Farmoyti Taaqak,ken Zam bitteh cabsotih sabab edde yaniimil ken seceecinnaanwak,isinni Feeraarat isi nni Aytiita aliffa heen,yi secto taabbeemmik tet hooroona aban,yoo ablewoona isinni Foocitte isinni Sarat aliffa heen,Yallat yasgalleenimik bagul akak yanii nimil bisoh gexen,ken elle seecam oggolaanaah,kaah addah gacaanamak kaxxa mariteenih",
  71008: "Tokkeek anu-yi Rabbow-ifah ken seece",
  71009: "Yi sectoh elle aba maknayitte qaynat qaynatah keenih haak,tokkeek anu sectol xongolo fayya keenih heeh,qellita qelluh qellissa keenih hee,addah yan anayal keenih seece",
  71010: "Keenik:maraw,kaafan yandabbeenimil sin Rabbik cabsot gorrisa,diggah kaay yisriyye isi Naqoosak faxe numuy kaafan yedebbeh,Zambitte cabe yekke exce",
  71011: "Diggah isin toh abteenik,kaak agxitinnaanwak Yalli Rob kataatayah siinih oobise leeh,maqabartan",
  71012: " Maaluu kee Xaylo mango siinih aceele,tet Caxammiruk akak takmen Bustaan wa siinih abele,Illaltittey Leek akak taaqubeniih,isinni Buqree kee isinni Saqa akak tafqeeni siinih abele ",
  71013: "Maraw-caagid sinnah kaa taqsiyenwak,Yallih nabnak ma meysittaanah macaay !?litoonum",
  71014: "Diggah Yalli ranko rankoh aw tuuk tu fan sin korisak Qunxuffeytaak,Dalboy taak,Cadoytak sin gine",
  71015: "!?Qaran Qaraanak amol,Yalli Malcina Qaranwa elleginenna matablaanaa",
  71016: "Keenik Addooniyâ Qaraanal Baaxommarah ifuh Alsa hee,Ayro iftaamaycay  lale Ifule abe",
  71017: "Sin Abba Aadam buurik gineemih sabbatah, Yalli Baaxok sin gine,tokkeek isin is siinih taysubukem xagtan",
  71018: "Tokkeek rabteenik wadiril tet addat sin gacisa,tokkeek teetik ugutmah mawqah sin ayyaaqele",
  71019: "Yalli Baaxo fiddimteemiy,guubuh gulguluh gacte abe",
  71020: "Toh teetik fidin Gititte Calaalih taamah goranah edde gexxaanamih qaagoh siinih abe",
  71021: "Nuuc:yi Rabbow-diggah yimari ku inkittoosiyyaa kee ku Qibaadak ken elle am ,riseemil yoo yiqsiyeenih,keenik addah yan mari keenik Abbobtihyan maray  Maalkee Xalayah Niqmat elle hayte katayen,Niqmatak keenil haytem makoksah keenih ossem mali iyye ",
  71022: "Keenik Kaxxamari addah yan mara Nuucut yaysasammeenimil uguugusenwak naba Date aben  ",
  71023: "Isinni katayeenitik:sin Yallitteh Qibaada macabina,sin Xeet kee Cooxuk,Wa ddiiy,Suwaaqaay,Yaghuusaay,Yaquqh kee Nasri Qibaada macabina iyyen",
  71024: "Ta isinni Xeet kee Cooxul diggah Sinaamak mango mara maken,yi Rabbow-Ko ,roosinnaa kee maqsiyatal elle yaadiyeenimil isinni Nafsi yuzlume marah  Cakkik makkoowaanamakkalih im keenih moosisin",
  71025: "Isinni hoxittey abeenih sabbatah,Addooniyal caddok muxxutte Leet yumunxu  qen,isinni rabaak wadiril saanih Gira culen,Yallak kalah cateenitiy Leet bayaa nam kee Girak ken catta magennon",
  71026: "Yalli kaymarak teemeneemikkalih im aaminewaytu waytam kaah warsewak Nuuc:yi Ra bbow,Baaxobbagul Korosuk inkittuy meekita aw yangayye maca  bin iyye",
  71027: "Yi Rabbow-diggah atu-kencabteeh,yanoonay ken intek ku Naqoosay Moominii nih tani makelon,umaaneliy koo ateeqewaah,Koroosinni akak gibidiy,Niqmatal koofaatitewaaksarrihim maxalan",
  71028: "Yi Rabboe yiZambitte yoh cab,yi Xaleenah cab,Moominiinih yi Buxa culla teemih cab,LabMoominiin kee Say Moominiinih cab,Koroosinnaa kee maq siyatal isinni Nafsitte yuzlume marah,baatii kee baxaysuk sarrihim moosisin",
  72000: "Suuratul Jinni\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nYallat tasgallô Diini finqiseh,Qhur-aan yoobbek wadiril Ginni gurraa kee ken Iimaanih baxxaqsi elle yan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  72001: "Farmoytaw-ku Ummatak-Batni Nakhla diqsita aracal Ginnik butta yakkemari yi :kawsah fan ankacisem Yalli yol wacyi oobise,isinni marafan yen debbenwak nanu addaffaknuu kee afloolinnal assakatle Yaabay,kawsima noobbe iyyen inxec ",
  72002: "Taa nanu noobbe Yab Sorkocobbaxi aamanal,Yab kee taamal tayseemil yasca sse,kaal neemeneh,ni Rabbiy kaa oobiset inkittu manasgalla",
  72003: "Neemeneeh,akah neemene ni Rabbih nabnaa kee massakaxxa fayyateeh-Yallat tasgallo akah intannah,Barra mahaysitinna,Baxa mahaysitinna",
  72004: "Diggah Ibliis Yallay yisriyeh Baxaa kee Barra qikisanwak,Yallal makot yan Yab axcuk yen",
  72005: "Sinam kee Ginnik Yallat tasgallo Barraa kee Baxale axxacenwak,nanu dirab yaabewaanam nekkele,ken salaliyyah ken Yab nummasneh",
  72006: "Jaahiliyyal aw Islaaminnâ Diinik afal meysile aracal oobanwak,Sinaamak Lab ha,Ginnik Labhat maggansitak yenen,keenik tiyakteeni:kaymarih duquurah umaa nek,ta Daqaarih Abbat maggansita iyya,Sinam Labha,Ginni labhak meysii kee cunxo ossitan",
  72007: "Ginnow-Sinam diggah isin akah tekkelen innah,kay rakba wadiril cisab kee gal toh Yalli inkittu uguteweelem yekkelen",
  72008: "Nanu Qaran Xaagu gorrisneh,Qaran Malaa-ikak caylale dacayri abeenitiy,abak nen maabbah garqak,tet dacrissak kibbimteh geyne,ummanih tii Qaraanat anxa wwinnaanih iyya,edde garriyima urta girak kibuk yan",
  72009: " Nanu duma Qaraanak arooca exxeebexxa haynah Malaa-ika tittal tabaatabissam akak ankacisak sugne,Baaxommarak Ginnileelah warisak sugne,caagid milaagi meh,nek faxetiyay tawak ankacise,urta Giray gulguluh kaah gacte geele,xayyo wwa iyyawak,kaal rubbuusumteeh kaa carrisseh",
  72010: "Nanu taa-gibdi dacayrih sabab manaaxiga,Baaxommarah umaane edde faxxim tennaa?hinnammay Yalli Khayri keenih edde faxe,diggah Qaran Xaagiiy nek yiggiriqqeh",
  72011: "Nanu-Ginni marak:-nek meqe maray Yallak meysita yan,nek Koros kee Yallih Taaqak yewqe mariyan,sissin qaynootaa kee tittak xex fayxiixa le marak sugne",
  72012: " Nanu caagid neh faxek Yallay yisriyek aftucewaynam digga hayne,kaymaro net taniimik gexxaamah kudmah kaak manaftuca",
  72013: ",Nanu Qhur-aanay massah tayseh taniimil tirra haa noobbewak,elle neemeneh faxe numuy isi Rabbil yeemene,isi maqaaneenah nakusik mameysita,Zambiy yookome Zambifan kaak ossiimak mameysita",
  72014: "Nanu Muslimiiniy Yallih Taaqah santiitimte aw massowte net tan,net fanah yan massaggitak makkoowe mari yan,faxe maray Yallih Taaqaa kee meqe taamal addah gacee,toomari Tirtoo kee taysem yicsibe mara  ",
  72015: " faxxiimaah fanah yan massaggitak Makkooweenitih tu gactek,Jahannam Bocoy sinaamak ken bisle marallih elle urta yekken  ",
  72016: "Ginnik butta kaa ankcissem Wacyih kaal akah oobisennah,Ginnii kee Sinam Islaaminnâ Gital,massoowwa iyyeenih kay addal taniimil taamitinnoonu,Yalli mangolee ken afquk yen,qaynat qaynatah tan Niqmatitte keenih osok yenem Wacyih kaafan oobiseh",
  72017: "Teetil ken gabbatanaggida,Yallih Niqmat faatitaanah innaa,hinnammay teetil koroo sitaanah?faxe numuy Qhur-aanaay,kassissoosak kay addal taniimit darre cabee,kay Rabbi yassukuqqem xiiqewaa gibda digaala kaa culusele",
  72018: "Diggah Masaagid lem kaay yisriyeey,kaak kalah yan marih im hinna,Yahuud kee Nasaara,isinni Kaniisaa kee Biyaq diqsita Qibaadah aracih addal,oson lon inna takkeenik Yallalluk tet addal inkittu maqbudina",
  72019: "Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay Mucammad,Batni Nakhla diqsita aracal isi Rabbi yaqbudu solla iyyewak,Ginnitte Qhur-aan kawsa yoobbenwak qoxxoggi bdak gexxaamah,tittak amol tiqirih gacam xayyoowe",
  72020: "Farmoytaw-ta Yallat tasgallok:anu inni Rabbi dubuk aqbude aw kallaca,faxe tiya yakkay Qibaadat kaak kalih im masgalla inxec",
  72021: "Keenik:Yalli siinil mekle umaane anu siinik hooraamih kobor mayyu,Yalli siinik hoore tuxxiq bahittoh kobor mayyu inxec",
  72022: "Keenik:kaa iqsiyek Yallak inkitti yoo macata,kaaksah edde qikitimeenay edde qikita mageya inxec",
  72023: "Takkay ikkah anu kobram,Yalli sin fan gufus iyyeh yoo edde amrisem sin gufu saama,kay Farmoy yoo edde ruube sin gufusaama,faxenumuy Yallaay,kay Far moyta yiqsiye diggah gay gaceeni,tet addal waarak waarimak Jahannam Gira cula, inkinnah teetik mayaqan",
  72024: "Koros Addooniyal digaalak akah xaggansimak yeneenim,Qhiyaamah Ayro ubu lla haanam fan,bagul akak yanin isinni koroosinnak makatan,toowak boolah umam iyya kinnim aaxigelon,Catoytiitih dagom iyya kinnim aaxigelon",
  72025: "Farmoyatw-ta Yallat tasgalloh ugutma tan gaddok:digaalak isin akah xaggan  simteenim xayim kee,hinnammay Yallaksarrah inkitti aaxigewaa uddurlem maaxiga keenik inxec",
  72026: "Usuk yisriyeeh,ummaanimiy qellut tani yaaxagi,tu kaak maqellitta,kay qellut leemil inkittu maboosisa,inkinnah kay ixxigah caglah raqta",
  72027: ",Kaay yisriye Farmoytak isih akah yikcinem aw raabitem akak raqqa intawak diggah kaay isih faxeemil boosisah,Farmoytaak kalih mari wohul boositewa  yuh,Far moytak foocaa kee darret,Malaa-ikay kaa dacrissa ruuba",
  72028: "Farmoyti kaak afal Farmoytit gufusoonuh elle ken amirise,isinni Rabbih Far mooma,Yalli xagroh maro teetit heemik gexxaamah,diggah gufseenim yaaxi geemih qaagoh abne,Yalli Malaa-ikaa kee Farmoytit garil taniimit ixxigah   maro hee,ummaanimih ixxima loowol hee,kaay yisriyek tu maqelltta",
  73000: "Suuratul Muzzammil\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nSectoqquukittel Sinam catta sababitteh addaffakoot elle yan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  73001: "Isi Sarat makkiimew,aw yunbudbudew,edde faxam:Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay Nabi ",
  73002: "Barak dagoomuuk kalih imit Salat ab",
  73003: "Faxxek garab kaak issilliy,aw sidoc heele af guftam fan garabak daggowwatam issilliy",
  73004: "Aw Namma Sidocheele af guftam fan osis,Qhur-aan kawissawak baxxaqisssa haay,kawsa caatih kaat aba",
  73005: "Farmoytaw- nanu Qhur-aan kol qidenno,usuk qilsa maxco,woh akah kinnim dirkitteetaay,dikkookiiy,madqooqii kee adabittey wohuk kalah tanim addat yabbixeemi",
  73006: ",Diggah Bartî Saaqoota,kawsalluk Sorkocobbaxat koobahsimiyyah gibdiih maxcah tayseh",
  73007: "Diggah loqoh addat ku taama taamittam lito,Qhur-aan kawsak teetit agxittam litoh,Baraay issilliy ",
  73008: " Mango qaynatih galab xagoh Yallih galab xaga,Qibaada kaa caggaloosak,kaay yisriye fan girquh iggiriqqa innxec",
  73009: ",Ayrommawqâ Rabbiiy,Ayrô culmâ Rabbi,kaaksah Cakkik yamqubbudi mayan awlaytuy inkih tan ku caagiidah  elle qikittah kaa exxeebex  ",
  73010: "Dirabbooseenit anqas kee xaafuk intaamal isbir,aza edde ane sinni xexxaanah ken eyxex",
  73011: "Dirabbooseenit,Addooniyassalafoofih xoqoysoh marat magxitin,yoo kee ken tittah cab,ken uddur keenih yamaatem fan dagoom keenih qambal",
  73012: "Diggah nanu Akheeral qilsa axawittee kee urta Gira lino",
  73013: "Qeeroggibdak gexxaamah Goroyra quxussa aw Goroyrat taadiye tan,tooko meemil ossitinah,dananissa digaala tan ",
  73014: "Too digaala,Qalelwaa kee Baaxo lig intuwayta Ayroy,Qalelwa haggak gexxaa mah Siisay cakakeh gexxa tekkee,dirabbooseenitit akkele ",
  73015: "  Farmoytah Firqawna fan akah rubnennah,Nagayna kaal tanay Muusaay,nanu sin fan,Qhiyaamah Ayro sin taamal sumaaqituwaa Farmoyta rubne",
  73016: "Firqawni kay Rabbik kaal rubbuusume Farmoyta yiqsiyeh,Addooniyal Leeh  amunxuqiyyaay,Akheeral Giraddigaalat gibda digaalah kaa diggaalle,kaa gey tem sin geytak isin isinni Farmoyta maqsiyina",
  73017: "Yallal koroositteeniih,kay Farmoyta dirabbosseenik,xex Ayroy gibdiih,hagga kee xexxan gibdak gexxaamah,qunxuu Alaaqak Amo edde caafitta Ayro, isinni Nafsitte anninnal hoorettoonuuh xaguretton",
  73018: "Woo haggak gexxaamah Qaran bakaqah,Yallih xagani takkeemiy raq sinni yekke",
  73019: "Diggah ta kassittoy-haggaa kee gibdak Qhiyaama Ayro addat taniimih,baxxa  qsa,addat tabbixee-kassittoy Moominiin edde xoqoysimta,faxe numuy isi Ra bbifan kaa gufusa Gita yaxxeebexem faxee,kaa yaxxeebexay",
  73020: "Farmoytaw-diggah ku Rabbi wakak teena,Barak Namma sidoc heele afak  daggowwatam soltam kokyaaxigeh,wakak teena garabaay,wakakteena Sidoc heele af solta,Moominik butta kollih solta,Yalli Bar kee Loqo caggudusah,ken Nam mayih Saaqat loowah,kaay yisriye kay Saaqota lowtaanaah elle tan innal digga haytaanam maduddaanam siinik yeexegeh,faxxim taamih goranah man  gom kaak soltaanam siinil agibdiyele,tohih asabbatah siinil yendebbeh,Barak siinil xamma coowinnanim issilliya,Moominiiney-siinik lakmisa maray lakimi yescele anelem Yalli yeexegeh,gersi mari Yallih rizqhi gorrisaanaah,Baaxol gaqaadan,gersimari Yallih kacanih fayxih,Yallih qangaraa,is daga gactu Qeebi aban,ta-mari Bartî Salat keenil yagibdiyeh,Barak siinil xammacoowinnaanim ,issilliya,Fardhi aw dirkî Salat dudda lennal baaha,sin Maalak Zakaat ucuya  ,sin Maalak Yallih Gitah ucuya,faxe Khayriy isinni Nafsih tatrussa haytaana Qhiyaa mah Ayro Yallih garil Khayrih yayseh,muxxoh nabaah geetton,cabsot Yallak gorrisa,diggah Yalli isi Naqoosak yandabbih cabe",
  74000: "Suuratul Muddassir \nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nDirabbooseenitil sectol yangiicilleeniih,Akheeraa kee Qhur-aanat ken meysii saanam amrih tan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  74001: "Isi Sarat buulumeew,Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay usuk Nabi",
  74002: "Ugutaay Yallih digaalak meysis ",
  74003: "Ku Rabbi eyneb",
  74004: "Ku Nafsi Zambittekiiy,ku Sara Najaasak saytunnos",
  74005: "Xeet kee Coox Qibaadak exxeex",
  74006: "Ku meqe taama elle tassamaggu qiloh,ku Rabbil maloowin",
  74007: "Azak koo garaytaamal Yallah isbir",
  74008: "Fooximat Nammay haytô fooxo foxisanwak",
  74009: "Too Ayro gibda Ayro",
  74010: "Yallal koroositeeh,kay Farmoytiitil koroositemaral maxamcina",
  74011: "Farmoytaw-Maaluu kee Xalay sinnim,kay Inah bagut dubuh gine num kee yoo tittal cab,usuk Waliid Mughiirâ Baxa",
  74012: "Mango Maalu kaah hee aw kaah abe",
  74013: " Lab Xayloy kalluk xayyowtaah,qafaydoodih arac kalluk tamaatey,kay Maalih mangak gexxaamah, kaak baxsime sinni kaah abe",
  74014: "Mano aw qiishataay,Rizqhii kee Xalay fakimih fakka kaakl hee",
  74015: "Tokkeek yol abe Koroosinnalluk,toh inkih kaah ceek wadiril kaah osisuh baa keerah",
  74016: "Caagid usuk moyyal isik akah miicisanna hinna,diggah usuk ni Aayatittey,ni Farmoytal obbimte tet dirabboosak ciné",
  74017: " Digaalak gibday aw gibda digaalay yassikuqqem xiqewaa kaa dirkiseyyo",
  74018: "Ta Korostay amol too Niqmatitte akak hee,Qhur-aan finqisuh kaak iyyaamat yifikkireh,isi Nafsil toh cagguduseh",
  74019: "Abaarimeh,digaalimek mannal cagguduse",
  74020: "Tokkeek Abaarimeh,digaalimek mannal cagguduse",
  74021: "Tokkeek iyyaamat mabla gaciseeh edde yifikkireh",
  74022: "Tokkeek Qhur-aan edde mudam geeweewak,Fooca cibba,ceerissa heeh",
  74023: "Tokkeek Iimaanat darre cabe,Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay Nabi kata yyok kaxxiteh",
  74024: "Taa Mucammad edde yemeetem Yallih Yab hinna,inkinnah usuk Baabay akima rak xaagisa iyye",
  74025: "Tah Yallih Yab hinna,inkinnah usuk Sinam yaaba",
  74026: ",Ta Korosta Girâran kookak rankok teenal teena culuseyyo,is Saqhar diqsittaah tet laqna tmmoosah ",
  74027: "!?Mucammadow-Saqhar akak iyyaanam maca koo tiysixxige",
  74028: ",Kaal temeeteh akkewaytek,tet addal digaalimek tu matayseedeya,kaa macabta tokkeek akah yen innah yaduure,tokkeek kal tamaateh,tannal gexay gaca kaal aabta",
  74029: "Aroobal gibdi cararisiyyaa kee milaagiyyale",
  74030: "Tet amol Taban kee Sagla Malaa-ikaytu tan,oson tet daanisá",
  74031: "Girâ daanah Malaaikak kalih im maabinnino,Sahda cayla keenih mali,taa ken ixxima Yallal Koroosite marah aqakkaaneh abnekkah akim hinna,too iyyeenim iyyoonaay digaala dubleh keenilgactu,woo Yahuuduy Tawraat akah temcew wee kee Nasaaray Injiil akah temcewwe,ken Namma marih Namma Kitoobah addal tanim Qhur-aan nummaasak oobewak asmat geyaanaggida,Kitabakah te ,mcewwemari keenit koobahsimawak,Moominiin Iimaan keenih ossittaggida Yahuuduuy,Nasaaraa kee Moominiin bohoy axcewaytu,Iimaanat tandadabbo  aw diggamaleelaa kee Koros:Yalli taa cakkumuk tan ixximat macafaxe?! iyyaa naggida,taa ixxima yangaddi makiyyaa kee kaa nummaasê Tirtok ceelalloh innah,Yalli faxenumuy isih makam faxe makaah,faxe numuy isih tirra haam faxe tirra haa,ku Rabbih Qande mangak gexxaamah kaay yisriyeksah taaxigem ma  tan,Gira Sahdah kassittoy Yallay yisriyennabna elle yaaxigeenikkah akim hinna",
  74032: "Yallat tasgallok baali isi waday Jahnnamal daanah tanok duudah teetik ken catele,aw keenit akke kal akkele akah yaxxaccenna hinna,Yalli Alsal xiibite",
  74033: "Bari darre cabewak xiibite",
  74034: "Maaci ifawakal xiibite",
  74035: "Diggah Jahannam Gira,kaxxa umaaneenak tiyak teena",
  74036: "Sinaamah meysiisiyyaa kee conxisiyya",
  74037: "Sinaamey-siinik faxenum-Yallal yaaminem kee meqe taamal taamal bisoh  iyyam faxe bisoh iyyay,aw Koroosinnaa keemaqsiyatal idirroowaay ",
  74038: "Ummaanih Nafsi taamak taamitteemil tanxibbixeh,tet taama tet bayisih,baatik tet tiysillimeh tet cati takke",
  74039: "Moominiin akak raqqa intawak,diggah osonuuy isinni Nafsitte isinni taamak yeymeeqeenimil isinni yaysillimen",
  74040: "Oson Qhiyaamah Ayro Jannatitteh addal gacaanaah,baali baali keenik essera",
  74041: "Woo Korosuy isinni Nafsitte Maqsiyatak taamiteemil isih bayisseki ",
  74042: "Keenik:Jahannam maca sin culusse? iyyan",
  74043: "Koros:Addooniyâ manol dirkî Salat aba marak manannino axcuk keenl gacisan",
  74044: "Yalli neh yeceemik Baacoyta askamuk manannino",
  74045: " Baatl maralluk oson meekitinnaan ikke kenluk meekitak nen,makookee maylati maralluk walalak nen",
  74046: "Galtoh Ayro dirabboosak nen ",
  74047: "Rabi nel amma iyyam fan,dirabboosiyyat bisoh inne,neekee mandabbak fanat gace",
  74048: "Qhiyaamah Ayro,Malaa-ikaay,Ambiyaa kee meqe maray,yot caba abah aw makaabanna abah makaabanni keenih xiqam mali,woh akah kinnim yot caba oggolimtuh assentah tanim,yotcaba akah aban numuh oggoltimtam faxximta",
  74049: "!?Ta Yallat tasgallo Qhur-aanat darre cabaanam ken absissem macaay",
  74050: "Kaak aban isinni darre cabiyyaa kee gilitiyyal,Garbô Danoonay gilitiyya gib dah innah gacan  ",
  74051: "Meysih Lubakak kuddeh innale",
  74052: "Inkinnah taYallat tasgalloh yan marak ummaantii,Mucammad Yallak yan Farmo yta kinnim kaah warisa Kitab moyyak garil kaak maacisam faxa,wohuk sabab mascassoosiddagnaa kee alhumittebboola hinna,woh akah abaanam akim  hinnay aaxaguk ciniyyaa kee kaxxamariino",
  74053: "Caagid tonna hinna,inkinnah sabab,diggah oson Akheeraddigaalal mayaaminaa naay,isinni makot bisoh gexen,isinni Koroosinnal elle yeedeyen",
  74054: "oobbooy,diggah ta Qhur-aan kassittoo kee kassiisi",
  74055: "Faxe numuy Qhur-aan kawisaah,kaal kassitto geyam faxe kaa kawsaah,kassitto kaal geya ",
  74056: "Yalli kassitto geyaanam faxeh akkewaytek,kassitto mageyan,kaay yisriyee, kay amritte xakabaanam kee kay waasoosak waaliyaanamal kaak meysitaanam kaah taguudeh aw ahlih akah yan,kaa fan yendebbeenik isi Naqoosah Zambi cabuh ahlih yan",
  75000: "Suuratul Qhiyaama\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nQhiyaamah Ayro Gino ugutmaa kee gaaboosiyyal Yalli le xiqtoh ayballayiyyi elle yan   \n•    Tafsiiri:",
  75001: "Yalli Qhiyaamah Ayrooy,Sinam Baad Rabbih solta Ayrol xiibite",
  75002: "Meqe Nafsiy le num meqe taamat cabe rikee kee,uma taama abeemil kaa darem tal xiibite,ta Namma caagidil akah xiibitem,Sinam cisb kee galtoh uguseleemi ",
  75003: "!?Sahdayti rabek wadiril ugutmah kay Lafoofi askatteweennom yakkale",
  75004: "Yeey,gaaboosiyyallih kay Feeraarih exxaaxi akah ten innah,duddale ginoh gacissa haynam xiqnah",
  75005: "Inkinnah Sahdayti ugutma yangaddeemil,isi umaanek bagul,kaa akak kaltam ane kkah,aw kaa akak xiixiytam anekkah,bisoh elle gexam faxa",
  75006: "Ayxeexiyyah, Qhiyaamagiddaanimik malqo akkele?iyyeh essera",
  75007: "Dirabboosak yenem yablewak,Inti xahangaagittaah, yagihnineh",
  75008: "Alsi Ifi gexeh",
  75009: "Ayro Alsalluk gaaboysimteh",
  75010: "Umeenah yan Sahdayti,woo Ayro:kudma ankeey?! iyya",
  75011: "Woo Ayro kudma matan,umeeni edde kelita edde kelitimeena matan,dacar simeenay edde dacarsima matan",
  75012: "Farmoytaw-too Ayro cisab kee galatoh madaaraay,gaceena ku Rabbi fana",
  75013: "Sahdaytuh woo Ayrot,isi taamak tatrusem keeteetik udurroosem kaah warri simtah",
  75014: "Inkinnah Sahdayti Zambik abeemih kay maasoy kaal sumaaqittawak,isi Nafsil isih sumaaqita ",
  75015: "Diggah usuk umaane abeweemih,isi Nafsik edde giddiya quzritte baahaamah kaah xiqtam mali",
  75016: "Farmoytw-kok yaftuceemik sissaakeh-Qhur-aanal isi Arraaba masgayyin",
  75017: "Diggah kaa ku Aliilit naskatteeh,kay kawsa ku Arraabal nasgirgirem nel tan,",
  75018: "Ni Farmoyti Jibriil kaa kol kawisawak,kay kawsafan kakka haay,ankacissa hay",
  75019: "Tokkeek addaffaknu aw Tafsiir koh abaanam diggah nel tan",
  75020: "Baleey,caagid isin akah texxen innah ugutma akkewaytam hinna,isin qimbok sin ginam xiiqe Rabbi rabteenik wadiril sin mannoosam mayffara,takkay ikkah sin ugutma ddirabboosiyyak sabab,Addooniya manoy gabakkalti sissikih isin liton kacanu",
  75021: "Akheeramanoy Giti akak Taaqak Yalli amriseemil soolaanamaah,caraamittek Yalli waasem cabiyya ",
  75022: "Iimaan leeh,Busuuqah yan marih foocitte,woo Ayro qax meqeeh iftah",
  75023: "wohut salfoysitak aw ruffa axcuk isi Rabbih fan wagitta  ",
  75024: "Koroosinnaa kee kabella qidileelaffoocitte woo Ayro cerle ",
  75025: "Naba digaalaay,dananissa digaala teetil oobelem digga hayta",
  75026: " Caagid Yallat tasgallo moyyal akah miicissannah hinna,toh oson Rabanwak digaalimewaanama,keenik numuk teeni Nafsi aw Rooci Aliilik dagah amooma maadawaka ",
  75027: "Sinaamak baali baalik:uram kee ta sahdaytu iyyi daylisa?!iyye ",
  75028: "Faxenumuy rooci bukkusumiyyat akak yani,Addooniyak Rabah baxsimiyya kinnim ismitta hee",
  75029: "Addooniyah illacaboo kee Akheeraqqimbol,gibdaabinitte gaabowteh",
  75030: "Toh takkewak Raboyti,isi Rabbifan wakkayimah ",
  75031: "Korosti kay Farmoyti baahem manummaasinna,Yallay yisriyeh masalaatinna",
  75032: "Takkay ikkah kay Farmoyti baahem dirabbooseeh, darre edde cabe",
  75033: "Tokkeek ta Korosti kaxxiitik gexxaamah isi gexot kaxxamaritak,isi Buxah mara aw ahli fan gexe",
  75034: "Yalli Korostah kay digaala awla kaak abeeh,kaat xayyoowteemih,uman xagana kaah cule",
  75035: "Tokkeek diggoosiyyah maxcammaafo qagiseh(tokkeek is kaat xayih,kaah awlah tan aw kaah taguudeh)iyye",
  75036: "?Sahdayti Yalli annaak,Diini dirkitte kaal heekkah kaacabelem yakkalee",
  75037: "Ta-Sahdayti ayrok teena Xiixoxxak tan qunxuffeytay,Maganat caxitak manaa",
  75038: "Tokkeek tohuk wadiril,yigribe qabalih exxa yekke,tokkeek Yalli kaa gineh,kay gino massalem abe",
  75039: "!?Kay qaynat Namma qayanat abe,Lab nadoo kee Say nado ",
  75040: "Sahdaytu qunxuffeey,wokkek dalboytak gine Yalli,cisab kee galatoh qusba addah Raboytit mannoosam xiiqé hinna?!yeey diggah usuk xiiqé  ",
  76000: "Suuratul Insaan\nMadiinah imi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \n,Sahdaytu ukummak Gino akak tanikke,akah yandabbuwaakke kassiisaanamaay Yalli isih Loyna akak yekke marah Jannatti addal gulguluh heemi baxxaqsi elle yan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  76001: "Diggah Sahdaytul galab xago kaak edde ane sinni xex liggiditte taturte",
  76002: "Nanu Sahdaytu Labhayti Lee kee Barrâ Leey tengelek ginne,dirkitteetak kaal  hay naamal aqakkaana kaak abnaggida,Diink kaal hayne dirkitteetat soolaggi dah,yaabbiiy yabli kaa abne",
  76003: "Nanu niFarmoytiitih Arraa boobil Tirtoggita kaah baxxaqisneh,tohul makoggiti kaah baxxaqiteh,usuk tohuk wadiril massâ Gital tirra iyyeh,Moomintuuy Naqa suy,Yalla faatita akkiiy,teetik makkimma iyyeh  Korostah yan Naqsuy,Yallih Aayatitte yangadde yakke akki yakke",
  76004: "Yalli tirraye qaynat kee makkoowe qaynatah Namma qaynat baxxaqissaheewak :ken Nammayih galato baxxaqiseeh,iyyeh <br/> Nanu Yallaa kee kay Farmoytal koroosite marah,Katiinay edde ken hirrigsimaa naay,axawittey tet addal edde yamuxxuyeeni,urta Gira gulguluh keenih hayne",
  76005: "Diggah MoominiiniyYalla tateeqe,Qhiyaamah Ayro Gocoy Kobaabiy Kaafuur agleh edde yaniih,suruy meqe yaaquben",
  76006: "Taa Taaqammarah gulguluh gace maqab, aleeliyyi sahli akak yaniih,raciyya mango raceenay kafe sinni,Yallih Naqoosa akak talagge aw akak taaquben,isi nnih faxinnaan ikke tet weeqisaanaah,tetbeyan  ",
  76007: "Tet taaqube Naqoosah weeloolaa,Taaqak isinni yiyxibixeenim diggah oson ki baanah,umaane fixixihiiy,baxacah akak tan Ayrok meysitaanah,woh Qhiyaamah Ayro  ",
  76008: "Isinnih akak lon agxee kee teetih lon fayxih sabbatah kicnoonuh anuk,Maaqo  yas kamen,Baacoytiitiiy,Qayxiixaa kee seewah orbisen marak agxeleela yas kame",
  76009: "Yallih Foocakkalih imih ken askamewaanam isinni Nafsit qellisan,oson galto keenik mafaxan,ken yoskomeenimil fayla mafaxan  ",
  76010: "Gibdaa kee wirggak gexxaamah saami umaytit Foocitte edde certa Ayro,nanu   ni Rabbik meysinnah",
  76011: ",Yalli isi muxxoh too nabah Ayroh umaanek ken dacriseh,keenih massakaxxaay ken Sorkocoxxaylot rufto hayiyyah,qaxmaqaanee kee ken Foocittet Ifu keenih yecee",
  76012: "Taaqal yisbireeniih,Yallih meklaalil yisbireeniih,maqsiyatittek yaadiyeenimil yisbireenimih sabba tah-addal Niqmat akak geyan Jannat kee sartan Cariirih Yalli ken galate ",
  76013: "Tet addal bilqimte Kaqaadiidil qikitan,ta Jannatih addal cuumi aza keenih akak yakke Ayro mayablan,gibdi xamca mayablan,inkinnah oson inki tan Iraawoy  laqna lih ane sinniih,kaxxa xamca lih ane sinnih addal yanin",
  76014: "Tet Silolwa aw Iroowa keenit xayih,qaxah yanooy,daffeyeeysoolé tet xagata  wak,aw aleltawak faxe numuy tet aleelah,tet Caxammiri qanniimeh,xamcinuk sahlil tet aleelita",
  76015: "Taama abeenit qado Lakqoh misgilwa aw Afeenan keenit meekissa,maqab faxan wak migit tan bisi akak safale Kobaabi keenit meekisan",
  76016: "Isqado Lakqok tanimmay bisi safak gexxaamah,Garaarat inna le,is elle faxaanah gidel caggusumte,akak mossitta matankusa",
  76017: "Ta konnabna leela,Zanjabiil agleh edde yan Gocoyuk kibuk tan Kobaabit yaaquben",
  76018: "Jannatti addal Salsabiilil muggaqsimta Raceenak yaaquben",
  76019: "Jannatti addal Furrayniinol aw qunxa mariinol elle yaadiye Qunxaaneyti keenit meekita,ken tablewak ken Foocitteh qaxmaqaaneey,ken bisi maqaaneey,kenman gaa kee ken baxaciyyak gexxaamah,fixixih yan Luul ken takkale",
  76020: "Wokkel Jannatal tanim tublek welloysimam bice sinni Niqmat tuble,naba Abbootanay kay bisle Abbootan akak ane sinni tuble",
  76021: "Diggah warrayle anxaxin Sari ken Dagarak amol gaca,is xamcin Carir kee gib da Cariiri,tet addal qado Lakqoh balaayiina saritan,Yalli faxe darraqoysiyyak aw quntil xiisiyyak foyyah yan maqab ken yafqe",
  76022: "Konnabnah keenik:diggah taa siinih yemcewwe Niqmat sin meqe taamal siinih galato,sin taama Yallih garil oggol lem tekke",
  76023: "Farmoytaw-nanu Qhur-aan baxaabaxsah kol oobissem nee,inki adda kol moobi sinnino",
  76024: "Yalli isi garil madqaamal aw Diinil madaqaamal isbir,Zambeyni Zambik elle seecaamal kaa maateeqin,Korosti koroosinnak fanah akak seecaamal kaa maa teeqin",
  76025: "Ayrok qimbol maaci Salat kee,illacabol Zuhrii kee Qasri Salaatal ku Rabbi cus ",
  76026: "BartîNamma Salaatal:Maghrib Salat kee Qishâ Slaatal kaa cus,ken Nammayih lakal Bartissalat kaal ab",
  76027: ",Diggah ta-Yallat tasgallo Addooniyammano kicnoonuuh,teetil baakeeraanah Qhiyaamah Ayro darreh isinnik caban,gibdaabinittee aqakkaaneenak teetit tanii mik gexxaamah,is qilsa Ayro",
  76028: "Nanu ken ginneh,Maasoy kee Elmooma aw Karimaay,wohuk kalah tanim cayla keenik bahsiisiyyal ken Gino cayla bahsisne,ken bayisnaah,ken bisle marat ken korisnamk,ken bayisak neneeh ken korisak nen ",
  76029: "Diggah ta Suurat kassittooy kassiisi,faxe numuy kay Rabbih kacanu fan kaa maa disa Gita yaxxeebexem faxe,tet yaxxeebexeh,maqnah yaaxxaabaxay",
  76030: "Woh Yalli siinik faxeh akkewaytek,Yallih kacanufan Gita taxxeebexeenim   mafaxxan,caagid inkih kaafanah raaqa,diggah Yalli isi Naqoosah tummiqit yaa xagi,isi ginooy,isi caggudusiyyal aw meklal,isi Diinil Naggaara",
  76031: "Isi Naqoosak isih faxemara isi Racmattat culusa,Iimaan kee meqe taama keenit koobaahisa,Koroosinnaa kee maqsiyatal isinni Nafsitte yuzlume marah Akhee ral biyakta digaala gulguluh hee,woh Giraddigaala",
  77000: "Suuratul Mursalaat\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nQhiyaamah Ayro dirabbooseenitih,Wayli diqsitta Girah uman xagani elle yan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  77001: "Yalli Faras Calacalih innah titta kataya Caacaytal xiibite",
  77002: "Silisiyya gibda Caacaytal xiibite",
  77003: "Rob fixixisa Caacaytal xiibite",
  77004: "Cakkii kee Baatil fan baxissaamal obta Malaa-ikal xiibite",
  77005: "Wacyil obta Malaa-ikal xiibite",
  77006: "Yallak Sinaamaffan quzri taysaalluuy aw quzri tacu,Yallih digaalak Sinaamah meysissoh Wacyil obta",
  77007: "Diggah ugutmaay,cisab kee galtok akah xaggansimteenim akkelem raq mali",
  77008: "Cutuukaa, Ifi teetik duukumeeh,Diifi teetik gexeh",
  77009: "Qaran Malaa-ika kaak obtu bakaqeh",
  77010: "Qalelwa le aroocak bukkusumteh,Buuri tikkatam fan bokokteh",
  77011: "Farmoytit waadoysime udduurut kobximteh",
  77012: "Naba Ayroy isi Ummatittel sumaaqittu udurrotte",
  77013: "Naqoosaffanih baxsih Ayro,Cakkili kee Batileynakaay,Busuq saami umaytuk baxxaqitel",
  77014: "!?Farmoytaw-baxsi Ayro-maca kinnim maca koo tiysixxige",
  77015: "Woo Ayro dirabbooseenitiy,Farmoytit Yallih garik bahtem dirabbossah tan  baatiiy,digaalaa kee baxaysow ",
  77016: "!?Dumih UmmatitteYallal koroositteeh,isi Farmoytit dirabbosse mabaysinninoo",
  77017: "Tokkeek wadirsi marak dirabbooseenit ken kataasenno,ken akah bayisnennah ken bayisenno",
  77018: "Too Ummatitteh baytih innah,Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay Mucammad edde yemeetem dirabbooseenit,umeenit bayisenno",
  77019: "Yalli umeenitih cule xagana dirabbooseenitih,woo Ayro tan baatiy,digaalaa   kee baxaysow",
  77020: "Sinaamey-bura le Leey,dagok sin magininninoo-woh qunxuffeytaay",
  77021: "Too boolale Lee,daccarsime aracal hayneeh,toh Barrâ Magana",
  77022: "Yimixxige uddur fana,toh soolimiini udduru",
  77023: "Yooboke alqi weelooy,yakkeh gideey,kay bisuuy wohuk kalah tanim caggu dusneh,tohul inkih nanu niqmat aw meqe xiqeeniti ",
  77024: "Too Ayro Yallih xiqto dirabbooseenitih tan baatiiy,digaalaa kee baxaysow",
  77025: "Baaxo Sinam inkih tabbixem maabinnino",
  77026: ",Keenik manol tanim guubuh amol teetik gacaanaah,tet xisaanamal ken dudda keenik raboytit tet addat yabkuneenimil ken dudda ",
  77027: "Tet addal yingirgie Qaleela hayne,ligtok tet tabbixe,fayyata,Sinaamey-salfale Lee sin nefqe,toh Giné sin ugutma yaffari hinna",
  77028: "Too-Ayro Yalli keenil hee Niqmat dirabbooseenitih,tan baatiiy,digaala kee baxaysow",
  77029: "Ken Farmoytit edde temeetem dirabbooseenitik:dirabbooseenitow-digaalak dirabboosak teneenimihfan gexa-keenik yaxcen",
  77030: "Sidooca exxa baxsime,Giraqqeerih Silal fan gexa",
  77031: "Salal xamca mali,Girah uraa kee tet laqna,sin fan guftaamak mahoora",
  77032: "Diggah Gira Xinkilliq gasiyta,ummaanih xinkilliqti nabnah Kalqat gide yakke",
  77033: "Is gasiyta Xinkilliq,ditii kee nabnah,dat Gaalay bisi walqinaanah fan qegtah innah gacta",
  77034: "Too Ayro Yallih digaala dirabbooseenitih tan baatiiy,digaalaa kee baxaysow",
  77035: "Tah tu edde yaabewaan Ayro",
  77036: "Kaa fanah quzri haysitoonuh,isinni koroosinnaa kee umaanek abeenimih,isinni Rabbil quzru haysitaanamih idni keenih mayamcawwa",
  77037: "Taa Ayroh Xaagu dirabbooseenitih woo Ayro tan baatiiy digaalaa kee baxaysow",
  77038: "Tah Ginô fan baxisiyyi Ayro,sin kee tookome Ummatitte inki Booxal gaabosneh",
  77039: ",Yallih digaalak edde cattimtoona ceetaalay edde ceetalsimtaana teelleenik ceeyal yol abita",
  77040: "Too Ayro dirabbooseenitih tan baatiiy,digaalaa kee baxaysow",
  77041: "Diggah kay amri xakabaanama kee kaywaasok waaliyaanamal Yallak meysita mari,farggale Jannatti Cooxih Iraawooy,salfaleeh,gexxa raceenaanih Leel yanin ",
  77042: "Caxammiruk yakmeenim faxxahaanamih addal yanin",
  77043: "Addooniyal taamitak sugten meqe taamoomih sabbatah,meqeemik ukuma,meqe maqabay xiyu sinnih uquba keenik yaxcen",
  77044: "Nanu taa sin akah galatne galatoh bisle galatoh isinni taama taymaaqo galatnah",
  77045: "Yallak meysita marah Yalli gulguluh heem dirabbooseenitih tan baatiy,digaa  laa kee baxaysow",
  77046: "Dirabbooseenitik:Addooniyal dagoo uddur manossalfoofit xoqoysima,diggah isin Yallal korositaanam kee kay Farmoytit dirabbosseenimil umeenit kinniton yaxcen",
  77047: ",Too Ayro galtoh Ayro,galtoh Ayro isinni galto dirabboosa mara tan baatiiy digaalaa kee baxaysow",
  77048: "Ta dirabbooseenitik:Yallahn issilliya tenxeccimek,kaah mayassilliyan",
  77049: "Too Ayro tadirabbooseenitiy,Yallih gariik Farmoytit edde temeetem dirabboosah tan baatiiy,digaalaa kee baxaysow",
  77050: " Ta Qhur-aanay ken Rabbik oobbiimel aamineweenik,kaak kalah mayaabal  !?aamine lon",
  78000: "Suuratu Annaba-a  \nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nRabeenik wadiril gusiyyi xiqtoh mascassoosii kee illacabok meysiisaanamih baxxaqsi elle yan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  78001: "Taa Yallat tasgallo,Yallii,Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaltanay isi Farmoyta ken !?fan ruubek swadiril, tittak essertam macaay    ",
  78002: "Baali-baalik keenik naba Xaagu essera,usuk ta Qhur-aanay ken Farmoytal obbiimeeh,ugutmâ Xaagu addat tabbixe",
  78003: "Baab kinnik,aw Qadar kinnik,aw Kalluwalle kinnik,aw dumî marak gabbaaqan hayyeyyoona kinnik,tah kaa elle welloosaanamal titta akak ween Qhur-aana",
  78004: ",Caagid oson akah yexxeecen inna hinna,ta Qhur-aan dirabbooseenitih yan mari isinni dirabboosiyyih illacaboh umaane aaxigelon",
  78005: "Tokkeek woh keenih diggoowele ",
  78006: "Baaxo xinkiyimteeh,tet amol guubuh gacoonah bicalem aw temqem maabi ?!nnino",
  78007: "Ligtok tet horta Qalelwa,Kadeh aracat amol teetik hayne",
  78008: "Sinaamey-qaynootah sin ginneeh:siinik Labim kee Sayim abne ",
  78009: "Sin Xin taffoofeeniggidah nibaadek,aw angagoyyak  girqu siinih abne",
  78010: "Woo Sartanay isinni Qawrat edde tastureenih innah,Bar isi Ditet sin tastureemi siinih abne",
  78011: "Loqooy taamaa kee Rizqhi goranih Booxa abne",
  78012: "Siinik amol Malcina Qaranway,xisne akak maqar leeh,abto akak naggaarinnale xisne",
  78013: "Ayro Ifoytay uriyyaa kee ifiyyi akak gibda abne",
  78014: "Rob raduh uddur akak yekke Qamburrek,cayxi mango Lee oobisne",
  78015: "Amboqqaynootaay,taabukeemih qaynoota edde nayyaaqu",
  78016: "Bustaanway tet Cooxih Luud tittat abe culmah mangak gexxaamah,tittat makam maakimte edde nayyaaqe",
  78017: "Yalli ta-Niqmatittey kayxiqtol tascasset yabba iyyewak,ugut maa kee Qhiyaa  maggalab xago kataase,wohakah kinnim ta-Niqmatitte ginam xiiqé raboytit ugut :maa kee cisab keenik abam xiiqé kinniih,iyyeh <br/> Diggah Ginoffanih baxsih Ayro xaggansimeeh waadoysime udduruy,makkiime sinni yekke",
  78018: "Malaa-ikayti Fooximat Nammayhaytôfooxo fooxisuwaa Ayro,Sinaamey-butta buttah amatetton",
  78019: "Qaranwa fakkimteeh fakut Afoofah innah fakut tan aroocaa kee baqaq lem tekke",
  78020: "Fikiikih gexa Buuril korrateh Bakar bakar inna tikkatam fan,Qalelwa gexxam tekke",
  78021: "Diggah Jahannam dacayrih taniih,xagurtam tekke",
  78022: "Zulmeynitih gaceenay fanah akak yaduureeni",
  78023: "Tet addal udduraay, Liggidittey illacabo sinni yaadiyen",
  78024: "Saqiir diqsitta Girah laqna keenik xammacoosa,xamcin silaytu tet addal matam moosan,tet addal edde salfoysitan maqaba matammoosan",
  78025: "Gibda laqna le Lee kee Girammarak gexa Malac kee qabalak sarrihim tammoosan ",
  78026: "Koroosinnaa kee makok,amol akak yeneenimit koobahsimta galato",
  78027: "Diggah oson Addooniyal Akheeral Yalli cisab keenik abaamak meysitak mana ,nnon,woh akah kinnim ugutmal mayaaminan,ugutmak meysitaanam akkinnay Yallal aamanuk yeneeniih,meqem taamitak yenen ",
  78028: "Ni Farmoytal obbimte ni Aayatitte dirabboosiyyah dirabboosen",
  78029: "Ken taamak ummaanim massat nibbixeeh lowneh,is ken taamah Kitoobah addal tunkuttubeh tan",
  78030: "Umeenitow-taa waarta digaala tammoosa,sin digaalal digaalaksah siinih osnam mannu",
  78031: "Kay amritte xakabaana kee kay waasok waaliyaanamal,diggah isinni Rabbik meysita mari,tatur aracay faxaanam elle geyaana loonuuh,woh Jannata ",
  78032: "Bustaanwaay,Qinabwa lon",
  78033: "Kuquuna leelay Karma akak massowta lon",
  78034: "Gocoy Kobaabiy kibuk tani lon",
  78035: "Jannatti addal Baatil Yab mayaabban,dirab elle mayaabban,baali baali madirabboosa",
  78036: "Tohum inkih,Yalli keenih yece maqaanee kee acway kaak taniy duddale",
  78037: "Qaranwaay Baaxô Rabbiiy,ken Nammayih fanal taniimih Rabbi,Addooniyaa kee Akheerah fidin racmattali, Baaxol aw Qaranwal ennatam inkih,idni keenih yeceeh akkewaytek,kaa esseraanam makobran",
  78038: " Jibriil kee Malaa-ika rortah gaccateh soltuwayta Ayro,fidin racmattali yotcaba abuh idni akah yeeceeh akkewaytek,inkitti yotcabah mayaaban,inkittoysiyyi qan garah innah tan meqem iyyeh akkewaytek",
  78039: "Too siinih welloysimtem,is akkelem raq akak sinni Ayro,faxenumuy tet addat ,Yallih digaalak yasillimem faxee, meqe taamoomiy kayRabbit kaa taykeecenel tohuh fan Gita yaxxeebexay",
  78040: ",Sinaamey-xayuk yakkuwaa aw tamaatuwayta digaalak nanu sin takkaawisneh num isi taamak Addooniyal tatrusem yabluwaa Ayro,Korosti digaalak yasilli mem loowitak:Qhiyaamah Ayro Saqak Buuri tik tanxaccimewak:yokkale Saqi nnah Buuri akkinniyo iyya",
  79000: "Suuratu-Annaaziqaati \nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nYallaa kee Akhaarah Ayroh kassiisi\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  79001: "Yalli Koros Roocitte gibduk caylat hirigta Malaa-ikal xiibite",
  79002: "Moominiin Roocitte sahlil,xamcal siibta Malaa-ikal xiibite",
  79003: "Yalli amril Qaraanaak Baaxofan giirissa Malaa-ika xiibite",
  79004: "Yallih amri abiyyal isik baalik taakume Malaa-ikal xiibite",
  79005: "Naqoosattaamal awlisimte Malaa-ikah innah tan,kay meklak usuk ken edde amrisem tagdube Malaa-ikal xiibite,Yalli tohul inkih akah xiibitem,cisab kee galtoh ken uguseleemi",
  79006: "Qimboffooximal Baaxo tangayyu wayta Ayro",
  79007: "Ta fooxo Nammayhaytô fooxo katayta",
  79008: "Koros kee Taaqak yewqe marih Sorkocoxxaylo,woo Ayro meysittah",
  79009: "Tet Intiital qunxiinâ raat yambulluye ",
  79010: "Rabnek wadiril manoffan aduurennoo?!axcuk yenen",
  79011: "!?Tembexe Lafoofuy foyyak tani tikkaneh wohuk wadiril aduurenno",
  79012: "Nuduurek toh baxaysi madaara akkele,tetli baxaysitenumu",
  79013: "Ugutmah caagid xamcinih,is fooxol awlaytiinoh yan Malaa-ikaytuk inki xongo loksah akiimih faxxam mali",
  79014: "Toowak Raboytiitih tet Bagih addat yeneenik wadiril,inkih mannooweenih  yaniiniih,Baaxok bagul gacan ",
  79015: "Farmoytaw-Muusa isi Rabbii kee isi Naqboyti Firqawnalluk,geysimeemih !?Xaagi kol yemeete",
  79016: "Tuwâ Daqaaray saytunnoowel,kay Rabbi kaah seecewak",
  79017: "Kaak iyyeemit:Farqawna fan gex,diggah usuk Zulmii kee kaxxamariinot dikkak tatureh kaak iyye",
  79018: "Kaak:Firqawnaw-koroosinnaa kee maqsiyatak maay saytunnoowetto?inxec",
  79019: "Ku Rabbiy koo gineeh,koo dacrisek meysittuh kaafan koo ascassuwaa,usuk kic ?naamal taamitteh,usuk niqbaamak waaliytuh ",
  79020: "Nagayna kaal tanay Muusa naba astay,usuk isi Rabbik yan Farmoyta kinnim tascasse uybulluyya kaa hee,is Gabaa kee Caxxa",
  79021: " Firqawni ta asta dirabboosaanamaksah kaak geytimtem mali,nagayna kaal  tanay Muusa edde kaa amrisem yiqsiyeh ",
  79022: " Yalla yaqsimyem kee sadaanamat nagay angiicilluk,tokkeek nagayna kaal tanay Muusa baaheemit darre cabe",
  79023: "Isi maraa kee kaa katayeenit Muusak yayseemih gabbatuh gaabooseeh,axcuk :kaayeh  ",
  79024: "Anu sin Rabbiy ummaanimik daga raaqa,yook sarrihim Taaqa siinil mali",
  79025: "Yalli kaa yibbixeeh,Addooniyal Badat yamunxuqeemil kaa digaale,Akheeral gibdah lafittata digaala kaa culusiyyal kaa digaale",
  79026: "Diggah Addooniyaa kee Akheeral Firqawna elle digaalleemil,faxe numuy Yallak meysitah kassitto tan,kassittootat usuk xoqoysima ",
  79027: "Ugutma dirabbooseenitow-taasin geysiisaanamYallal gibdah lafittannaa,hinna !?mmayQaraanay xise geysiisaanama",
  79028: "Amottabu aw am,daga le katul fayyol fayya teetik hee,massalem tet abe,tet   adda bakaq mali,fellaq mali,qaybi mali ",
  79029: "Tet Ayro cultawak tet Bar dite abe,tawqewak tet Ifu ifah yaybulluye",
  79030: "Baaxo Qaran ginek wadiril fidissa hee,tet tuxxiqitte tet addal hee",
  79031: "Teetik gexxa Raceenaanih tet Lee yeyyeeqe,tet addal taabukeemik Saqi yaloo lem aw teetil taqqatam taloolem yuysubuke",
  79032: "Qalelwa Baaxoh amol tingirgireemi tet abe",
  79033: "Sinaamey-toh inkih sin kee sin Saqah tuxxiiqi,tah inkih Giné sin Gino qusba addah gacisam mayaffara",
  79034: "Nammay haytô fooxoy ummaanim isi haggat buulta temeetewaka,toowak Qhiyaama solteh",
  79035: " Ayroy tamaate,Sahdayti Khayri takku,umaane takku tatrussa heem edde kassita  ",
  79036: "Jahannam bahsimtah aw tameetimeh,tet yablih Intih tambulluye",
  79037: "Faxe numuy makot dikkak taturee",
  79038: "Addooniyammanoy gaba kalta Akheerammanoy raqtal muxxusee",
  79039: "diggah Guubuy edde qikita aw fanah akak yaduure Gira",
  79040: " 40-41Faxe numuy,isi Rabbih foocal soolaamak meysitah tu gactek,Yalli cara mmooseemil isi nabsiyya katayaamak isi Nafsi yibbixee,diggah Jannataa,is Guubuy edde qikita ",
  79041: " 40-41Faxe numuy,isi Rabbih foocal soolaamak meysitah tu gactek,Yalli cara mmooseemil isi nabsiyya katayaamak isi Nafsi yibbixee,diggah Jannataa,is Guubuy edde qikita ",
  79042: "Farmoytaw-ta dirabbooseenit:Saaqat aw Qhiyaama malqo akkele?iyyeenih koo essera",
  79043: "Keenih edde yabtuh ixxiga teetik mantu,woh ku caagid hinna,ku caagidih tu gactek teetih gulguluh gacaanama",
  79044: "Saaqat ixxiga aw Qhiyaamah ixxiga dubuh ku Rabbit taadiye",
  79045: "Koh tu gactek atu Saaqatak meysité meysiise kinnito,woh akah kinnim ku meysissot usuk xoqoysimtam ",
  79046: "Saaqat mablah yabloonawaan Ayro,isinni Addooniyah manol inki Ayroh Carra aw Saakuksah sugeenim maloonuh innah gacan",
  80000: "Suuratu Qabasa \nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nKorosuy isinni Rabbik Gaddiddowte,ugutmâ mascassoosih kassiisiyyi elle yan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  80001: "Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay Yallih Farmoyti Fooca ceerissa heeh,darre cabe",
  80002: "Qabdallaah Maktuum Inak Baxi ascossi goranah kaal yemeeteemih taagah,Inti malikyen,Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaaltanay Farmoyti Yallat tasgallok kaxxa marat ken Tirtoh qaagoh agxitawak yemeete",
  80003: "!?Farmoytaw-ta Inti mali isi Zambik saytunnoowam keeh-maca koo taysixxige",
  80004: "!?Aw kassittootak kok yaabbeemit kassiteh,teetit xoqoysimam takkeh   ",
  80005: " Atu bahteemil yaamineemik Maalak isi garil leemil,isi Nafsih gaddidoowe numuh tu gactekii ",
  80006: "Atu kaal xayyowtaah,kaafan tafkuneh tan",
  80007: "?Yallafan andabbiyyal isi Zambik saytunnoowe week,koo maca tabeebexe",
  80008: "Kkhayri gorrisak gexak kol yemeete numuh tu gactekii",
  80009: "Usuk isi Rabbik meysitaah ",
  80010: "Atu kaak kalah tan,Yallat tasgallok kaxxamarat agxitta",
  80011: "Caagid tomma hinna,is teetih tu gactek faxe numuy kassitah kassittoo kee kassiisi",
  80012: "Faxenumuy Yalla kasam faxe kaa kasah,ta Qhur-aanih addal taniimil kassitto geyah ",
  80013: "Ta Qhur-aan Malaa-ikaggaril konnabnale Kitoobah addal yan",
  80014: "Fayyateh fayyole aracal tan,saytunnowteeh,wasak tet maxaga,najaasa tet maxagta",
  80015: "Is Malaa-ikak Farmoytit Gabat tan",
  80016: "Isinni Rabbih garil massakaxxa leelá,Khayrii kee Taaqa mangó ",
  80017: "!Korostah yan Sehdayti abaarimtem kaak,maxxo Yallal koroosinna gibdaah",
  80018: "!?Baaxol kaxxamariteh,kaal koroosituh,Yalli macak kaa gineeh",
  80019: "Dagoo Leek kaa gine,kay Gino rankook rankok wadiril cagguduseh",
  80020: "Ta Rankookak wadiril,kay Inah baguk mawqa kaah xammacooseh",
  80021: "Tokkeek manol kaah cagguduse Karma gaba kaltawak,kaa rabisah,ugutam fan edde yaadiye maysaguq kaah abe",
  80022: "Tokkeek faxwak cisab kee galatoh kaa uguseh",
  80023: ",Caagid ta Korosti kay Rabbi Cakkik kaal lem yeceem akah yakkalenna hinna dirkittek aw Faraa-idhik Yalli dirki kaal abem maabinna",
  80024: "Yallal koroosite Sahdayti,mannal geytimteeh ?!yakme Maaqo fan wagitay ",
  80025: "Rakiibo aw asli akak caylaluk,manguk Qaraanak ooba Roobuk tan",
  80026: "Tokkeek Baaxo fellaqissa haynaah,taabukeemil fellaqtah aw qanxixxah",
  80027: " Sirrayaay,Qelbooy ken Nammayak kalah tan Ambo tet addal nuysubuke",
  80028: "Tet addal Qinab kee ken Saqah Qayso takkeggidah wiin Anxeyxa naysubuke",
  80029: "Tet addal Zeytuun kee Nakli nuysubuke",
  80030: "Tet addal Bustaanittey Coox mango nuysubuke",
  80031: "Tet addal Caxammiru addal nuysubuke,sin Saqi yaloolem tet addal nuysubuke",
  80032: "Sin tuxxiqiiy,sin Saqih tuxxiqi",
  80033: "Naba xongoloy aw deeroy Aytiita waysissa tamaatewak,is Nammay haytô  fooxo  ",
  80034: "Num isi toobokoytak kuda Ayro",
  80035: "Isi Inaa kee Abbak kuda",
  80036: "Isi Qasaalaa kee isi Xaylok kuda",
  80037: "Woo Ayro gibadaabinittê gibdak gexxaamah,keenik ummaanih tii,gersittuk kaa agxissam le",
  80038: "Busuuqâ Foocitte woo Ayro iftah",
  80039: "Yalli isi Racmattak gulguluh teetih heemil tasuuleeh,ruffata aw tafriceh ",
  80040: "Woo Ayro kabellâ qidi leela aw Saami umoytit Foocittel Buuri gaca",
  80041: "Dite tet buulta",
  80042: "Toomaray,too gurral welloowe Koroosinnaa kee umaaneh fan gaaboosen",
  81000: "Suuratu-Attakwiir\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nUgutmah uddur Ginoggexsit aba amqittiliyyal,Nafsitte kassiisiyyal Qgur-aan le dudda taybulle \n•    Tafsiiri:",
  81001: "Ayro takkeh gideek gaaboysimteh,Ifi teetik gexewak",
  81002: "Cutuuka raddeeh,Diifi teetik duukumewak ",
  81003: "Qalelwa isi aroocak tengeyyewak ",
  81004: "Idqa Gaalay,le mari teetil tittat elle qalala,oson tet cabiyyal aylahimtewak",
  81005: "Dubaali Sahdallih inki Booxal gaaboysintewak",
  81006: "Baditte Gira tikkatam fan ursuntewak",
  81007: "Nafsitte tet bisleelat xibbansimtewak,umeeni umeenat xibbaanimaah,Yallak meysité,Yallak meysitet xibbaanimewak",
  81008: " Coorit taniih Tumbukkune Awká,Yalli tet esserewak",
  81009: "!?Koo qidé,koo akah qidem ma umaaneey",
  81010: "Ummaanih tii isi taamah Kitooba kawisaggidah,Naqoosâtaamah Kitooba fixix simtewak",
  81011: "Qaran Reytak Arab elle bukkusumannal,bukkusumewak",
  81012: "Gira ursumtewak",
  81013: "Yallak meysita marah Jannat xayyoysimtewak",
  81014: "Toh takkewak,ummaan Nafsi taamak too Ayroh tatrusettem taaxigeh",
  81015: "Yalli Barat tawqeemik afal qellitta cutuukal xiibite",
  81016: "Isi aroocat gexeenitiy,Maaci yawqewak,wayxexey isi Qari cultah innah qellitta",
  81017: "Barak qimbo tamaatewak kee darre cabawak illacabol xiibite",
  81018: "Kay ifi yawqewak maacal xiibita",
  81019: "Diggah Yallih Slat kee nagayna kaal tanay Mucammadal obbiime Qhur-aan  Yallih Yaabay,amaanale Malaa-ikayti kaa gufuse,nagayna kaal tanay usuk Jibriiliiy,kaal Yalli kaa Yeemeneh ",
  81020: "Caylali,Qarshi Rabbiy yisriyeggaril naba caddole",
  81021: "Qaran mari kaa yateeqeh,Wacyik gufusaamal yemeemenimeh",
  81022: "Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay Mucammaday,siinik baxsime weey,kay Qaqhliiy,kay amaanaa kee numma akak taaxigeenii, hoomatah akah texxeccen innah cabuli hinna",
  81023: "Diggah Sin wadayti,Jibriil elle ginniime miicul baxxaqale Qaran katul kaa yubleh ",
  81024: "Sin wadayti siinil Cillaale liy,siinih fan gufusam edde ammirsimem,sin gufusaa mak cillalloowa hinna,Ginnileela akah beytannah,Qasbi aw galto mabeya",
  81025: "Ta Qhur-aan Sheetanay Yallih Racmattak xiixiyimeh Yab hinna",
  81026: "Ta alhumittek wadiril,usuk Yallak tanim kinnim tangaddoonah,gexxaanam anni !?Gititteey",
  81027: "Qhur-aan Ginnii kee Sahdah kassittoo kassiisikkalih im hinna",
  81028: "Siinik faxe numuy Cakki Gital massoowam faxehi ",
  81029: ",Yalli Woh faxeh akkewaytek massa mafaxxan,teetik kalah tanim mafaxxan ummaanih Ginoh Rabbi",
  82000: "Suuratul Infitaar \nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nSahdaytu duquurumiyyaa kee Qhiyaamah Ayroh habbeelaamak takkaawisiyyi elle yan \n•    Tafsiiri:",
  82001: "Malaa-ika kaak obtaggidah Qaran qanxixewawak",
  82002: "Cutuka fixixak luuqtewak",
  82003: "Badwak baali baalil fakkiimeh tengelewak ",
  82004: "Maysaguqwak,Raboytitik tet addat tanim uguttuh tet Buuri korriimewak ",
  82005: "Toowak,ummaan Nafsi taamak tatrussem kee teetik udurrussem taaxigeh",
  82006: "Isi Rabbil koroosite Sahdaytow,tanay koo iyyeeh,isi muxxoh digaalat kot !?asissikeweewak,ku Rabbih amri saddam koo absissem macaay",
  82007: "Woo usuk anewayak tenek wadiril koo geysise,maasoy massa akak leeh,titta akak qeedaltam koo abe ",
  82008: " Isih Faxe qaynatih miicuy edde koo ginam faxat koo gine,Danan weelooy,Da maqtaay,Kutaa kee wohuk kalah taniimih weelot koo gineweewak diggah Niq mat kol hee ",
  82009: "Duquurumeenitow-caagid sin moyyat akah wellossen inna hinna-inkinnah isin galtoh Ayro dirabbossaanaah,akah mataamittan",
  82010: "Diggah sin amol Malaa-ikay sin taama dacrissa tan",
  82011: "Yallih garil massakaxxaleela,kutbe abaay sin taama yaktubeenih",
  82012: "Taamak isin abtaanam yaaxigeeniih,yaktubeenih",
  82013: "Diggah Khayrii kee Taaqa abiyya mangó,Qhiyaamah Ayro inki yan Niqmatih addat yanin",
  82014: "Diggah umaane leela,keenil urta Girah addat yanin",
  82015: "Galtoh Ayro tet culaanaah,tet laqnat ceyitan",
  82016: "Inkinnah teetik qellita hinnon,oson inki tet addal waaraanah ",
  82017: "!?Farmoytaw-galatoh Ayro maca kinnim-maca koo tiysixxige",
  82018: "!?Tokkeek galtoh Ayro maca koo tiysixxige",
  82019: "Tii tiyah tuxiqam xiiqewaa Ayro,woo Ayro ummaan caagid dubuh Yalli le,isih faxem aba,kaaksah inkitti lem mali",
  83000: "Suuratul Mutaffifiin \nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nQhiyaamah Ayrok dirabbooseenit Zulmeynit takkaawisaanaah,Moominiin elle aydukumusiyyi elle yan \n•    Tafsiiri:",
  83001: "Taynukusó le baatiiy,ken baxaysow",
  83002: "Woomarii,oson isinnik kalah yan marak kiil abbasitanwak,isinni Cakki nakusii maleh duddal kibbisiitan ",
  83003: "Sinaamah yikiileenik,aw miizaanal keenih heenik,kiil kee miizaan yaynukusee nih,toh Yallih Salat kee nagaynakaal tanay,Nabi guuroh kenfan gexewak Madii nah marih gurrak ten",
  83004: "Too maray assacokkale umaane aw munkar aba,diggah oson Yallafan ugute !?loonum mayasmitaanaa",
  83005: "Aqakkaanee kee haggoogik tet addat tanik gexxaamah naba Ayro, cisab kee galatoh ugutelon  ",
  83006: "Sinam cisaabah inkih tan Ginô Rabbil soltuwayta Ayro",
  83007: "Caagid rabak wadiril ugutma anewaytam,sin moyyah addal akah miicissen inna hinna,diggah Koros kee Munaafiqhiinik umaaneleelâ Kitab guba raqta Baaxoh addal baxaysi addat yan",
  83008: "!?Farmoytaw-Sijjiin maca kinnim-maca koo tiysixxige",
  83009: "Giggah ken Kitab yunkuttubeh makata,kaat mossitta matankusa",
  83010: "Woo Ayro dirabbooseenit le baatii kee baxaysow",
  83011: "Woo marii,galtoh Ayroy Yalli Addooniyal aben ken taamal,isi Naqoosa elle galata dirabboosaanah",
  83012: "Too Ayro,ummaan Yallih waadok taturey Zambi mangoh yani tekkeh akkeway tek,dirabbossam matan",
  83013: "Ni Farmoytal obbimte,ni Aayatitte kaal kawsimatawak:is dumih Ummatitteh gabbaqtitte,Yallih garik tanim hinna iyye",
  83014: "Caagid ta dirabbooseenit isinni moyyal akah miicisen inna hinna,inkinnah maqsiyatak taamitak sugeenim,ken Qaqhlittel muxxutteeh,tet alifteh,isinni Sorkoco xxaylot Cakki maballinnon",
  83015: " Nummaak oson Qhiyaamah Ayro isinni Rabbih mablak hoorimeeniti ",
  83016: "Tokkeek diggah oson Gira culeenitiiy tet laqna tammoosaanah",
  83017: ",Tokkeek Qhiyaamah Ayro assacokkah keenik:taa edde garayten digaalaa Addooniyal sin Farmoyti siinih warisawak,dirabboosak teneenimi  ",
  83018: "Caagid cisab anewaah,galato anewaytam isinni moyyah addal isin elle miici ssen inna hinna,Taaqa lemarih Kitab daga raaqa aw Qiliyyiin diqsita aracal yan",
  83019: "!?Farmoytaw-Qilliyyuun-maca koo tiysixxige",
  83020: "Diggah ken Kitab yunkuttubeeh,makata,edde mossimtaay,akak matankusa",
  83021: "Ta Kitaabal Malaa-ikak  ummaan Qaraanal xayyooweenit tamaate",
  83022: "Diggah Taaqak tassamaggo,Qhiyaamah Ayro inki yan Niqmatih addala yanin",
  83023: "Bilqimte Gaqaadiidik amol isinni Rabbih fan wagtan,ken Nafsittet meqem akah gactannah abba, ruffa haytaamah fan wagtan",
  83024: "Ken tublek,Niqmat raat maqaaneh,maaqaaneey,qax maqaanel ken Foocittel tubleh",
  83025: "Ken taama abeenit,Gocoyuy isi Afeenaanat alifit yanik ken yafqen",
  83026: "Ilacabofan Miski siriy hanniy kaak iyya,taa meqe galatol Yalli kicnam taamitaa naah,kaa tayneeqebbem cabaanamal Qalalá qalaltay ",
  83027: "Taa alifit yan Maqab,Tasniim diqsitta Raceenat yangalime,aw yasgallen",
  83028: "Is Jannatak daga tan Raceenay,saafik caglah taniy Yallal xayyoweenit akak taa qube,gersi Moominiin teetik kalah taniimit agleh teetik taaqube",
  83029: "Diggah woo maray,Koroosinnak bagul akak yeneenimih sabbatah,umaane abe  anqasah,woo Moominiinih yen maral asaaluk yenen",
  83030: "Moominiinil taturanwaqdi,anqas kee ilaaqah,baali baalih intiitaa kee Miniina keenik casa ",
  83031: "Isinni Buxaaxih marafan yaduurenwak,koroosinnaa kee Moominiinil anqasi yyak amol akak yaniinimih afracuk yaduuren",
  83032: "Muslimiin yablenwak:diggah tamari isinni Abbobtih Diini cabenwak,Cakki Gitak makkooweeniti iyyen",
  83033: "Ta maxco iyyoonuh,Yalli ken taama dacrisoonuh awlautitih ken mahanna",
  83034: "Qhiyaamah Ayro Yallal yeemene mari,Addooniyal keenil akah asaaluk akah yenen innah Korosul yasuulen",
  83035: "Bilqimte Kaqaadiidih amol,waara Niqmatak Yalli gulguluh keenih heemih fan wagtan",
  83036: "Diggah Koros Addooniyal taamitak yenen isinni taamal,tayqunxuye digaalah gallatimen",
  84000: "Suuratul Inshiqhaaqh \nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nSahdaytu isi Rabbih fan yaduurem kassiisiiy,usuk le boolaa kee kay gurrih koraakoriyyih baxxaqsi elle yan  \n•    Tafsiiri:",
  84001: "Qaran Malaa-ika kaak obtuh fellaaqewak",
  84002: "Isi Rabbih massoowteh ankaciseh,woh kaak Cakki",
  84003: "Baaxo Arab akah xinkiyimannah Yalli tet xinkiyewak",
  84004: "Buuloo kee Raboytitik tet addat tanim iroh gasiyteeh,foyyah keenik raqte",
  84005: "Isi Rabbih massoweeh ankaciseeh,woh kaak Cakki",
  84006: "Sahdaytow-Khayri takuu,umaane takku,diggah atu taamite kinnito,Yalli elle   koo galataggidah,Qhiyaamah Ayro edde garaye kinnito",
  84007: "Sahdayti taamat amolladih yabba iyyewak,Qhiyaamah Ayro taamita marih :addaffaknu abeeh,iyyeh <br/> Faxe numuy isi taamah Waraak aw Kitab,migdi Gabak akah temcewweh  tugactek ",
  84008: "Sahlin cisaabah amceesebeleeh,akah anxibbixekkah kay taama,kaal xayyoowi mele",
  84009: "Isi Buxah mara fan ruffayeh yaduure",
  84010: "Faxe numuk kay taamah Kitab darreek,Gurak akah tamcawweh tu gactek  ",
  84011: "Isi Nafsil baatih deerisele",
  84012: "Jahannam Gira culeleeh,et laqna tammoosele ",
  84013: "Diggah usuk Addooniyal isi Buxah marih addal,Koroosinnaa kee maqsiyatak bagul akak yeneemil, farcatat yen ",
  84014: "Diggah usuk rabek wadiril,manofan maysduuram yekkele",
  84015: "Yeey,qimboh addah akah ginennah,Yalli manofan kaa gacisele,diggah kay Rabbi kay gurra yabli yekkeeh,tu kaak maqellitta, kay taamal kaa galatele",
  84016: "Yalli Ayro cultek wadiril, katul raaqa qisil xiibite",
  84017: "Bar kee kaat gaaboytimteemil xiibite",
  84018: "Alsi yanabbeh duddu baahaah,nagay Ifu lem yakkewakal xiibite",
  84019: "Sinaamey,Qunxuffeey,Dalboytaay,Cadoytaay,Manooy,Rabaay,ugutmal gurrak wadiril gurrat koretton ",
  84020: "!?Ta Koros Yallaa kee illacaboh Ayrol akah aaminewaanam,loonum macaay",
  84021: "!?Qhur-aan keenil kawsimawak isinni Rabbih makummutan",
  84022: "Inkinnah Koroosite mari,ken Farmoyti keenil baahem dirabboosaanah",
  84023: "Yalli ken Alilwa tabbixeemit ixxigah waakitah,ken taamak tu kaak maqellitta",
  84024: "Farmoytaw-dananissa digaalak ken qambaltam keenih waris",
  84025: "Woo maray Yallal yeemeneeh,meqe taama taamite akak raqqa iyyawak,oson   girqu sinni galato lon,is Jannata",
  85000: "Suuratul Buruuj \nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nYallih caylih baxxaqsuu kee usuk ummaanimit maroleeh,isih awlaytu akak  yekke mara cataah,isi Naqboytit gibduk yabbixem elle ten \n•    Tafsiiri:",
  85001: "Yalli Qaraanay Ayrooy,Alsaa kee ken Nammayak kalah taniimih arooca tabbi xel xiibite",
  85002: "Qhiyaamah Ayroy Gino edde kobxisuh xagnisel xiibite",
  85003: " Nabiy isi Ummatal sumaaqitah innah,ummaan sumaaqitel xiibite,Ummattay tet Nabi elle sumaaqitah innah,ummaan elle sumaaqiteenal xiibita",
  85004: "Woo maray Baaxo naba qanxixuh qanxise abaarimeh ",
  85005: "Gir edde uruseeniih,Moominiin Rooci liih edde qiden",
  85006: "Oson too Girak kibuk yan qanxixuk amol daffeyanwak ",
  85007: "Oson digaalaa kee biyaakak Moominiinik abaanamak garil yaniinimih sabbatah yableenih",
  85008: "Ta Koros Yallay maysooleeh,inkitti akak aysewaay, ummaanimil faylalih yanil yeemneenimiksah,Moominiinil qaybiseenim manol ",
  85009: "Woo Yalli Qarnwah Abbootan kee Baaxoh Abbootan dubuh le,usuk ummaa nimil boositaah,kay Naqoosah caagidik tu kaak maqellitta",
  85010: "Diggah woomaray,Lab Moominiin kee Say Moominiin dubuh Yallal yaaminee nimik,ken kalaanaggidah Girat digaalee,tokkeek isinni Zambittek Yallafan aduu reweenik,Qhiyaamah Ayro Jahannam digaala lon, Giraddigaalay ken carariissa lon,toh Moominiinit Giraccararisiyyak abeenimih gabaggacsa",
  85011: "Diggah woo maray Yallal yeemeneeh,meqe taamoomi taamitee,Jannatittey tet Kalqatittee kee Cooxuk guba Illaltitte akak gexxa lon,too galtoy Yalli gulguluh keenih hee,naba maysoy mayso tet bisle akak ane sinni",
  85012: "Farmoytaw-diggah uddur fanah yanay kaa iyyaway,Zaalimtuh ku Rabbih ma bbux caylale ",
  85013: "Diggah usuk  Ginoo kee digaala qimbiseeh,ken Nammay gacisele",
  85014: "Usuk faxe numuy isi Naqoosak yendebbeh cabe,diggah usuk Yallak meysita maray,awlaytu kaa haysiteeh isih Loyna akak yekke  kicna",
  85015: "Meqe Qarshi lí ",
  85016: ",Isi Naqoosak isih faxemarah qafu abaanamaay,isih faxemara digaalaanamak  isih faxem abé,kaay yisriye dirkisé mali",
  85017: "Farmoytaw-Cakki gaadaanaggidahaay,kaak hooroona tittikiyye Qandeh xaagi !?kol yemeetee",
  85018: "Firqawnaay,nagayna kaal tanay Saalic mari Samuuduuy le mara ",
  85019: "Tamara Iimaanak hortam,dirabbosse Ummatitteh Xaaguu kee bayisiyyak  ken geytem keenil amaatewayeh hinna,inkinnah oson isinni nabsiyyah katayyoh ken Farmoyti keenil edde yemeetem dirabboosaanah",
  85020: "Yalli ken taamat maroliiy loowé,teetik tu kaak mataftuca,teetil ken galatele",
  85021: "Qhur-aan dirabbooseenit akah intannah Qdar hinna,Qadra innah qariiba titta akak celta yab hinna,inkinnah usuk Qhur-aanay meqe",
  85022: "Korsiiyyaa kee makiyyaay,kaliyyaa kee osisiyyak daccarsime Luucih addal yan",
  86000: "Suuratu-Attaariqh \nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nYallig xiqtooy, Sahdayti ginoo kee kay gacisiyyat usuk le maroh baxxaqsi aw aybalaalaq elle yan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  86001: "Yalli Qaraanal xiibiteeh,Bar gexa Cutuktal xiibite",
  86002: "!?Farmoytaw-taa naba Cutuktih caagid-maca koo tiysixxige",
  86003: "Usuk Cutuktay,Qaran isi Ifuy habug iyyat ifisa  ",
  86004: "Qhiyaamah Ayroh cisaabah,tet taama dacrisa Mala ikaytu Yalli  awlaytuh elle heeh akkewaytek,Nafsi mayan",
  86005: "Yallih xiqtoo kee Sahdayti effer kaah baxxaqituh,Sahdayti Yalli macak kaa ginem cubbusay",
  86006: "Yalli kaqitto le Leey,Maganal caxittak kaa gine",
  86007: "Ta Lee Labhaytuk Roorakas Lafoofih fan kee Alil Lafoofuk tawqe",
  86008: "Diggah kaay yisriyey-too boolale Leek kaa ginee-kay rabak wadiril cisab kee galtoh kaa ugusam xiiqé",
  86009: "Qellittam gabbatimtu wayta Ayro,Sorkocoxxaylo niyaay,Sorko coxxayloh aama nittee kee teetik kalah tanim waqinal gacta Ayro,teetik meqe tiyaa kee uma tiya baxsimtah",
  86010: "Sahdayti woo Ayro,Yallih digaalak edde hoorima cayla mali, catoytay kaa cata mali",
  86011: "Yalli Roble Qaraanal xiibite,woh akah kinnim wakaak wakak lakal,kaale  kabuk ooba",
  86012: "Baaxoy taabukeemiiy,Caxammiruu kee Cooxuk tet addat taniimil bakaqtal xiibiteh",
  86013: "Diggah ta Qhur-aanay,Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay Mucammadal obbiime,Cakkii kee baatiliiy,nummaa kee dirab fan baxisa Yaaba",
  86014: "Digir kee Baatil hinna,inkinnah usuk nummaay Cakki",
  86015: "Diggah ken Farmoyti baahem dirabbooseenit,kay secto gacisoonuh,tet finqisoo nuh mango Date malisan",
  86016: "Anu Diini ifa abuuy,Baatil bayisuh,Date keenih haa ",
  86017: "Farmoytaw-yanoonay inxec-ta Koros dagooh gide yanoonay inxec,ken digaalaa kee ken baati massexeexin",
  87000: "Suuratul Aqlaa\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nNafsi Akheerammano kassiisaanaah,Addooniyawwanxexxeelittek tet saffoosaa nama aw yaysillimeenimi \n•    Tafsiiri:",
  87001: "Kaat yabtaah,kaa taynabewak,kay migaaqat yaabak,ku Rabbiy isi Ginok dagal fayyaye saytunnos",
  87002: " Yallay Sahdaytu massal gineeh,solsol kaak massooseh",
  87003: " Yallay Ginooy,tet Nadoodaay,tet qaynootaa kee weeloola cagguduseh ummaa nih Ginoytah kaah celtaah,kaat bicaleemih fan tirra hee ",
  87004: "Yallay Baaxok sin Saqi yaloolem yeyyaaqe ",
  87005: "Anxaxin akadak tenek wadiril,bokokay kafinaah,ditiffan qeggaye abe",
  87006: "Farmoytaw-Qhur-aan koo kawsiisenno,ku Aliilit kaa gaaboosennooh,kaa maha nnewta,hanneewe way baakeerih akah abak tenennah,kawsal Jibriilik maamaa kamin",
  87007: "Yalli isi Naggaarinnah akak hannewttam faxam akak raqqatawak,diggah kaay yisriye yaybulluyeenim kee qellisaanam yaaxigeh,wohuk tu kaak maqellitta",
  87008: "Jannat culussa taamoomik,Yalli kicna taama kol xammacoosenno ",
  87009: "Qhur-aanakkol oobisneemil Sinam kassitto ucuy,Kassisso tantaabbem fan ken kassis",
  87010: "Faxenumuy Yallak meysita ku kassissol kassitele,wohakah kinni kassittot  xoqoysimtam kaa",
  87011: "Korosti kassittok yaxxeexeeh,teetik kudah,wohakah kinnim Gira culaamak gexxaamah,Akheeral saami umaaneh lafitta iyyaanumu",
  87012: "Woo numuy Akheerâ Giray naba culaah,tet laqna tammoosaah,inki edde ceyita",
  87013: ",Tokkeek Giral waaraah,digaalak tammoosaamak yaffaafuh,tet addal marabaay meqe manoy ruftoleh mamannoowa",
  87014: "Faxe numuyYallat asgalliyyaa kee maqsiytak saytunnoowe faxximtaamal mayso geeh",
  87015: "Zikri qaynootay usuk Gita kaah abel isi Rabbbih galab xage,Salat tet aboona elle faxximta weelol abe",
  87016: "Inkinnah Addooniyammano taysukumen,ken Nammayih fanal naba tittak tatur yanih anuk,Akheeral tet muxxussaanah",
  87017: "Akheera edde xoyqoysimaanam kee salfoofih,aw salfa leemih Addooniyaa kee tet addal taniimik muxxuttaah,raagah lafittah,woh akah kinnim Niqmatak tet addal tanim inkinnah mataggiriqqa ",
  87018: "Diggah taa amritteetaa kee Xaagittek siinih galab akak xagnem,Qhur-aanak afal obbimte Kitoobah addal tan",
  87019: "Is nagayna ken Nammayal tanay Ibraahiim kee Muusal obbimte Kitooba ",
  88000: "Suuratul ghaashiyati \nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nAkheeraay,tet addal galtoo kee digaalak taniimih kassiisiiy,Yallih xiqtoh mascassoosi wagitaanam elle tan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  88001: "!?Farmoytaw-Sinam isi haggoogit buulta Qhiyaamâ Yab kol yemeetee",
  88002: "Qhiyaamah Ayro Sinam Saami umaytit akki,Busuuqa akki,Saami umaytit Fooci tte taqunxuyiiy,addah gaca ",
  88003: "Edde tet hirigan Katiinaa kee edde tamuxxuye axawittet,taqabiliiy,laclaacima",
  88004: "Too Foocitte laqin Giray,laqna akak tammossa culta",
  88005: "Lee laqna akak gibdi Raceenak yafqimen aw ken yafqen ",
  88006: "Shibriqh diqsitta taabukeemiy kaftawak Summi takkeeh,gaccata maaqoy abicih lafittata tekkeh akkewaytek,Maaqoy xagaana malon  ",
  88007: "Yakmí magabulaay,Qulul kaak mahorta",
  88008: "Busuuqaffooci woo Ayro Niqmatak edde garayeenimik gexxaamah,Niqmatleeh habug inta aw qaxmeqeeh ruftole",
  88009: "Isi taamay Addooniyal taamitte kicnah,diggah isi taamah galato buulumma teetih in the,dubleh gacteh geyte",
  88010: "Caddoo kee arac fayyo akakle Jannatih addal gacan ",
  88011: "Caraami Qangara taabbem hinnay,Jannatti addal Baatil kee digir qangara mataabba",
  88012: "Ta Jannatih addal,gexxa Raceenaaniiy,tet bakqisaanaah,isinnih faxinnaan innal beyaana aw haana tan",
  88013: "Tet addal fayyole Qarkaytooti tan",
  88014: "Obbimte Kobaabiy maqabah gulguluh tani addal akak tan",
  88015: "Tet addal baali baalifan rooruh akak heen makaddidi yan",
  88016: "Tet addal mango Fidooday,akkeey wokkel fidiseeni yan",
  88017: ",Yallii,Akheeral Saami umaytit kee busuuqâ tittak taturih gurrat yabba iyyewak Koros wagittoota,wohul Iimaanal elle yassacasseeniggidah,Ginê xiqtoo kee  kay Ginoh maqaanefan ken yuyfukune,toh Jannat culeenih,Busuuqak loowoh   :yanmara yakkoonuuy,iyyeh   <br/> Yalli mannal kaa gineeh,Sahdaytuh mannal kaa qanem caubbusiyyi wagittoh !?Gaala fan mawagitaanaa",
  88018: "Amottabuy daccarsime tikkatam fan,keenik amol mannal fayyaheeh,keenil !?maradaay,Qaraaraanaffan mawagtaana",
  88019: " Sinaamal lig intaamak mannal tet sooliseeh,Baaxo digga elle heem Qaleela fan !?mawagtaana",
  88020: "Mannal tet fidiseeh,Sinam tet amol tagxaxuh gulguluh tanim tet abeeh,Baaxofan !?mawagtaana",
  88021: "Ken kaay fayyayeh xiqtol tascasseemih fan wagtaanamal amrissa heewak,isi :Farmoyta yuyfukuneeh,iyyeh <br/> Farmoytaw- tamara kassis,Yallih digaalak ken meysis,koh tu gactek atu meysii se,ken kassissaamaksa kok faxximtam mali,Iimaanat ken koobaahisaanamah tu gactekiiy,woh dubuhYallih gabat tan",
  88022: "Iimaanal ken dirkissuh,ken amol xixxibaaneli aw ken amol gace hinnito",
  88023: "Takkay ikkah,keenik faxe numuy Iimaanat darre cabeeh,Yallaa kee kay Farmoy tal koroositee ",
  88024: "Tet addal elle waara Jahannam kaa culusiyyal,Qhiyaamah Ayro naba digaalah Yalli kaa digaalele",
  88025: "Diggah Ken Rabak wadiril,ken madaara dubuh nee fana",
  88026: "Tokkeek ken taamal cisab keenik abaanam dubuh nel tan,woh atu mantu,kok kalah inkitti mali",
  89000: "Suuratul Fajri\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nDikkak tatura marih illacaboh baxxaqsuuy,gabbati akah yakke naggaarinnaa kee Akheera kassiisaanam elle tan \n•    Tafsiiri:",
  89001: "Yallay yisriye Maacal xiibite",
  89002: "Qarfah Alsak qimbô Tabna Baral xiibite ",
  89003: "Tuk Namma qaynat tekkem kee Alluudah taniimil xiibite",
  89004: "Bari yemeeteeh,bisoh gexeeh,darre cabewakal xiibite,ta xiibah gacsi:isinni taamal gallatimetton iyyaanama",
  89005: "Too galab akak xaggiimeemil Daabirli aw Qaqhlili cayissa aw xiqta xiiba  !?maay tan",
  89006: "Farmoytaw-kay Farmoyta dirabboosenwak Qaad Huud marak mannal abem !?matablaa",
  89007: "Qaad kedo isi kaxxabba Iram,xexxallifan qiksimta",
  89008: "Woo kedoo tet bislem Yalli magininna ",
  89009: "Samuud Saalic marak ku Rabbi manninnal abeeh? woo marii Qalelwak xixxooqa qanxiseeh,Cijri diqsita aracal Buxaaxi teetik heen k ",
  89010: "?Firqawnay Sinam edde digaala kadeeda luk yenek,ku Rabbi mannal abeeh ",
  89011: "Ta mari inkih cayliinoo kee Zulmit dikkak tatureenih,ummaanih tii isi baaxol tature",
  89012: "Koroosinnaa kee maqsiyat fixixiseenimih sabbatah,tet addal umaane yeymeggen",
  89013: "Yalli isi digaalay gibda ken tammoysiise,Baaxok buxuxuuk ken sele",
  89014: "Farmoytaw-diggah ku Rabbi -Sinam taama xaguraah,wagitah,faxe numuy yey meeqe Jannatah galatuuy,yoysoomme num Girah galatu",
  89015: "Yalli bayise Ummatittel caylaa kee kalalul Niqmat elle gacem tekkewak,woo Niq mat keenil hayiyyi,Yalli keenik yikcineemih mascassa akkewaytam baxxa qiseeh:iyyeh  <br/> ,Sahdaytu tu gactek,usuk giniinok kayRabbi kaa gibbateeh,konnabna kaah abeeh Maalaay,Xalay kee Abbootan Niqmat kaal heek,toh Yalli garil kaah konnabna yakkaleeh:yi Rabbi kay konnabna cakkisitaamih sabbatah konnabna yoh abe iyya",
  89016: "Kaa gabbateeh,Rizqhi kaal ceenoosa kaa tekkee,diggah usuk woh isi Rabbil le  qunxiina yakkaleeh:yi Rabbi yoo yuqunxuyeh iyya",
  89017: "Bleey,caagid  ta Sahdayti isi mesenkacal akah miicisenna hinna,toh Niqmatitte Yalli isi Naqasuk kcinaamak mascassaay,umaane NaqasiYallal yuqunxuyeemih mascassa yakkale,inkinnah abinah tanim diggah isin Rizqhik Yalli siinih yecee mil Qayxixxu mataynaban",
  89018: "Baacoytay edde quukumam geewaa,yaskameenimil baali baali siinik malallaba ",
  89019: "Calaali akak dacrisekkah,boola lemarak Agabuu kee Qayxiixâ Cakkitte gibda makmoh takmen",
  89020: "Maalu mango kacanuh kicimton,kaal liton baakeerih,Yallih Gitah kaa aciyyak cillallowtaanah",
  89021: "Tah sin taama takkem mafaxximta,Baaxo gibda angoyyah tangayyeeh,lig inta wak kassita",
  89022: "Farmoytaw-isi Naqoosah fan baxisaggidah ku Rabbi yemeeteh,Malaa-ika rortitteh rooruh gaccateh temeeteh",
  89023: "Woo Ayro Jahannam Malcina Tabanih Alfih Santiita leeh,tameetimeh aw bah simtah,ummaanih Santiital Malcina Tabanih Alfih Malaa-ikaytu tet hirigta lih tan,too Ayro Sahdayti Yallih xaqul edde taturem kassitah,woo Ayro kassitto tu kaah ankek kaah xiqtah? woh akah kinnim galtoh Ayrokkah taamah Ayro hinna",
  89024: "Darraqqaggibdak gexxaamah:yokkolek Akheeral yimanoh meqe taama tatrusuteh aninniyoy,isiiy nummammano iyya",
  89025: "Woo Ayro Yallih digaalah innah tan digaalah inkitti madigaala,woh akah kinnim Yallih digaala gibdiih,raagtah",
  89026: "Tet addal Katiinat Korosut aba axawih innah yan axawah inkitti mayaxuya",
  89027: "Yalli Koros galatoh galab xaggaheewak,Moominiin galtoh galab xagot yaa  :beeh,iyyeh <br/> Moominti Nafsih tu gactekiiy,Rabiwak kee Qhiyaamah Ayro:Iimaan kee meqe taamaffan diggate aw sabhalalte Nafsey teetik yaxcen",
  89028: "Mango galatoy aggiriqe sinnik geytaamal,takcani tikka inxecay,meqe taamak   kaay yisriyeggaril luksugteemil tenkeecenné tikka inxecay ku Rabbi fan uduur ",
  89029: "Yi meqe Naqoosah addat ken loowot cul",
  89030: "Yi Jaannatay keenih gulguluh hee kenlih cul",
  90000: "Suuratul Balad \nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nSahdayti agxe aw tuddagna leeh,kay gibdaabinaa kee elle cattiima gititteh baxxaqsi aw aybalaalaq elle yan \n•    Tafsiiri:",
  90001: "Yalli Caram Baaxol xiibiteeh, is massakaxxale Makka",
  90002: "Farmoytaw-atu tet addal-faxe numuy qidim cakkisita qiddaah,faxe numuy axa wal seewah orbisaanam cakkisita, tuxuyeh seewah orbissam abtam koh xiaqtah aw koh calaali",
  90003: "Yallii, Sahdah Abbal xiibite,Baxak aw Xalaayak kay Cawaday kaak radel xiibite",
  90004: "Addooniyal gibdaabinak edde ceyitaamak gexxaamah,Diggah Sahdaytu taqabii kee gibdaabinat ginne",
  90005: "Sahdayt maqsiyat abek,kay Rabbiy kaa gine kinniimih,inkitti xiqto kaal mayaa !?llaay,cane kaak magacisam yakkalee ",
  90006: "Mango Maalay baali baalik amol tiqiri akak yani ecee iyya",
  90007: "Ta yaceemil tirtirisé Yalli kaa mayablam yakkalee?! usuk cisab kaak maabaa, !?ankek yedreeh?macat yeceeh",
  90008: "!?Ken Nammayat edde yable Namma Inti kaat mahannino",
  90009: "!?Arraabaa kee Namma Soktoy yaaba kaah mahannino",
  90010: "!?Khayri Gitaa kee Baatil Gita  kaa niysixxigeh ",
  90011: "Usuk kaak faxiimtam kaa kee Jannatfan baxissa Daaba aw gibdaabinitte yargi qeh teetik taturaama",
  90012: "Farmoytaw-Jannat culuh yargiqem faxximta Daaba aw gibdaabinitte maca koo !?tiysixxige",
  90013: "woh sayyowtu labboowu,Naqasi Filla curri abaanama",
  90014: "Aw Qulul yan Ayroy,Maaqoggeyto yeexegeenim edde takke yaskameemi",
  90015: "Abba wee Awkay ramad kaah le",
  90016: "Aw Baacoytay tuy kobra allewaa",
  90017: "Tokkeek Yallal yeemeneeh,Taaqa abaanamal,maqsiyatak yaadiyeenimil isinni ,yabbixeenimil,umaanel aw gabbatul yasbireenimil,baali baali akak farriimeeh Yallih Naqoosal racmataanamal baali bali akak farriime marak yan mara ye kken ",
  90018: "Too maray too weelol welloowe,oson Migdi mara",
  90019: "Woomaray ni Aayatittey ni Farmoytal obbimtel koroositee,oson Guri mara",
  90020: " Qhiyaamah Ayro alifle Giray addat akak digaalimaana ken amol tan",
  91000: "Suuratu-Ashshamsi\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nNafsi Taaqal saytunnoosaanam nabam kinniih,maqsiyatat tet xuunaanam baxay su kinnim,Qhur-aan addal xexxaanah lafittata xiibal diggoysiyyi elle yan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  91001: "Yalli Ayrol xiibite,Ayrommawqak is tewqek wadiril,fayyata udduurul xiibite",
  91002: "Is cultek wadiril tet raat katayawak,Alsal xiibita",
  91003: "Baaxô bagul ennatam isi Ifut waqinal haytawak,Loqol xiibite",
  91004: "Baaxô bagu buulla haah Dite yakkewak,Baral xiibite",
  91005: "Qaraanal xiibite,tet xisoy temqel xiibite",
  91006: "Baaxol xiibite,Sinam elle guubuh tet amol gactu fidseeh,tet fidisiyyal xiibite,",
  91007: "Ummaanih Nafsil xiibite,Yalli massat teetit abe Ginol xiibite",
  91008: "Barisiyya sinnim akak waasimtuh umam tet yiysixxige, abtuh meqem tet yiysi xxige ",
  91009: "Faxe numuy Isi Nafsi muxxooxal calloosak aw abak,umaaneenak tet foyyaysak saytunnoysee,diggah faxaamal mayso geeh",
  91010: "Faxenumuy isi Nafsi maqsiyat kee Zambittet teetit qellisak xuune,diggah baxaysite ",
  91011: "Yalli faxe numuy isi Nafsi maqsiyatittet xuuneeh,teetit qellissa hee numut   :yabba iyyewak,tohul celalloh Samuudut yaabeeh,iyyeh <br/> Samuud maqsiyatat radaanam kee Zambi taamitaanamal dikkak taturteemih sabbatah,isi Nabi Saalic dirabbosseh",
  91012: "Toh kaymari kaa elle uguugusek wadiril,keenik saami umaaneh gacca iyyanum soolewaka ",
  91013: "Nagayna kaal tanay Saalic Yallih Farmoyti:Yallih Alá caba,tet maqabih Ayroy is edde taaqube caba,umaaneh teetil maxayyoowina keenik iyye",
  91014: "Alâ caagidil isinni Farmoyta dirabbooseenih,keenik Saami umaaneh gacca iyya num,oson kicinuk tet qideh, Zambit agleytit yekken,Yalli isi digaala xakabba  keenil hee,ken Zambitteh sabbatah xongolot ken bayise,edde ken bayise digaa lal ken massosneh ",
  91015: "Yalli digaalak ken edde bayiseemiy keenik abe,kaay yisriye wohul kataytaamih meysi sinnim abe",
  92000: "Suuratu-Alleyli\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nIimaanaay acwal Ginoggurritteh baxxqsuu kee ummaan butta le gurri elle yan  \n•    Tafsiiri:",
  92001: "Baaxobbagu isi Ditet buulawak Yalli Baral xiibite",
  92002: "Baxxaqittah waqina aw ifa yakkewak Loqol xiibite",
  92003: "Isi ginoh Nammaqaynatal:Labtiyaa kee Saytiyal xiibite",
  92004: "Sinaamey-diggah sin taama sissinih,teetik maqaaneenay,Jannatti culmah sabab takke tan,umaaneenay Girâ culmassabab takke tan  ",
  92005: "Faxe numuy Zakaataay,macoo kee luuqusa aw kaffarak Yaceenim faxximtam yaceeh,Yalli akak kaawaaseemik daccarsimeh tu gactekii",
  92006: "Ciggiilisiyyak Yalli kaah xaganisem nummaaseh",
  92007: "Meqe taamaa kee Yallih Gitah yaceenim kaal xammacoosenno",
  92008: "Faxe numuy isi Maalal cillallooweeh,yaceem dirkih kaal tanim aceweeh tu gac tekiiy,Yallak isi Maalat gaddidooweh,kay muxxok Yalla tu messerinna",
  92009: "Ciggiilisiyyaay Yallih Gitah isi Maalu yaceenim galatok lem kee Yalli kaah xaganisem dirabbooseh",
  92010: "Umaanê taama kaal xammacoosenno,Khayri abaanam kaal asgibdiyenno",
  92011: "Finqiteeh Gira culewak,elle cillalloowe kay Maali tu kaah maduuda",
  92012: "Baatilik Cakki Gita baxxaqisaanam diggah nel tan",
  92013: "Diggah Akheerammano lem neey,Addooniyammano lem nee,ken Nammayih addal ninnih fanxem abna,nek kalah woh inkitti mali  ",
  92014: "Sinaamey-Yalla tiqsiyeenik urta Girak sin takkaawiseh",
  92015: ",Saami umaaneh lafittaya num akkewaytek,ta Girah laqna tammossam matan usuk Korosta",
  92016: ",Woh Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay Farmoyti baahem dirabboose numu Yallih amri xakabaanamat darre cabe numu ",
  92017: " ,Yallak meysili gibid teetik axxeeximele,Yalli kay taama yakcanay Abuubakri ta-Aayat kee tet wadirit taniimit yumcussube marak qimbô numu",
  92018: "Woo numuy Zambittek saytunnoowaggidah,maqaaneffoocittel aw gitittel isi Maalu yacee",
  92019: "Isi Maaluk yaceem inkitti kaah abe Niqmatih gabaggacsah mayacaa",
  92020: "Isi Maalak yaceemit,isi Ginoh amol fayyaye Rabbih Foocaksah faxam mali ",
  92021: "Meqe galatok Yalli kaah yacuuwaam akcinele",
  93000: "Suuratu-Adhdhucaa\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nKay caagidik qimboo kee illacabol,Yalli isi Nabiyyih le dacayrih baxxaqsi  elle yan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  93001: "Yalli Ayrok qimbol xiibite",
  93002: "Dite raddaah,Sinam angoyyak satta intawak Baral xiibite",
  93003: "Yallat tasgallo Wacyi yeedeyewak akah intannah,Farmoytaw-ku Rabbi-koo macabinna,koo manqibinna",
  93004: "Kok Addooniyabbuxak,Akheerabbuxa Khayrih tayseh,toh tet addal yan Niqma tay,inki yaniih aggiriqqe sinnik gexxaama   ",
  93005: "Mangoh tan galatoy aggiriqqe sinnik, koo kee ku Ummatah,koh yeceem kee ku Ummattah yeceem ikcinna haytam fan,ku Rabbi koh aceele  ",
  93006: "Diggah qunxuu tiyah Abba akak rabeh koo gee,kaxxa ku Abba Qabdul muttalib koh xuwaawiseeh,tokkeek ku Qammi Abu taalib keltimeena aw edde qikittakke koh abe",
  93007: "Kitab maca kinnim,Iimaan maca kinnim mataaxigaay koo gee.wohuk aaxaguk sugewaytem koo yiysixxige",
  93008: "Baacoytah koo geeh,koo gaddiseh",
  93009: "Faxe numuy qunxiinal Abbaweellih gexsit maysaammin,kaa masqunxuyin",
  93010: "Agxele esseré maxiixiyin",
  93011: "Yalli kol hee Niqmat faatitaay,teetit yab",
  94000: "Suuratu-Ashsharci \nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nYallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay Yallih Farmoytal qellita Niqmat kaal duudusiyyal maqaane kaal hee\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  94001: "Diggah Alil koh fakneeh,Wacyi tabsiyya aw hirgiyya koo fan neykeeceneh",
  94002: "Ku Zambik taturtem koh cabneh,Iggimah uddurih quukay edde tene kok luuqus neh",
  94003: "Woo quukay ku Xiixox yaggilem xayyaowwa iyyam fan  koo taqbise",
  94004: ",Ku galab xago amo koh abne,aw ku galab xago fayya hayne,diggah Azaanaay Iqhaamaa kee ken Nammayak kalah taniimil galab kok xaggiimaah maacisse",
  94005: "Diggah gibdaa kee ceenallih,xamcaay,faraggaa kee fakim yan",
  94006: "Diggah gibdaa kee ceenallih,xamcaay,faraggaa kee fakim yan,toh teexegek ku mari aza kol anabewaytay,Yallafan seecaanamak koo hoorewaytay",
  94007: "Ku taamak gaba kaltwak,teetik orobtek,ku Rabbih Qibaadat ingiicilley",
  94008: "Ku fayxii kee macsaba dubuh Yallafan hay",
  95000: "Suuratu-Attiin \nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nYalli Sahdaytul hadliyyaa kee Gino kaak yaymaaqeeh,illacabô Farmo duudu siyyal Niqmat kaal hee\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  95001: "Falastiin Baaxoh adday,nagayna kaal tanay Qiisa elle rubbuusumek,Yalli  Balas kee kay ubkah aracal xiibite,Zeytuun kee tet ubkah aracal xiibite",
  95002: "Siinâ Qaley nagayna kaal tanay isi Nabi Muusa,garil akak garaysel xiibite ",
  95003: "Makki Caram Baaxoy tet cule num amaan elle geyaah,Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay Mucammad addal akak rubbuusumel xiibite",
  95004: "Diggah Sahdaytu massah lafitta,miicuh muxxutta inta weelot geysisne",
  95005: "Tokkeek Addooniyal,idoolinnaa kee sabar fan kaa gacisnaah,Giniino akak yoy soommeeh,Girah yekkek akah edde xoqoysimewaannah,isi Dagarat maxoqoy sima",
  95006: "Yallal yeemeneeh,meqe taamooma taamita mari akak raqqa iyyawaka,diggah ,woo mariiy idoolitaanamah,aggiriqqe sinni inki tan galato lon,woh Jannata  woh akah kinnim oson isinni giniino saytunnooseenih",
  95007: "Sahdaytow-kay xiqtol mango astooti tublek wadiril,galtoh Ayro dirabbossam !?koo absissam macaay",
  95008: "Yalli-Qhiyaamah Ayro galtoh Ayro abiyyal,madqa abak Qadlih lafitta iyya   madqa abe hinnaa?! meqem abe maqaaneh galataah,umeena umaaneh galatam abekkah,Yalli kenfan meklekkah,isi Naqoosah fan annaak cabam kasah aw !?Qaqhlih takkee ",
  96000: "Suuratul Qalaqh \nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nSahdayti Wacyil Tirrayam kee kaxxamariinoo kee iggimal makkootaamak fanat yan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  96001: "Farmooytaw-ku Rabbiy inkih tan Gino gineh migaaqal fakak,Yalli kol oobisa Wacyi kawis ",
  96002: " Sahdaytu,Qunxuffeh yenek wadiril,yigribe Qabalak gine",
  96003: "Farmoytaw-Yalli koofan oobisa Wacyi kawis,ku Rabbiy cindah fulaley cinda   lí cindi kay cindat maxayi,usuk cin daa kee maqaane mango",
  96004: "Woo Yalli Kalamat fiirisaanaah,yaktubuuni barise",
  96005: "Sahdaytu aaxigewaak yenem barise",
  96006: "Cakkiik aw nummaak uma Sahdaytuy,Jahli Abbah innah yani Yallih dikkak taturiyyal,dikkak taturah",
  96007: "Abbootan kee Maalak kay garil taniimit gadditem isik yubleemih taaga",
  96008: "Sahdaytow-diggah Qhiyaamah Ayro madaara ku Rabbifanaay,ummaanih mara cakkisitaanamah galatele",
  96009: "9-10Jahli Abbay,Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay ni Naqasi Mucammad  !?Kaqbâ garil yissiliyewak,waasah caagidik cakkumuh lafittam maay tuble",
  96010: "9-10Jahli Abbay,Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay ni Naqasi Mucammad  !?Kaqbâ garil yissiliyewak,waasah caagidik cakkumuh lafittam maay tuble",
  96011: "Ta waasime aw waasan num,isi Rabbik Tirtoo kee ixxigâ bagul yan num  !?yekkekhay maay tuble",
  96012: "Aw Sinam kay amritte xakabaanam kee kay waasoosak waaliyaanamal Yallak !?meysil amrisa yekkekii,caagid tanna akak yekke num waasimaa",
  96013: "Tawaase Farmoyti baahem dirabbooseeh,darre edde cabewak Tublee,Yallak !?ma meysita",
  96014: "Ta Naqasu Salaatak waasé,Yalli usuk abam yableeh,tu kaak maqellittam !?amayaaxiga",
  96015: "Caagid ta iggimali moyyal isik akah miicisenna hinna,ni Naqasih azaa kee kaa dirabboosaanamak aadiyeweek,qanxaffet Girafan hirrigsime tikka iyyeh,Amok Gomboh, kaa abbixenno",
  96016: "Too Gombolí, maxcal dirabli, abinal hoxeena",
  96017: "Digaalak kaa catoonah keenit cattiisimu,Amok Gombot inxibbixxayeh Girafan hirrigsimawak,isi waday kee isi daffey nah marah seecay ",
  96018: "Nanu Malaa-ikak Jahannamal daanah yan gibdi maray,ken edde amriseemil Yalla aqsiye sinniih,edde ammirsimtem abtah seecenno,Namma buttak caylaa kee xiqtoh anni Butta lafittam wagitay",
  96019: "Koo umaaneh gufiyyal caagi ta umeeni akah yekkelenna hinna,amril waasol kaa maateeqin,Yallah kummut,Taaqal kaal xayyow,diggah is kaa fan xayyossa ",
  97000: "Suuratul Qhadri\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nNabna le Bar aw Leylatul Qhadri barih muxxoh baxxaqsi elle yan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  97001: "Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay, Nabil Ramadhaan Alsak konnabna le Bar aw Leylatul Qhadri bar oobisiyya akah qimbisnennah,Qhur-aan Addooniyâ Qaran fan inki adda oobisne",
  97002: "!?Nabiyow-ta Barat Khayrii kee Barkatak tanim taaxigeh innaa",
  97003: "Ta Bari Khayri akak naba Bara,faxe numuy teetit taniimil aamanukuuy,tet gee yyo iyyeh loowita sooleh,alfi Alsak Khayrih raqta",
  97004: "Rizqhi tekkek,aw Raba tekkek,aw ubka tekkek,aw wohuk kalah taniimik ummaa nimiy Yalli too Liggidih addat meklel,isinni Rabbiy yisriyeh idnih Malaa-ika obtaah,nagayna kaal tanay Jibril tet addat ooba  ",
  97005: "Taa Barkat le Barii,teetik qimbok xabba haanamaay,Maaci bukka iyyeh teetik illacabo fan,usuk inkih Khayrih yan Bara",
  98000: "Suuratul Bayyina \nMadiinah imi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nMucammad Farmoh duddaa kee tet qidiinoh baxxaqsi elle yan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  98001: "Woo maray Yahuuduuy,Nasaaraa kee Yallat tasgallok Koroositee,isinnih inkih elle kobxeeniih, titta elle geen Koroosinnak,baxxaqqale alhum kee qado mas cassa keenil ammatamfan baxsimeenit makkinnon",
  98002: "Taa baxxaqqale mascassaa kee qado aw ifale alhum,usuk Yallih garik yan Farmoytay,saytunnowte Kitoobay saytunnoowe marâ kalih mari xagewaa kawisu keenil ruube",
  98003: "Too Kitoobah addal nummâ Xaagitteetaa kee Qadli madqooqi tan,Sinam kee  nik tummiqit kee massa edde tanim fan tascasse",
  98004: "Yalli isi Nabiyyi ken fan ruubek wadiril tekkeh akkewaytek,Yahuuduy Tawraat akah temcewweey,Nasaaray Injiil akah temcewwe titta mawanna,keenik islaa mittem tan,kaadu keenik kay Nabiyyih numma yeexegeh anuk,isi Koroosinnat bisoh intem tan",
  98005: "Yahuuduuy, Nasaarah umaanee kee cina ifah tambulluye,toh diggah oson ta  Qhur-aanih addal dubuh Yalla inkittoosaanaah,Yallat yasgalleenimik waali yaanaah,Salat soolisaanam kee Zakaat yaceenimik isinni Namma Kitaabih  addal elle ammirsimeenim tekkeh akkewaytek akiimil mammirsiminnon,edde ammirsimeenim,usuk massale Diiniy mako addat aalle sinni",
  98006: "Diggah woomaray Yahuuduuy,Nasaaraa kee Yallat tsgallok Koroositee-tet ,addal waarak Qhiyaamah Ayro Jahannam cule lon,too mari Yallal koroositeeh kay Farmoyta dirabbooseemih sabbatah,oommate Gino aw Sharri Gino",
  98007: "Diggah woomaray Yallal yeemeneeh,meqe taamooma taamitee, too mari Khay ri Gino",
  98008: "Ken galto ken Rabbiy yisriyeeh fayyayeh garil,Jannatittey tet Kalqatittee kee Cooxuk guba Illaltitte akak gexxa,tet addal inki yaadiyen,kaal yee meneeniih  kaa yeteeqeenimil Yalli keenik raabiteh,isi Racmattak ken xagiseemil aw gey sii seemil kaak rabiteenih,ta racmatta faxenumuy isi Rabbik meysiteeh,kay amri xakabeeh,kaywaasok waaliye tet geya",
  99000: "Suuratu-Azzalzala \nMadiinah imi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nQhiyaamah Ayroh haggaa kee tet cisable suuqinan kassiisaanama\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  99001: "Baaxo Qhiyaamah Ayro teetit yakke naba angoyyah tengayye wak",
  99002: "Baaxo raboytit kee wohuk kalah taniimik tet bagih addat tanim teyyeeqeh",
  99003: "Sahdayti agihninuk:Baaxo akah tangayyeeh,lig edde intam macaay?! iyye",
  99004: "Too naba Ayro,khayrii kee umaanek tet bagul abeenim Baaxo warissah",
  99005: "Woh akah kinnim,Yalli tet yiysixxigeeh,wohul tet amrise",
  99006: "Too naba Ayroy Baaxo edde tangayye,Sinam cisab aracak isinni taama Addoo niyal taamiteeni yableeniggidah,butta buttah yawqen",
  99007: ",Faxe numuy Khayrii kee maqaanê taamoomak qunxuu xuuneytah gide taamitaa isi foocal yable",
  99008: "Faxe numuy uma taamoomak,qunxuu xuuneytah gide taamita tonnah ablele",
  100000: "Suuratul Qaadiyaat\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nSahdaytu angaddiyyaa kee baakeerik,Akheera kaa kassiisak,takkaawisiyyi elle yan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  100001: "Yalli Ardiyyi gibdak gexxaamah,tet ufuyuk xongolo akak ontoobba intam fan tarde Faarisil xiibite",
  100002: "Xeet xagtawak teetit abta iqtah gibdak gexxaamah,isi xokconot aw Ibaabut  Gira urussa Faarisil xiibite",
  100003: "Maaci uddur Naqboytit gaadda aw wararta Faarisil xiibite",
  100004: "Isi ardat Siisa tesgeyye",
  100005: "Isi Faroosa leela Naqboytay kobxek gudet hayte ",
  100006: "Diggah Sahdayti kay Rabbi kaak faxa Khayri kalité",
  100007: "Usuk Khayri kalitaamal sumaaqah isih yan,le baxxaqqak gexxaamah kaa yan gaddem maduuda",
  100008: "Diggah usuk Maalul lekacnih dikkak taturuh,kaal cillalloowah",
  100009: "9-10Taa Addooniyammanol duquuruma Sahdayti,Yalli raboytiitik Qhubuurut tanim uguseeh,cisab kee galatoh Baaxok ken yeyyeeqeeh,Yalli Sorkocoxxayloh addat tanim niyaay,aamanitteey,wohuk kalah tanim ifa abah baxxaqisawak,kaa !?qambaltam mayaaxigaa",
  100010: "9-10Taa Addooniyammanol duquuruma Sahdayti,Yalli raboytiitik Qhubuurut tanim uguseeh,cisab kee galatoh Baaxok ken yeyyeeqeeh,Yalli Sorkocoxxayloh addat tanim niyaay,aamanitteey,wohuk kalah tanim ifa abah baxxaqisawak,kaa !?qambaltam mayaaxigaa",
  100011: "Too Ayro diggah ken Rabbi ken yaaxagi,kay Naqoosah caagidik tu kaak maqe llittaay,elle ken galatele",
  101000: "Suuratul Qhaariqa\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nSorkocoxxaylobboqto,Qhiyaamah Ayroh haggaa kee tet miizanittel Sinam le gurra sinnil baahaanam elle tan \n•    Tafsiiri:",
  101001: "Tet haggah nabnak gexxaamah Sinam Sorkocoxxaylo boq hayta aw taagure Saaqata",
  101002: "!?Taa tet haggah nabnat Sinam Sorkocoxxaylo boq haytam ma Saaqataay",
  101003: "Farmoytaw-tet haggah nabnat Sinam Sorkocoxxaylo boq haytam masaaqat kinnim maca koo tiysixxige?!diggah is Qhiyaamah Ayro",
  101004: "Sinam Sorkocoxxaylo boq edde tanxaccuwayta Ayroy,akkeey wokkel habayta haadah innah edde yakken ",
  101005: "Qalelwa gexoo kee angoyyi sissaakek gexxaamah,fakam faken tafuluh yan  dagor aw Suufih inna takke",
  101006: "Kay meqe taama,kay uma taamal akak fulte numuh tu gactekii  ",
  101007: "Usuk Jannatti addal geya meqe manoh gaca",
  101008: "Kay uma taama,kay meqe taamal akak fulte numuh tu gactekii ",
  101009: "Kay Guubuuy,kay agxaxih arac Qhiyaamah Ayro Jahannama",
  101010: "!?Farmoytaw-is maca kinnim maca koo tiysixxige",
  101011: "Is laqna gibdi Gira",
  102000: "Suuratu-Attakaasuru\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nAddooniyâ tassamaggoo kee aylahita,maysaguq kee cisab kassiisaanama\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  102001: "Sinaamey-Maaluu kee Xaylol titirisaanam,Yallih taaqak sin agxisseh",
  102002: "Isin rabbaay, isinni Maysaguq aw Qhubuur cullataanam fan",
  102003: "Yallih Taaqak teetil tirtirisiyyi sin agxisam ceelak mana,too agxitiyyih illacabo aaxigetton",
  102004: "Tokkeek kay illacabo aaxigetton",
  102005: "Cakkiik isin,diggah Yallah fan uguteenit kinnitoonum asmatah taaxigeenim akki nna,usuk sin taamal sin galatelem taaxigeenim akkinna,Maaluu kee Xaylol tirti risaanamat agxitak mananniton",
  102006: "Yalla yok takkay aw wallaahi Qhiyaamah Ayro Gira abletton ",
  102007: "Tokkeek asmatle mabuluy,bohoy edde anewaah tet abletton ",
  102008: "Tokkeek too Ayro Qaafiytaay,Gaddaliinoo kee ken Nammayak kalah taniimik Yalli siinil hee Niqmtak sin esserele",
  103000: "Suuratul Qasri\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nBaxysuk edde cattiiman sababitte\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  103001: "Kaay yisriye Qasri uddurul xiibite",
  103002: "Diggah Sahdayti nakusii kee baatit yan",
  103003: "Woomaray Yallal yeemeneeh,kay Farmoytitil yeemeneeh,meqe taamoomi taa miteeh,baali baali Cakkil akak farriimeeh,Cakkil yasbireenimil farriime akak raqqa iyyawak,ta weeloolal welloowe mariiy,isinni Addooniyah manoo kee Akheeral cattiimeeniti aw yisillime mara",
  104000: "Suuratul Hamaza \nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nMaali mangal duquurumak,Moominiinil anqasaanamak takkawsimaanama\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  104001: "Sinam cami yaymaggeeh,keenit mudiyya yaymagge num,le umaanee kee gibda digaalay",
  104002: "Woo numuy agxe akak Maalu gaaboysaah,loowaama,tohuksah agxe mali",
  104003: "Kay Maalay usuk gaaboose rabak kaa cateleeh,Addooniyammanol waarelem yakkale",
  104004: "Caagid ta iggimali isi mesenkacal akah miicisenna hinna,Jaha nnam Giray le umaaneh gibdah sabbatah,tet addat qiddiiminnaanim kaataagureeh,taggilet ga ssiyimele",
  104005: "Farmoytaw-taa teetit gasiyiminnaanim buruka abtam ma Gira kinnim maca koo !?tiysixxige",
  104006: "Diggah is Yallih Giray urta",
  104007: "Sinam Dagaaraak  Sorkocoxxaylo fan keenik tabta ",
  104008: "Diggah is tet addal digaalimeenitil alifit tan",
  104009: "Teetik awqewaanaggidah,Makaadoy aw Qandittey xinkimteeh xeexih addat yanin",
  105000: "Suuratul Fiili\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nKay Buaxay caram tekkel,Date abamaral Yallih xiqtoo kee mabbuxih gibdah baxxaqsi elle yan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  105001: "Farmoytaw-ku Rabbi Abarahaay,kay marii Dakanwammaraay, Kaqba yaggilee !?nim faxenwak mannal keenik abem mataaxigaa",
  105002: "Diggah Yalli tet yaggaloonah aben ken uma abto finqittem abe,Sinam Kaqbak makaanamak loowiteenim magennon,tu teetik maxaginnon",
  105003: "Buttaati buttaatih keenil temeete Kimbir keenil ruube",
  105004: "Kallak Xeet tekke Xeetit ken garriyta",
  105005: "Yalli Buqrê Caffay Saqi yokmeh edde yeeqeteh inna ken abe",
  106000: "Suuratu Qhureeysh \nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nYalli Qhureyshi amol hee Niqmat kee Yalli keenil le Cakkih baxxaqsi elle yan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  106001: "Qhureeysh qaadaa kee ken elle baritih taagah",
  106002: "Amaanah Giilal Yamanfan aban gaqaadiyyah,Cagay Shaamfan aban gaqaadiyya",
  106003: "Dubuh ta Caram Buxah Rabbi yaqbudoonay,woo Rabbiy ta gaqaadiyya keenih xammacooseh,inkittu kaat asgallewoonay",
  106004: "Woo Yalli qululuk ken yoskomeh,meysik amaan ken abe,toh Caram yaynabee nim kee kaal guubuh yan mara yaynabeenimik,Qrab Sorkocobbaxat heemi",
  107000: "Suuratul Maaquun\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nDiini dirabbooseenit weeloh baxxaqsu\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  107001: "!?Woo Qhiyaamah Ayroh galto dirabboosé teexegee",
  107002: "Usuk woo numuy,Qayxixxu akak agxitaamak gibduk gutqa ",
  107003: "Baacoyta yaskameenimil,Isi Nafsi malallaba,isik kalih mara malallaba",
  107004: "4-5Salat abamari le baatii kee digaalay,woo marii,isinni Salaatak ayla hita,tet uddur gaba kalla haam fan caagid edde malon",
  107005: "4-5Salat abamari le baatii kee digaalay,woo marii,isinni Salaatak ayla hita,tet uddur gaba kalla haam fan caagid edde malon",
  107006: " Woo marii,isinni Salat kee isinni taamat yoo-ubula aban,taama Yallah maca ggaloosan",
  107007: "  Cateenik biyak edde anewaamal,isinni kkalih marak cato hooran",
  108000: "Suuratul Kawsar\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nYallii, Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay,isi Nabiyyil mango Khayri kaal heem kee,kaak kalkaaliyyi Niqmat kaal heemih baxxqsisiyyi elle yan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  108001: "Farmoytaw-nanu mango Khayri koh nece,wohuk tiyak teeni,Jannatal yan Kaw sar diqsita  Daqaara aw Illalta",
  108002: " Yallat tasgallo isinni Xeet kee Cooxut xayyowtoomuh masgaadak abaanamak saduh,dubuh kaah tassilliyeeh,tasguudeemil,Ta Niq matittel Yallah fatta ab ",
  108003: "Diggah koo yinqibé aw ku Naqboyti,ummaanih Khayrik yiggiriqqeey,habbeeli mey,galab akak xaggiimek umaaneh akak xaggiima, tiggiriqqem kaa",
  109000: "Suuratul Kaafiruun\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nKoroosinnaa kee kay marak bari yakkeenimi\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  109001: "Farmoytaw-:Yallal koroosite maraw inxec",
  109002: "Xeet kee Cooxuk taqbudeenim awak maqbuda,foocaffan maqbuda",
  109003: "Isin anu aqbudem taqbudo hinniton,usuk dubuh Yalla",
  109004: "Anu isin Xeet kee Cooxuk taqbudeenim,yaqbudi hinniyo",
  109005: "Isin anu aqbudem taqbudo hinniton,usuk dubuh Yalla",
  109006: "Isin isinni Nafsih bicsitten Diini liton,anu Yalli yol oobise inni Diini liy",
  110000: "Suuratu-Annasri\nMadiinah imi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nYallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay,Nabi maysoo kee Frmoh illacabo aw alif kinniimih aydukumusiyyi elle yan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  110001: "Farmoytaw-ku Diinih Yallih catooy, kaa aynabiyyi yemeeteeh,Makki fakim yekkek",
  110002: "Sinam Islaaminnat ergak wadril erga culah tublek",
  110003: ",Toh atu elle rubbuusumte caagid gabakkaltih xayyooweemik asta kinnim ixig maysoo kee fakim Niqmatih faatitiyyah ku Rabbi faylal iysiriy,cabsot kaak gorris,diggah usuk yandabbiiy,isi Naqoosak mandabba oggola yekke,keenih cabah",
  111000: "Suuratul Masad \nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nLahab Abbaa kee kay Qasaalah baxaysih baxxaqsi elle yan\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  111001: "Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay Nabik,Qammi Lahab Abba,Qabdul mutta  lib Baxi kaytaama finqitteemik gexxaamah,kay Namma Gaba baxaysitteh,toh Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaaltanay Nabih aza yekkeh yeneeh,kaytaama baddaa himteh  ",
  111002: "Kay Maaluu kee Xalay maca kaah duddeeh? ken Nammay digaala kaak mahori nnon,racmatta kaah mabaahinnon",
  111003: "Qhiyaamah Ayro urale Gira culele, tet laqna tammoosele",
  111004: "Kay Qasaala Jamiil Inay,Yallih Salat kee nagayna kaal tanay,Nabî Gital kee  nan qidak,aza kaah akkuk tene tet culele",
  111005: "Fillat teetik qayxi meqe akattay,Girafan edde wakkayimta le",
  112000: "Suuratul Ikhlaas \nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nYalli Qibaadaa kee duddal dubbooweeh,Baxaa kee Abbaay,is ceelek saytu nnooweh \n•    Tafsiiri:",
  112001: "Farmoytaw-:Yallii,usuk Qibaadal aw Yalliinol inkittooweeh,kaaksah Yalli mayan ixec ",
  112002: ",Usuk maddaraay,duddi weeloolaa kee qaxmaqaanel maddarinni kaat yaadiye Gino agxek kaafan qikitta",
  112003: ",Woo Yallay inkittu xaleweeh,inkitti kaa maxalooy,kaay yisriye Baxa maliiy Abba mali",
  112004: "Isi Ginot kay bisli maallo,aw lem makko ",
  113000: "Suuratul Falaqh\nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nUmaanek Yallat daccarsimaanamal lallabaanama\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  113001: "Farmoytaw-:Maaci Rabbit daccarsima,kaat maggansita inxec  ",
  113002: "Ginok aza takkeemih umaanek",
  113003: "Baaxol gexxam kee Garaaqak Bar tawqeemih azak Yallat maggansita",
  113004: "Say Baab abeenitiy,kuntuubut qunxuf edde yan fuftoh fuf intak,kaat daccarsima",
  113005: "Kuuxewaynanlí,kuuxewaynan edde kaa gutqam taamitawakih umaanek kaat daccarsima",
  114000: "Suuratu-Annaas \nMakkiimi\n•    Ta-Suurat tumcussubeemik baali:    \nSaheetan umaanee kee kay bohoy hayiyyak,Yallat maggansitaanamal lallabaanama\n•    Tafsiiri:",
  114001: "Farmoytaw-:Sinam Rabbit daccarsimaah,kaat maggansima inxec",
  114002: "Sinam Abba,isih faxxa haam keenil taamita,kaak kalah gersi Abba malon",
  114003: "Cakkiik ken yamqubbudi,kaak kalah Cakkih yamqubbudi malon",
  114004: ",Sheetanay isi bohoyto Sahdayti Yallih galab xagok aylahitawak kaal gasiyah kaa kassitawak wadirih kaal gacah umaanek",
  114005: "Isi bohoyto Sinam Sorkocoxxaylo fan qida",
  114006: "Usuk Ginnik akah yan innah Sahdak yanih",
};

String? getTafsirMokhtasarAfar(int surah, int ayah) => _mokhtasarAfar[surah * 1000 + ayah];